#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/client-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade Clients"
msgstr "Pemutakhiran Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/client-intro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Clients use the versioning system of their underlying operating system.  For "
"clients using {suse} operating systems, you can perform upgrades within the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Klien menggunakan sistem penomoran versi dari sistem operasi dasarnya. Untuk klien yang menggunakan sistem operasi {suse}, Anda dapat melakukan pemutakhiran melalui {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/client-intro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about upgrading clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang pemutakhiran klien, lihat xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connect {payg} instance"
msgstr "Menghubungkan instans {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:2
msgid "In the major public cloud providers (AWS, Azure), SUSE:"
msgstr "Pada penyedia cloud publik utama (AWS, Azure), SUSE:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:3
msgid "provides customized {payg} product images for SLES, SLES for SAP, etc."
msgstr "menyediakan citra produk {payg} yang disesuaikan untuk SLES, SLES for SAP, dll."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:4
msgid ""
"operates per-region RMT Servers mirroring repositories for products "
"available as {payg}"
msgstr "mengoperasikan Server RMT per wilayah yang mencerminkan repositori untuk produk yang tersedia sebagai {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This document describes how to connect existing {payg} instance to "
"{productname} server, and gives basic information about credentials "
"collection from the instance.  The goal of this connection is to extract "
"authentication data so the {productname} Server can connect to a cloud RMT "
"host.  Then the {productname} Server has access to products on the RMT host "
"that are not already available with the {scc} organization credentials."
msgstr "Dokumen ini menjelaskan cara menghubungkan instans {payg} yang ada ke server {productname}, dan memberikan informasi dasar tentang pengumpulan kredensial dari instans tersebut. Tujuan dari koneksi ini adalah untuk mengekstrak data autentikasi sehingga Server {productname} dapat terhubung ke host RMT cloud. Kemudian Server {productname} memiliki akses ke produk pada host RMT yang belum tersedia dengan kredensial organisasi {scc}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:6
msgid "Before using {payg} feature make sure that:"
msgstr "Sebelum menggunakan fitur {payg}, pastikan bahwa:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The {payg} instance is launched from the correct SUSE product image (for "
"example, SLES, SLES for SAP, or SLE HPC) to allow access to the desired "
"repositories"
msgstr "Instans {payg} diluncurkan dari citra produk SUSE yang benar (misalnya, SLES, SLES for SAP, atau SLE HPC) untuk memungkinkan akses ke repositori yang diinginkan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:8
msgid ""
"{productname} Server has connectivity to the {payg} instance (ideally in the "
"same region) either directly or via a bastion"
msgstr "Server {productname} memiliki konektivitas ke instans {payg} (idealnya di wilayah yang sama) baik secara langsung atau melalui bastion"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:9
msgid ""
"A basic {scc} account is required. Enter your valid {scc} credentials in "
"menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials]. This account is "
"required for accessing the {productname} client tools for boostrapping "
"regardless of {payg} instances."
msgstr "Akun {scc} dasar diperlukan. Masukkan kredensial {scc} Anda yang valid di menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials]. Akun ini diperlukan untuk mengakses alat klien {productname} untuk bootstrap terlepas dari instans {payg}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:10
msgid ""
"If you bootstrap the {payg} instance to {productname}, it will disable its "
"{payg} repositories then add repositories from where it mirrored the data "
"from the RMT server. The final result will be {payg} instances acquiring the "
"same repositories from the RMT servers but through the {productname} server "
"itself. Of course repositories can still be setup primarily from SCC."
msgstr "Jika Anda melakukan bootstrap instans {payg} ke {productname}, instans tersebut akan menonaktifkan repositori {payg}-nya lalu menambahkan repositori dari tempat ia mencerminkan data dari server RMT. Hasil akhirnya adalah instans {payg} memperoleh repositori yang sama dari server RMT tetapi melalui server {productname} itu sendiri. Tentu saja repositori masih dapat diatur terutama dari SCC."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connecting {payg} instance"
msgstr "Menghubungkan instans {payg}"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Connecting new {payg} instance"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menghubungkan instans {payg} baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > {payg}], "
"and click btn:[Add {payg}]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, navigasikan ke menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > {payg}], dan klik btn:[Add {payg}]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:14
msgid "Start with the page section [guimenu]``{payg} connection Description``."
msgstr "Mulailah dengan bagian halaman [guimenu]``{payg} connection Description``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:15
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Description`` field, add the description."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``Description``, tambahkan deskripsi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:16
msgid "Move to the page section [guimenu]``Instance SSH connection data``."
msgstr "Pindah ke bagian halaman [guimenu]``Instance SSH connection data``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Host`` field, enter the instance DNS or IP address to "
"connect from {productname}."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``Host``, masukkan DNS atau alamat IP instans untuk terhubung dari {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSH Port`` field, enter the port number or use default "
"value 22."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``SSH Port``, masukkan nomor port atau gunakan nilai default 22."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``User`` field, enter the username as specified in the "
"cloud."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``User``, masukkan nama pengguna seperti yang ditentukan di cloud."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:20
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Password`` field, enter the password."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``Password``, masukkan kata sandi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:21
msgid "In the [guimenu]``SSH Private Key`` field, enter the instance key."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``SSH Private Key``, masukkan kunci instans."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase`` field, enter the key "
"passphrase."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase``, masukkan frasa sandi kunci."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:23
msgid "Authentication keys must always be in PEM format."
msgstr "Kunci autentikasi harus selalu dalam format PEM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:24
msgid ""
"If you are not connecting directly to the instance, but via SSH bastion, "
"proceed with <<proc-adding-ssh-bastion-connection-data>>."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak terhubung langsung ke instans, tetapi melalui bastion SSH, lanjutkan dengan <<proc-adding-ssh-bastion-connection-data>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:25
msgid "Otherwise, continue with <<proc-finishing-payg-connecting>>."
msgstr "Jika tidak, lanjutkan dengan <<proc-finishing-payg-connecting>>."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding SSH bastion connection data"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menambahkan data koneksi SSH bastion"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:27
msgid "Navigate to the page section [guimenu]``Bastion SSH connection data``."
msgstr "Navigasikan ke bagian halaman [guimenu]``Bastion SSH connection data``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:28
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Host`` field, enter the bastion hostname."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``Host``, masukkan nama host bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:29
msgid "In the [guimenu]``SSH Port`` field, enter the bastion port number."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``SSH Port``, masukkan nomor port bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:30
msgid "In the [guimenu]``User`` field, enter the bastion username."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``User``, masukkan nama pengguna bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:31
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Password`` field, enter the bastion password."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``Password``, masukkan kata sandi bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:32
msgid "In the [guimenu]``SSH Private Key`` field, enter the bastion key."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``SSH Private Key``, masukkan kunci bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase`` field, enter the bastion key "
"passphrase."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase``, masukkan frasa sandi kunci bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:34
msgid "Complete the setup process with <<proc-finishing-payg-connecting>>."
msgstr "Selesaikan proses penyiapan dengan <<proc-finishing-payg-connecting>>."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Finishing {payg} connecting"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyelesaikan koneksi {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:36
msgid "To complete adding new {payg} connection data, click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "Untuk menyelesaikan penambahan data koneksi {payg} baru, klik btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:37
msgid "Return to {payg} connection data [guimenu]``Details`` page."
msgstr "Kembali ke halaman [guimenu]``Details`` data koneksi {payg}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:38
msgid ""
"The updated connection status is displayed on the top section named "
"[guimenu]``Information``."
msgstr "Status koneksi yang diperbarui ditampilkan pada bagian atas bernama [guimenu]``Information``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Connection status is shown in [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > "
"Pay-as-you-go`` screen too."
msgstr "Status koneksi juga ditampilkan di layar [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Pay-as-you-go``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:40
msgid ""
"If the authentication data for the instance are correct, the column "
"[guimenu]``Status`` shows \"Credentials successfully updated.\""
msgstr "Jika data autentikasi untuk instans benar, kolom [guimenu]``Status`` menampilkan \"Credentials successfully updated.\""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:41
msgid ""
"If the invalid data are entered at any point, the newly created instance is "
"shown in [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > {payg}``, with column "
"[guimenu]``Status`` displaying error message."
msgstr "Jika data yang tidak valid dimasukkan pada titik mana pun, instans yang baru dibuat ditampilkan di [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > {payg}``, dengan kolom [guimenu]``Status`` menampilkan pesan kesalahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:42
msgid ""
"As soon as the authentication data is available on the server, the list of "
"available products is updated."
msgstr "Segera setelah data autentikasi tersedia di server, daftar produk yang tersedia diperbarui."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Available products are all versions of the same product family and "
"architecture as the one installed in the {payg} instance.  For example, if "
"the instance has the {sles}{nbsp}15 SP1 product installed, {sles}{nbsp}15 "
"SP2, {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3, {sles}{nbsp}15 SP4 and {sles}{nbsp}15 SP5 are "
"automatically shown in [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Products``."
msgstr "Produk yang tersedia adalah semua versi dari keluarga produk dan arsitektur yang sama dengan yang diinstal di instans {payg}. Misalnya, jika instans memiliki produk {sles}{nbsp}15 SP1 yang diinstal, {sles}{nbsp}15 SP2, {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3, {sles}{nbsp}15 SP4, dan {sles}{nbsp}15 SP5 secara otomatis ditampilkan di [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Products``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Once the products are shown as available, the user can add a product to "
"{productname} by selecting the checkbox next to the product name and "
"clicking btn:[Add product]."
msgstr "Setelah produk ditampilkan sebagai tersedia, pengguna dapat menambahkan produk ke {productname} dengan memilih kotak centang di sebelah nama produk dan mengklik btn:[Add product]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:45
msgid ""
"After the success message you can verify the newly added channels in the "
"{webui}, by navigating to [guimenu]``Software > Channel List > All``."
msgstr "Setelah pesan sukses, Anda dapat memverifikasi saluran yang baru ditambahkan di {webui}, dengan menavigasikan ke [guimenu]``Software > Channel List > All``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:46
msgid ""
"To monitor the syncing progress of each channel, check the log files in the "
"[path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync`` directory on the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Untuk memantau progres sinkronisasi setiap saluran, periksa file log di direktori [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync`` pada Server {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:47
msgid ""
"If a product is provided by both the {payg} instance and one of the {scc} "
"subscriptions, it will appear only once in the products list."
msgstr "Jika produk disediakan oleh instans {payg} dan salah satu langganan {scc}, produk tersebut hanya akan muncul sekali di daftar produk."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:48
msgid ""
"When the channels belonging to that product are synced, the data might still "
"come from the SCC subscription, and not from the Pay-As-You-Go instance."
msgstr "Ketika saluran yang menjadi milik produk tersebut disinkronkan, data mungkin masih berasal dari langganan SCC, dan bukan dari instans Pay-As-You-Go."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance credential collect status"
msgstr "Status pengumpulan kredensial instans"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:50
msgid ""
"{productname} server uses credentails collected from the instance to connect "
"to the RMT server and to download the packages using reposync.  These "
"credentials are refreshed every 10 minutes by taskomatic using the defined "
"SSH connection data. Connection to RMT server always uses the last known "
"authentication credentials collected from the {payg} instance."
msgstr "Server {productname} menggunakan kredensial yang dikumpulkan dari instans untuk terhubung ke server RMT dan mengunduh paket menggunakan reposync. Kredensial ini diperbarui setiap 10 menit oleh taskomatic menggunakan data koneksi SSH yang ditentukan. Koneksi ke server RMT selalu menggunakan kredensial autentikasi terakhir yang diketahui yang dikumpulkan dari instans {payg}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:51
msgid ""
"The status of the {payg} instance credentials collect is shown in the column "
"[literal]``Status`` or on the instance details page.  When the instance is "
"not reachable, the credential update process will fail."
msgstr "Status pengumpulan kredensial instans {payg} ditampilkan di kolom [literal]``Status`` atau pada halaman detail instans. Ketika instans tidak dapat dijangkau, proses pembaruan kredensial akan gagal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:52
msgid ""
"When the instance is unreachable, the credential update process will fail "
"and the credentials will become invalid after the second failed refresh.  "
"Synchronization of channels will fail when the credentials are invalid.  To "
"avoid this keep the connected instances running."
msgstr "Ketika instans tidak dapat dijangkau, proses pembaruan kredensial akan gagal dan kredensial menjadi tidak valid setelah pembaruan kedua yang gagal. Sinkronisasi saluran akan gagal ketika kredensial tidak valid. Untuk menghindari hal ini, pertahankan instans yang terhubung agar tetap berjalan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:53
msgid ""
"{payg} instance remains connected to {productname} server unless SSH "
"connection data is explicitly deleted.  To delete the SSH connection data to "
"the instance, use <<proc-deleting-connection-data-to-instance>>."
msgstr "Instans {payg} tetap terhubung ke server {productname} kecuali data koneksi SSH dihapus secara eksplisit. Untuk menghapus data koneksi SSH ke instans, gunakan <<proc-deleting-connection-data-to-instance>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:54
msgid ""
"{payg} instance may not be accessible from the {productname} server at all "
"times."
msgstr "Instans {payg} mungkin tidak dapat diakses dari server {productname} setiap saat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:55
msgid ""
"If the instance exists, but is stopped, the last known credentials will be "
"used to try to connect to the instance."
msgstr "Jika instans ada, tetapi dihentikan, kredensial terakhir yang diketahui akan digunakan untuk mencoba terhubung ke instans."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:56
msgid "How long the credentials remain valid depends on the cloud provider."
msgstr "Berapa lama kredensial tetap valid tergantung pada penyedia cloud."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:57
msgid ""
"If the instance no longer exists, but is still registered with SUMA, its "
"credentials are no longer valid and the authentication will fail."
msgstr "Jika instans tidak ada lagi, tetapi masih terdaftar di SUMA, kredensialnya tidak lagi valid dan autentikasi akan gagal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:58
msgid "The error message is shown in the column Status."
msgstr "Pesan kesalahan ditampilkan di kolom Status."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:59
msgid ""
"The error message only indicates that the instance is not available.  "
"Further diagnostics about the status of the instance needs to be done on the "
"cloud provider."
msgstr "Pesan kesalahan hanya menunjukkan bahwa instans tidak tersedia. Diagnostik lebih lanjut tentang status instans perlu dilakukan pada penyedia cloud."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Any of the following actions or changes in the {payg} instance will lead to "
"credentials failing:"
msgstr "Salah satu dari tindakan atau perubahan berikut pada instans {payg} akan menyebabkan kredensial gagal:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:61
msgid "removing zypper credentials files"
msgstr "menghapus file kredensial zypper"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:62
msgid "removing the imported certificates"
msgstr "menghapus sertifikat yang diimpor"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:63
msgid "removing cloud-specific entries from [path]``/etc/hosts``"
msgstr "menghapus entri khusus cloud dari [path]``/etc/hosts``"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {payg} system as a client"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan sistem {payg} sebagai klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:65
msgid ""
"You can register a {payg} instance from where you harvest the credentials as "
"a {salt} client.  The instance needs to have a valid cloud connection "
"registered, otherwise it will not have access to channels.  If the user "
"removes the cloud packages, the credentials harvesting may stop working."
msgstr "Anda dapat mendaftarkan instans {payg} tempat Anda mengambil kredensial sebagai klien {salt}. Instans perlu memiliki koneksi cloud yang valid terdaftar, jika tidak maka tidak akan memiliki akses ke saluran. Jika pengguna menghapus paket cloud, pengambilan kredensial mungkin berhenti bekerja."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:66
msgid ""
"First set up the {payg} instance to collect authentication data, so it can "
"synchronize the channels."
msgstr "Pertama-tama atur instans {payg} untuk mengumpulkan data autentikasi, sehingga dapat menyinkronkan saluran."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:67
msgid ""
"The rest of the process is the same as for any non-public-cloud client and "
"consists of synchronizing channels, automatic bootstrap script creation, "
"activation key creation and starting the registration."
msgstr "Sisa prosesnya sama seperti untuk klien non-cloud publik mana pun dan terdiri dari sinkronisasi saluran, pembuatan skrip bootstrap otomatis, pembuatan kunci aktivasi, dan memulai pendaftaran."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:68
msgid ""
"For more about registering clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang pendaftaran klien, lihat xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting "
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah "

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checking the credentials"
msgstr "Memeriksa kredensial"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:71
msgid ""
"If the script fails to collect the credentials, it should provide a proper "
"error message in the logs and in the {webui}."
msgstr "Jika skrip gagal mengumpulkan kredensial, seharusnya memberikan pesan kesalahan yang sesuai di log dan di {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:72
msgid ""
"If the credentials are not working, [literal]``reposync`` should show the "
"proper error."
msgstr "Jika kredensial tidak berfungsi, [literal]``reposync`` seharusnya menampilkan kesalahan yang sesuai."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using [literal]``registercloudguest``"
msgstr "Menggunakan [literal]``registercloudguest``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:74
msgid ""
"Refreshing or changing the [literal]``registercloudguest`` connection to the "
"public cloud update infrastructure should not interfere with the credentials "
"usage."
msgstr "Menyegarkan atau mengubah koneksi [literal]``registercloudguest`` ke infrastruktur pembaruan cloud publik seharusnya tidak mengganggu penggunaan kredensial."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:75
msgid ""
"Running [literal]```registercloudguest --clean`` will cause problems if no "
"new cloud connection is registered with the cloud guest command."
msgstr "Menjalankan [literal]``registercloudguest --clean`` akan menyebabkan masalah jika tidak ada koneksi cloud baru yang terdaftar dengan perintah cloud guest."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-50-52.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy Migration from 5.0 to 5.2"
msgstr "Migrasi Proxy dari 5.0 ke 5.2"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-50-52.adoc:2
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-51-52.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Pendahuluan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-50-52.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This document provides the tested and validated procedures for migrating "
"both the **host operating system** and the **proxy extension** in "
"environments managed by **{productname}**, specifically targeting systems "
"deployed with **{productname} Proxy 5.0**."
msgstr "Dokumen ini menyediakan prosedur yang telah diuji dan divalidasi untuk memigrasikan baik **sistem operasi host** maupun **ekstensi proxy** di lingkungan yang dikelola oleh **{productname}**, secara khusus menargetkan sistem yang diterapkan dengan **{productname} Proxy 5.0**."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-50-52.adoc:4
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-51-52.adoc:4
msgid "The upgrade scenarios covered include:"
msgstr "Skenario pemutakhiran yang dibahas meliputi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-50-52.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Migrating from **SUSE Linux Enterprise Micro (SLE Micro) 5.5** to **SL Micro "
"6.2**"
msgstr "Migrasi dari **SUSE Linux Enterprise Micro (SLE Micro) 5.5** ke **SL Micro 6.2**"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-50-52.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Migrating from **SUSE Linux Enterprise Server (SLES) 15 SP6** to **SLES 15 "
"SP7**"
msgstr "Migrasi dari **SUSE Linux Enterprise Server (SLES) 15 SP6** ke **SLES 15 SP7**"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-50-52.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Upgrading the **{productname} Proxy Extension** from **version 5.0** to "
"**version {productnumber}**"
msgstr "Memutakhirkan **Ekstensi Proxy {productname}** dari **versi 5.0** ke **versi {productnumber}**"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-50-52.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Before migrating the proxy, it is required to first migrate the SUSE Manager "
"5.0 Server to {productname} {productnumber}."
msgstr "Sebelum memigrasikan proxy, diperlukan untuk pertama-tama memigrasikan Server SUSE Manager 5.0 ke {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-50-52.adoc:9
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-50-52.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "{sle-micro} 5.5 to {sl-micro} 6.2"
msgstr "{sle-micro} 5.5 ke {sl-micro} 6.2"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-50-52.adoc:10
msgid ""
"This section provides the tested procedure to upgrade a {sle-micro} 5.5 host "
"deployed with {productname} 5.0 Proxy to {sl-micro} 6.2 with {productname} "
"{productnumber} Proxy."
msgstr "Bagian ini menyediakan prosedur yang telah diuji untuk memutakhirkan host {sle-micro} 5.5 yang diterapkan dengan {productname} 5.0 Proxy ke {sl-micro} 6.2 dengan {productname} {productnumber} Proxy."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-50-52.adoc:11
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-50-52.adoc:74
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-51-52.adoc:11
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/proxy/proxy-mlm-51-52.adoc:69
