#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-50-52.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribution Upgrade and Server Migration from 5.0 to 5.2"
msgstr "Pemutakhiran Distribusi dan Migrasi Server dari 5.0 ke 5.2"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-50-52.adoc:2
msgid "{productname} 5.0 must be stopped before the upgrade."
msgstr "{productname} 5.0 harus dihentikan sebelum pemutakhiran."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-50-52.adoc:3
msgid ""
"During a migration the server SSL certificate and CA chain are copied from "
"the source server, meaning that only the database certificates are required"
msgstr "Selama migrasi, sertifikat SSL server dan rantai CA disalin dari server sumber, yang berarti bahwa hanya sertifikat database yang diperlukan"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-50-52.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{productname} 5.0 peripheral servers are always using third-party SSL "
"certificates.  If the hub server has generated the certificates for the "
"peripheral server, it needs to generate the certificate for the peripheral "
"database too."
msgstr "Server periferal {productname} 5.0 selalu menggunakan sertifikat SSL pihak ketiga. Jika server hub telah menghasilkan sertifikat untuk server periferal, server tersebut perlu menghasilkan sertifikat untuk database periferal juga."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-50-52.adoc:5
msgid ""
"On the hub server, run the following command for each of the peripheral "
"server to migrate."
msgstr "Pada server hub, jalankan perintah berikut untuk setiap server periferal yang akan dimigrasikan."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-50-52.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"  --set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"  --set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=<hostname>-reportdb --set-cname=\"example.com\" "
"--set-cname=db --set-cname=reportdb\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"  --set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"  --set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=<hostname>-reportdb --set-cname=\"example.com\" --set-cname=db --set-cname=reportdb\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-50-52.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The files to use will be inside the server container and need to be copied "
"to the new peripheral server host:"
msgstr "File yang akan digunakan berada di dalam kontainer server dan perlu disalin ke host server periferal baru:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-50-52.adoc:8
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:10
msgid "[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT`` as the root CA,"
msgstr "[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT`` sebagai CA root,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-50-52.adoc:9
msgid ""
"[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/<hostname>-reportdb/server.crt`` as the db "
"certificate and"
msgstr "[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/<hostname>-reportdb/server.crt`` sebagai sertifikat db dan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/migrations/server/server-mlm-50-52.adoc:10
msgid ""
"[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/<hostname>-reportdb/server.key`` as the db "
"certificate's key."
msgstr "[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/<hostname>-reportdb/server.key`` sebagai kunci sertifikat db."

