#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Proxy Air-gapped Deployment"
msgstr "Penerapan Proxy {productname} Terisolasi Jaringan (Air-gapped)"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:2
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is air-gapped deployment?"
msgstr "Apa itu penerapan terisolasi jaringan (air-gapped)?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:3
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:3
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Air-gapped deployment refers to the setup and operation of any networked "
"system that is physically isolated from insecure networks, especially the "
"internet.  This type of deployment is commonly used in high-security "
"environments such as military installations, financial systems, critical "
"infrastructure, and anywhere sensitive data is handled and must be protected "
"from external threats."
msgstr "Penerapan terisolasi jaringan mengacu pada penyiapan dan pengoperasian sistem berjaringan apa pun yang terisolasi secara fisik dari jaringan yang tidak aman, terutama internet. Jenis penerapan ini umum digunakan di lingkungan keamanan tinggi seperti instalasi militer, sistem keuangan, infrastruktur kritis, dan di mana pun data sensitif ditangani dan harus dilindungi dari ancaman eksternal."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:4
msgid "At the moment, air-gapped deployment is available only on {sl-micro}."
msgstr "Saat ini, penerapan terisolasi jaringan hanya tersedia di {sl-micro}."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:5
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy with Virtual Machine"
msgstr "Terapkan dengan Mesin Virtual"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:6
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The recommended installation method is using the provided {productname} "
"Virtual Machine Image option, since all the needed tools and container "
"images are pre-loaded and will work out of the box."
msgstr "Metode instalasi yang direkomendasikan adalah menggunakan opsi Citra Mesin Virtual {productname} yang disediakan, karena semua alat dan citra kontainer yang diperlukan telah dimuat sebelumnya dan akan berfungsi langsung."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about installing {productname} Proxy Virtual Machine, "
"see xref:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc[Deploy Proxy "
"as a Virtual Machine]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang menginstal Mesin Virtual Proxy {productname}, lihat xref:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc[Terapkan Proxy sebagai Mesin Virtual]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:8
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:20
msgid ""
"To upgrade {productname} Proxy, users should follow the procedures defined "
"in xref:container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc[Proxy Upgrade]."
msgstr "Untuk memutakhirkan Proxy {productname}, pengguna harus mengikuti prosedur yang didefinisikan di xref:container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc[Pemutakhiran Proxy]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:9
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy {productname} on {sl-micro}"
msgstr "Terapkan {productname} di {sl-micro}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:10
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:11
msgid ""
"{productname} also provides all the needed container images in RPM's that "
"can be installed on the system."
msgstr "{productname} juga menyediakan semua citra kontainer yang diperlukan dalam RPM yang dapat diinstal pada sistem."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Install {productname} on {sl-micro} in Air-gapped"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal {productname} di {sl-micro} dalam mode Terisolasi Jaringan (Air-gapped)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:12
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:14
msgid "Install {sl-micro}."
msgstr "Instal {sl-micro}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:13
msgid "Bootstrap the Proxy Host OS as a Client on {productname} Server."
msgstr "Bootstrap OS Host Proxy sebagai Klien di Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:14
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:15
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:30
msgid "Update the system."
msgstr "Perbarui sistem."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Install tools packages and image packages (replace $ARCH$ with the correct "
"architecture)"
msgstr "Instal paket alat dan paket citra (ganti $ARCH$ dengan arsitektur yang benar)"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transactional-update pkg install mgrpxy* mgrctl* "
"suse-multi-linux-manager-5.2-$ARCH$-proxy-*\n"
msgstr "transactional-update pkg install mgrpxy* mgrctl* suse-multi-linux-manager-5.2-$ARCH$-proxy-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:17
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:18
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:39
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:42
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:32
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:14
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:43
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:22
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:28
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:42
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:48
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:25
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:27
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:21
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:7
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:10
msgid "Reboot."
msgstr "Reboot."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:18
msgid "Deploy {productname} with mgrpxy."
msgstr "Terapkan {productname} dengan mgrpxy."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For more detailed information about installing {productname} Proxy on "
"{sl-micro}, see "
"xref:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc[Deploy Proxy as a "
"Virtual Machine]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih rinci tentang menginstal Proxy {productname} di {sl-micro}, lihat xref:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc[Terapkan Proxy sebagai Mesin Virtual]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Formula images"
msgstr "Citra formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:22
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Some formulas, like Bind and DHCP (Kea), also use containers.  If you plan "
"to use them in an air-gapped environment, you need to pull their images, "
"save them to an archive, and load them on your {productname} Proxy or "
"another managed system."
msgstr "Beberapa formula, seperti Bind dan DHCP (Kea), juga menggunakan kontainer. Jika Anda berencana menggunakannya di lingkungan terisolasi jaringan, Anda perlu menarik citra mereka, menyimpannya ke arsip, dan memuatnya pada Proxy {productname} atau sistem terkelola lainnya."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:23
msgid "The images are available from `registry.suse.com`."
msgstr "Citra tersedia dari `registry.suse.com`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Getting formula images for air-gapped environments"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mendapatkan citra formula untuk lingkungan terisolasi jaringan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:25
msgid "On a system with Internet access, pull the required images."
msgstr "Pada sistem dengan akses Internet, tarik citra yang diperlukan."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman pull registry.suse.com/suse/bind:latest\n"
"podman pull registry.suse.com/suse/kea:2.6\n"
msgstr ""
"podman pull registry.suse.com/suse/bind:latest\n"
"podman pull registry.suse.com/suse/kea:2.6\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:27
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "Save the images to a TAR archive:"
msgstr "Simpan citra ke arsip TAR:"

#. type: delimited block -
