msgstr "Mengonversi Klien ke Proxy MLM"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:2
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:2
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Ringkasan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:3
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This chapter describes how to convert a client system into a {productname} "
"Proxy using the {webui}."
msgstr "Bab ini menjelaskan cara mengonversi sistem klien menjadi Proxy {productname} menggunakan {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:4
msgid ""
"It assumes that the proxy host system has already been bootstrapped, is "
"subscribed to the base operating system channel (such as {sles} 15 SP7 or "
"{sl-micro} 6.2) and to the Proxy Extension channel."
msgstr "Bab ini mengasumsikan bahwa sistem host proxy telah di-bootstrap, berlangganan saluran sistem operasi dasar (seperti {sles} 15 SP7 atau {sl-micro} 6.2) dan saluran Ekstensi Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:5
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For information about client onboarding, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang onboarding klien, lihat xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:7
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Before starting the conversion, ensure the following requirements are "
"fulfilled."
msgstr "Sebelum memulai konversi, pastikan persyaratan berikut terpenuhi."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported Systems"
msgstr "Sistem yang Didukung"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Only the following operating systems are currently supported for proxy "
"conversion:"
msgstr "Hanya sistem operasi berikut yang saat ini didukung untuk konversi proxy:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:11
msgid "{sl-micro} 6.1"
msgstr "{sl-micro} 6.1"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:12
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Must Be"
msgstr "Klien Harus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:13
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid "Already onboarded in {productname}"
msgstr "Sudah di-onboard di {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:14
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid "Reachable via the network"
msgstr "Dapat dijangkau melalui jaringan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:15
msgid "Subscribed to the appropriate proxy extension channel:"
msgstr "Berlangganan saluran ekstensi proxy yang sesuai:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:16
msgid "{productname} Proxy Extension 5.2 (matching architecture)"
msgstr "{productname} Proxy Extension 5.2 (arsitektur yang cocok)"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:17
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preparation"
msgstr "Persiapan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:18
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Before proceeding with the proxy conversion, make sure the following "
"preparations are completed to avoid interruptions during the conversion "
"process."
msgstr "Sebelum melanjutkan dengan konversi proxy, pastikan persiapan berikut selesai untuk menghindari gangguan selama proses konversi."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:19
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSL Certificates"
msgstr "Sertifikat SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:20
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Valid SSL certificates are required to secure communication between the "
"proxy and other components."
msgstr "Sertifikat SSL yang valid diperlukan untuk mengamankan komunikasi antara proxy dan komponen lainnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:21
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid "You need:"
msgstr "Anda memerlukan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:22
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The public certificate of the Certificate Authority (CA) that signed the "
"certificate on the {productname} server"
msgstr "Sertifikat publik Otoritas Sertifikat (CA) yang menandatangani sertifikat pada server {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:23
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:17
msgid "A certificate for the proxy."
msgstr "Sertifikat untuk proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:24
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid "The corresponding private key for the proxy certificate."
msgstr "Kunci privat yang sesuai untuk sertifikat proxy."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:25
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If your CA uses an intermediate certificate chain, you must include all "
"intermediate certificates as well."
msgstr "Jika CA Anda menggunakan rantai sertifikat perantara, Anda harus menyertakan semua sertifikat perantara juga."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:26
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid ""
"If you are not using third party certificates, you can generate them using "
"the `rhn-ssl-tool` inside the {productname} container."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak menggunakan sertifikat pihak ketiga, Anda dapat membuatnya menggunakan `rhn-ssl-tool` di dalam kontainer {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:27
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate a proxy certificate"
msgstr "Membuat sertifikat proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:28
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid "On the {productname} server host, run:"
msgstr "Pada host server {productname}, jalankan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:29
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=\"<PROXY-FQDN>\" \\\n"
"  --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\"\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=\"<PROXY-FQDN>\" \\\n"
"  --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:30
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For more information about other parameters, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang parameter lain, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:31
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:25
msgid "Transfer the certificates to {productname} server host"
msgstr "Transfer sertifikat ke host server {productname}"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:32
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/<PROXY-FQDN>/server.crt "
"/root/proxycert.pem\n"
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/<PROXY-FQDN>/server.key "
"/root/proxykey.pem\n"
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT /root/rootca.pem\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/<PROXY-FQDN>/server.crt /root/proxycert.pem\n"
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/<PROXY-FQDN>/server.key /root/proxykey.pem\n"
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT /root/rootca.pem\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:33
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:27
msgid ""
"To confirm the exact folder where the certificates and key files were "
"generated, you can list the directories with:"
msgstr "Untuk mengonfirmasi folder tepat tempat sertifikat dan file kunci dibuat, Anda dapat mendaftarkan direktori dengan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:34
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- ls -ltd /root/ssl-build/*/\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- ls -ltd /root/ssl-build/*/\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Transfer the certificates from the {productname} server host to your local "
"machine or other target system:"
msgstr "Transfer sertifikat dari host server {productname} ke mesin lokal Anda atau sistem target lainnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"scp <MLM-FQDN>:/root/proxycert.pem ./\n"
"scp <MLM-FQDN>:/root/proxykey.pem ./\n"
"scp <MLM-FQDN>:/root/rootca.pem ./\n"
msgstr ""
"scp <MLM-FQDN>:/root/proxycert.pem ./\n"
"scp <MLM-FQDN>:/root/proxykey.pem ./\n"
"scp <MLM-FQDN>:/root/rootca.pem ./\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:37
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Packages Preparation"
msgstr "Persiapan Paket"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:38
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:38
msgid ""
"It is recommended to deploy the container images as RPM packages. Please "
"ensure the following packages are installed on the client:"
msgstr "Disarankan untuk menerapkan citra kontainer sebagai paket RPM. Pastikan paket berikut diinstal pada klien:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:39
msgid "suse-multi-linux-manager-5.2-<ARCH>-proxy-httpd-image"
msgstr "suse-multi-linux-manager-5.2-<ARCH>-proxy-httpd-image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:40
msgid "suse-multi-linux-manager-5.2-<ARCH>-proxy-salt-broker-image"
msgstr "suse-multi-linux-manager-5.2-<ARCH>-proxy-salt-broker-image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:41
msgid "suse-multi-linux-manager-5.2-<ARCH>-proxy-squid-image"
msgstr "suse-multi-linux-manager-5.2-<ARCH>-proxy-squid-image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:42
msgid "suse-multi-linux-manager-5.2-<ARCH>-proxy-ssh-image"
msgstr "suse-multi-linux-manager-5.2-<ARCH>-proxy-ssh-image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:43
msgid "suse-multi-linux-manager-5.2-<ARCH>-proxy-tftpd-image"
msgstr "suse-multi-linux-manager-5.2-<ARCH>-proxy-tftpd-image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:44
msgid ""
"You can install these packages from the {webui} by navigating to the "
"[literal]``Software`` > [literal]``Packages`` > [literal]``Install`` tab, "
"then searching for the packages above, and installing them."
msgstr "Anda dapat menginstal paket ini dari {webui} dengan menavigasikan ke tab [literal]``Software`` > [literal]``Packages`` > [literal]``Install``, lalu mencari paket di atas, dan menginstalnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:45
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For details on air-gapped deployment, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc[]"
msgstr "Untuk detail tentang penerapan terisolasi jaringan, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc[]"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:46
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup Proxy Client"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Klien Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:47
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:42
msgid "Navigate to the client's [literal]``Overview`` page."
msgstr "Navigasikan ke halaman [literal]``Overview`` klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:48
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:43
msgid "Click button btn:[Convert to Proxy]."
msgstr "Klik tombol btn:[Convert to Proxy]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:49
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:44
msgid "Confirm you were redirected to the proxy configuration form."
msgstr "Konfirmasi Anda diarahkan ke formulir konfigurasi proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:50
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:45
msgid ""
"This page can be accessed later from the [literal]``Details`` > "
"[literal]``Proxy`` > [literal]``Configuration`` tab."
msgstr "Halaman ini dapat diakses nanti dari tab [literal]``Details`` > [literal]``Proxy`` > [literal]``Configuration``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:51
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:46
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Proxy[Configuration] and fill in the "
"required data:"
msgstr "Di {webui}, navigasikan ke menu:Proxy[Configuration] dan isi data yang diperlukan:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:52
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Proxy"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:53
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:48
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Parent FQDN`` field, type the fully qualified domain name "
"for the parent server or proxy."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``Parent FQDN``, ketik nama domain lengkap untuk server atau proxy induk."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:54
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:49
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Proxy SSH port`` field, type the SSH port on which the SSH "
"service is listening on the {productname} Proxy. It is recommended to keep "
"the default: 8022."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``Proxy SSH port``, ketik port SSH tempat layanan SSH mendengarkan pada Proxy {productname}. Disarankan untuk tetap menggunakan default: 8022."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:55
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size`` field, type the maximum allowed "
"size for the Squid cache, in Gigabytes."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size``, ketik ukuran maksimum yang diizinkan untuk cache Squid, dalam Gigabyte."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:56
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:51
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Proxy admin email`` field, type the administrator's email "
"address."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``Proxy admin email``, ketik alamat email administrator."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:57
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:52
msgid ""
"In the [literal]``Certificates`` section, provide the certificates for the "
"{productname} Proxy, obtained in the preparation step."
msgstr "Di bagian [literal]``Certificates``, berikan sertifikat untuk Proxy {productname}, yang diperoleh pada langkah persiapan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:58
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:53
msgid ""
"In the [literal]``Source`` section, select one of the two options: "
"[literal]``RPM`` or [literal]``Registry``."
msgstr "Di bagian [literal]``Source``, pilih salah satu dari dua opsi: [literal]``RPM`` atau [literal]``Registry``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:59
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:54
msgid ""
"The [literal]``RPM`` option is recommended for air-gapped or restricted "
"environments."
msgstr "Opsi [literal]``RPM`` direkomendasikan untuk lingkungan terisolasi jaringan atau terbatas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:60
msgid ""
"The [literal]``Registry`` option can be used if connectivity to the "
"container image registry is available."
msgstr "Opsi [literal]``Registry`` dapat digunakan jika konektivitas ke registri citra kontainer tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:61
msgid ""
"If selected, you will be prompted to choose between two sub-options: "
"[literal]``Simple`` or [literal]``Advanced``."
msgstr "Jika dipilih, Anda akan diminta untuk memilih antara dua sub-opsi: [literal]``Simple`` atau [literal]``Advanced``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:62
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:56
msgid ""
"If [literal]``Simple`` is selected, provide values in the "
"[literal]``Registry URL`` and [literal]``Containers Tag`` fields."
msgstr "Jika [literal]``Simple`` dipilih, berikan nilai di bidang [literal]``Registry URL`` dan [literal]``Containers Tag``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:63
msgid ""
"For [literal]``Registry URL`` use: "
"[literal]``registry.suse.com/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.2/x86_64``."
msgstr "Untuk [literal]``Registry URL`` gunakan: [literal]``registry.suse.com/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.2/x86_64``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:64
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:67
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:58
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:61
msgid "Select the tag from the drop-down list."
msgstr "Pilih tag dari daftar turun bawah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:65
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:59
msgid ""
"If [literal]``Advanced`` is selected, an additional section of the form is "
"shown:"
msgstr "Jika [literal]``Advanced`` dipilih, bagian tambahan formulir ditampilkan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:66
msgid ""
"For each individual container URL field, use the registry: "
"[literal]``registry.suse.com/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.2/x86_64`` followed "
"by the corresponding suffix, for example, `_proxy-httpd_` or "
"`_salt-broker_`."
msgstr "Untuk setiap bidang URL kontainer individual, gunakan registri: [literal]``registry.suse.com/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.2/x86_64`` diikuti dengan akhiran yang sesuai, misalnya, `_proxy-httpd_` atau `_salt-broker_`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:68
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Once all fields are filled, click btn:[Apply] to apply the configuration and "
"schedule the proxy installation task."
msgstr "Setelah semua bidang diisi, klik btn:[Apply] untuk menerapkan konfigurasi dan menjadwalkan tugas instalasi proxy."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:69
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify Proxy Activation"
msgstr "Verifikasi Aktivasi Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:70
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:64
msgid "Check the client’s event history to confirm task success."
msgstr "Periksa riwayat peristiwa klien untuk mengonfirmasi keberhasilan tugas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:71
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:65
msgid ""
"(Optional) Access the proxy’s HTTP endpoint to validate it shows a welcome "
"page."
msgstr "(Opsional) Akses titik akhir HTTP proxy untuk memvalidasi bahwa halaman selamat datang ditampilkan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Proxy Deployment"
msgstr "Penerapan Proxy {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide outlines the deployment process for the {productname} "
"{productnumber} Proxy container on {sl-micro} {microversion} or {sles} "
"{bci-mlm}.  This guide presumes you have already successfully deployed a "
"{productname} {productnumber} Server."
msgstr "Panduan ini menguraikan proses penerapan untuk kontainer Proxy {productname} {productnumber} di {sl-micro} {microversion} atau {sles} {bci-mlm}. Panduan ini mengasumsikan Anda telah berhasil menerapkan Server {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{sl-micro} is only supported as regular minion ([systemitem]``default`` "
"contact method) for the time being.  We are working on managing it as Salt "
"SSH client ([systemitem]``salt-ssh`` contact method), too."
msgstr "{sl-micro} saat ini hanya didukung sebagai minion biasa (metode kontak [systemitem]``default``). Kami sedang bekerja untuk mengelolanya sebagai klien Salt SSH (metode kontak [systemitem]``salt-ssh``) juga."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:4
msgid ""
"It is possible to convert existing client to proxy.  For more information, "
"see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc[]."
msgstr "Dimungkinkan untuk mengonversi klien yang ada menjadi proxy. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:5
msgid "To successfully deploy a new proxy, follow the procedure:"
msgstr "Untuk berhasil menerapkan proxy baru, ikuti prosedur:"

#.  Add certificate tasks item
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying proxy"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menerapkan proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:7
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid "Review hardware requirements."
msgstr "Tinjau persyaratan perangkat keras."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Synchronize the {sl-micro} {microversion} or {sles} {bci-mlm} parent channel "
"and the proxy extension child channel on the server."
msgstr "Sinkronkan saluran induk {sl-micro} {microversion} atau {sles} {bci-mlm} dan saluran anak ekstensi proxy pada server."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:9
msgid "Install {sl-micro} or {sles} on a bare-metal machine."
msgstr "Instal {sl-micro} atau {sles} pada mesin bare-metal."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:10
msgid "Create a {salt} activation key with Proxy Extension."
msgstr "Buat kunci aktivasi {salt} dengan Ekstensi Proxy."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Bootstrap the proxy as a client with the [systemitem]``default`` connection "
"method."
msgstr "Bootstrap proxy sebagai klien dengan metode koneksi [systemitem]``default``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:12
msgid "Generate a proxy configuration."
msgstr "Buat konfigurasi proxy."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:13
msgid "Transfer the proxy configuration from server to proxy."
msgstr "Transfer konfigurasi proxy dari server ke proxy."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:14
msgid "Install packages on the proxy."
msgstr "Instal paket pada proxy."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Use the proxy configuration to register the client as a proxy with "
"{productname}."
msgstr "Gunakan konfigurasi proxy untuk mendaftarkan klien sebagai proxy dengan {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:16
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported operating system for the Proxy Container Host"
msgstr "Sistem operasi yang didukung untuk Host Kontainer Proxy"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The supported operating system for the container host are {sl-micro} "
"{microversion} and {sles} {bci-mlm}."
msgstr "Sistem operasi yang didukung untuk host kontainer adalah {sl-micro} {microversion} dan {sles} {bci-mlm}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:18
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:9
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container host"
msgstr "Host kontainer"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:19
msgid ""
"A container host is a server equipped with a container engine like Podman, "
"which lets it manage and deploy containers.  These containers hold "
"applications and their essential parts, such as libraries, but not a full "
"operating system, making them lightweight.  This setup ensures applications "
"run the same way in different environments.  The container host supplies the "
"necessary resources such as CPU, memory, and storage for these containers."
msgstr "Host kontainer adalah server yang dilengkapi dengan mesin kontainer seperti Podman, yang memungkinkannya mengelola dan menerapkan kontainer. Kontainer ini menampung aplikasi dan bagian penting mereka, seperti pustaka, tetapi bukan sistem operasi lengkap, membuatnya ringan. Penyiapan ini memastikan aplikasi berjalan dengan cara yang sama di lingkungan yang berbeda. Host kontainer menyediakan sumber daya yang diperlukan seperti CPU, memori, dan penyimpanan untuk kontainer ini."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware requirements for the proxy"
msgstr "Persyaratan perangkat keras untuk proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For more information about hardware requirements for deploying {productname} "
"Proxy, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#proxy-hardware-requirements[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang persyaratan perangkat keras untuk menerapkan Proxy {productname}, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#proxy-hardware-requirements[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize the parent and proxy extension child channels"
msgstr "Sinkronkan saluran induk dan saluran anak ekstensi proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:23
msgid ""
"This section presumes that you have already entered your organization "
"credentials under the menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials] in "
"the server's {webui}.  Products are listed on the menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > "
"Products] page.  This channel must be fully synchronized on the server, with "
"the child channel [systemitem]``Proxy`` as an extension option selected."
msgstr "Bagian ini mengasumsikan bahwa Anda telah memasukkan kredensial organisasi Anda di bawah menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials] di {webui} server. Produk terdaftar di halaman menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products]. Saluran ini harus sepenuhnya disinkronkan pada server, dengan saluran anak [systemitem]``Proxy`` sebagai opsi ekstensi yang dipilih."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing the parent channel and proxy extension"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mensinkronkan saluran induk dan ekstensi proxy"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:25
msgid "In the {productname} {webui} select menu:Admin[Products]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname} pilih menu:Admin[Products]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:26
msgid "From the products page enter {sl-micro} or {sles} in the filter field."
msgstr "Dari halaman produk, masukkan {sl-micro} atau {sles} di bidang filter."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Next use the drop-down to select the required architecture.  For this "
"example {x86_64}."
msgstr "Selanjutnya gunakan daftar turun bawah untuk memilih arsitektur yang diperlukan. Untuk contoh ini {x86_64}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the [systemitem]``Product Description`` field select the {sl-micro} "
"{microversion} or {sles} {bci-mlm} checkbox then use the drop-down to select "
"the [systemitem]``{productname} Proxy Extension 5.2 x86_64`` extension."
msgstr "Di bidang [systemitem]``Product Description`` pilih kotak centang {sl-micro} {microversion} atau {sles} {bci-mlm} lalu gunakan daftar turun bawah untuk memilih ekstensi [systemitem]``{productname} Proxy Extension 5.2 x86_64``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:29
msgid "Click the btn:[Add products] button."
msgstr "Klik tombol btn:[Add products]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:30
msgid "Wait for the synchronization to complete."
msgstr "Tunggu hingga sinkronisasi selesai."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the {productname} proxy host"
msgstr "Menyiapkan host proxy {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:32
msgid ""
"In the following subsections, you either prepare the proxy host with "
"{sle-micro} or {sles}."
msgstr "Pada subbagian berikut, Anda menyiapkan host proxy dengan {sle-micro} atau {sles}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:33
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:34
msgid ""
"To continue with deployment, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc#deploy-mlm-proxy-persistent-storage[]."
msgstr "Untuk melanjutkan dengan penerapan, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc#deploy-mlm-proxy-persistent-storage[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure custom persistent storage"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi penyimpanan persisten khusus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Configuring persistent storage is optional, but it is the only way to avoid "
"serious trouble with container full disk conditions.  If custom persistent "
"storage is required for your infrastructure, use the "
"[command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` tool."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi penyimpanan persisten adalah opsional, tetapi ini adalah satu-satunya cara untuk menghindari masalah serius dengan kondisi disk penuh kontainer. Jika penyimpanan persisten khusus diperlukan untuk infrastruktur Anda, gunakan alat [command]``mgr-storage-proxy``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:37
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information, see [command]``mgr-storage-proxy --help``.  This tool "
"simplifies creating the container storage and Squid cache volumes."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat [command]``mgr-storage-proxy --help``. Alat ini menyederhanakan pembuatan penyimpanan kontainer dan volume cache Squid."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:38
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:38
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:45
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:27
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:28
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:16
msgid "Use the command in the following manner:"
msgstr "Gunakan perintah dengan cara berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:39
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:28
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-storage-proxy <storage-disk-device>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:40
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:61
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:40
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:49
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:42
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:48
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:29
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:30
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:53
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-hardened-tmpdir.adoc:2
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:18
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "Misalnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:41
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:30
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-storage-proxy /dev/nvme1n1\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:42
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:42
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:44
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:50
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:31
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:32
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:56
msgid ""
"This command will create the persistent storage volumes at "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."
msgstr "Perintah ini akan membuat volume penyimpanan persisten di [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:43
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:43
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:52
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:45
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:51
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:32
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:21
msgid "For more information, see"
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:44
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:44
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:53
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:46
