msgstr "Ketika instalasi selesai, masuk sebagai root."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:35
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:23
