#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:37
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:25
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using a Custom Container Image for a Service"
msgstr "Menggunakan Citra Kontainer Khusus untuk Layanan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:38
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:26
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:93
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} Proxy suite is set to use the same image "
"version and registry path for each of its services.  However, it is possible "
"to override the default values for a specific service using the install "
"parameters ending with [literal]``-tag`` and [literal]``-image``."
msgstr "Secara default, suite Proxy {productname} diatur untuk menggunakan versi citra dan jalur registri yang sama untuk setiap layanannya. Namun, dimungkinkan untuk mengganti nilai default untuk layanan tertentu menggunakan parameter instalasi yang berakhir dengan [literal]``-tag`` dan [literal]``-image``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:39
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:27
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:94
msgid "For example, use it like this:"
msgstr "Misalnya, gunakan seperti ini:"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Proxy Deployment as a Virtual Machine - VMware"
msgstr "Penerapan Proxy {productname} sebagai Mesin Virtual - VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter provides the Virtual Machine settings for deployment of "
"{productname} {productnumber} Proxy as an image.  VMware will be used as a "
"sandbox for this installation."
msgstr "Bab ini menyediakan pengaturan Mesin Virtual untuk penerapan {productname} {productnumber} Proxy sebagai citra. VMware akan digunakan sebagai sandbox untuk instalasi ini."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual Machine Settings - VMware"
msgstr "Pengaturan Mesin Virtual - VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:11
msgid ""
"This section describes VMware configurations, focusing on the creation of an "
"extra virtual disk essential for the {productname} Proxy storage partition "
"within VMware environments."
msgstr "Bagian ini menjelaskan konfigurasi VMware, berfokus pada pembuatan disk virtual tambahan yang penting untuk partisi penyimpanan Proxy {productname} dalam lingkungan VMware."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This section specifies the minimum requirements.  These are suitable for a "
"quick test installation, such as a proxy with one client."
msgstr "Bagian ini menentukan persyaratan minimum. Ini cocok untuk instalasi uji cepat, seperti proxy dengan satu klien."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:14
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating the VMware Virtual Machine"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Mesin Virtual VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Download {productname} Proxy [filename]``.vmdk`` file then transfer a copy "
"to your VMware storage."
msgstr "Unduh file [filename]``.vmdk`` Proxy {productname} lalu transfer salinannya ke penyimpanan VMware Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:16
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Make a copy of uploaded [filename]``.vmdk`` file using VMware web "
"interface.  This will convert provided [filename]``.vmdk`` file to the "
"format suitable for vSphere hypervisor."
msgstr "Buat salinan file [filename]``.vmdk`` yang diunggah menggunakan antarmuka web VMware. Ini akan mengonversi file [filename]``.vmdk`` yang disediakan ke format yang cocok untuk hypervisor vSphere."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:17
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Create and name a new virtual machine based on the Guest OS Family "
"[systemitem]``Linux`` and Guest OS Version {sle} 15 (64-bit)."
msgstr "Buat dan beri nama mesin virtual baru berdasarkan Keluarga OS Tamu [systemitem]``Linux`` dan Versi OS Tamu {sle} 15 (64-bit)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:18
msgid "Add an additional [systemitem]``Hard Disk 2`` of 100 GB (or more)."
msgstr "Tambahkan [systemitem]``Hard Disk 2`` tambahan sebesar 100 GB (atau lebih)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:19
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:18
msgid "Configure RAM and number of CPUs with minimum values. *)"
msgstr "Konfigurasi RAM dan jumlah CPU dengan nilai minimum. *)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:20
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:19
msgid "Set the network adapter as required."
msgstr "Atur adaptor jaringan sesuai kebutuhan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:21
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Power on the VM, and follow firstboot dialogs (keyboard layout, license "
"agreement, time zone, password for root)."
msgstr "Hidupkan VM, dan ikuti dialog firstboot (tata letak keyboard, perjanjian lisensi, zona waktu, kata sandi untuk root)."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} {productnumber}  Proxy Deployment on Kubernetes"
msgstr "Penerapan Proxy {productname} {productnumber} di Kubernetes"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy on {kube} changes"
msgstr "Perubahan Proxy di {kube}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:3
msgid ""
"There were multiple changes in how to install {productname} proxies running "
"on {kube}:"
msgstr "Ada beberapa perubahan dalam cara menginstal proxy {productname} yang berjalan di {kube}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:4
msgid ""
"[command]``mgrpxy`` is no longer handling proxies on {kube}, helm and the "
"[literal]``proxy-helm`` chart need to be used instead."
msgstr "[command]``mgrpxy`` tidak lagi menangani proxy di {kube}, helm dan bagan [literal]``proxy-helm`` perlu digunakan sebagai gantinya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The TLS certificates have to be in secrets, rather than in the configuration "
"tarball.  This aims at allowing cloud-native TLS certificates management for "
"the proxies."
msgstr "Sertifikat TLS harus berada di secrets, bukan di tarball konfigurasi. Ini bertujuan memungkinkan manajemen sertifikat TLS cloud-native untuk proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The proxy queries the server at the start of the container to verify that "
"the versions are compatible."
msgstr "Proxy menanyakan server pada awal kontainer untuk memverifikasi bahwa versi kompatibel."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The needed persistent volume claims has been reduced to the squid cache "
"only."
msgstr "Klaim volume persisten yang diperlukan telah dikurangi hanya ke cache squid."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The {productname} proxy is supported when running on an RKE2 cluster, K3S is "
"longer supported."
msgstr "Proxy {productname} didukung saat berjalan di kluster RKE2, K3S tidak lagi didukung."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:10
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Installing the {kube} cluster and configuring it is out of the scope of this "
"document."
msgstr "Menginstal kluster {kube} dan mengonfigurasinya berada di luar cakupan dokumen ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:11
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The cluster is assumed to be ready to be used with a user having rights on a "
"namespace dedicated to {productname}."
msgstr "Kluster diasumsikan siap digunakan dengan pengguna yang memiliki hak pada namespace yang didedikasikan untuk {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Create [literal]``Role`` and [literal]``RoleBinding`` if they do not exist "
"already.  The minimum rights required to deploy [literal]``proxy-helm`` are "
"defined as:"
msgstr "Buat [literal]``Role`` dan [literal]``RoleBinding`` jika belum ada. Hak minimum yang diperlukan untuk menerapkan [literal]``proxy-helm`` didefinisikan sebagai:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:13
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"apiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\n"
"kind: Role\n"
"metadata:\n"
"  name: example-resource-manager\n"
"  namespace: $NAMESPACE\n"
"rules:\n"
"- apiGroups: [\"\"]\n"
"  resources: [\"pods\", \"pods/log\", \"services\", \"secrets\", "
"\"configmaps\", \"persistentvolumeclaims\"]\n"
"  verbs: [\"*\"]\n"
"- apiGroups: [\"apps\"]\n"
"  resources: [\"deployments\"]\n"
"  verbs: [\"*\"]\n"
"- apiGroups: [\"networking.k8s.io\"]\n"
"  resources: [\"ingresses\"]\n"
"  verbs: [\"*\"]\n"
"---\n"
msgstr ""
"apiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\n"
"kind: Role\n"
"metadata:\n"
"  name: example-resource-manager\n"
"  namespace: $NAMESPACE\n"
"rules:\n"
"- apiGroups: [\"\"]\n"
"  resources: [\"pods\", \"pods/log\", \"services\", \"secrets\", \"configmaps\", \"persistentvolumeclaims\"]\n"
"  verbs: [\"*\"]\n"
"- apiGroups: [\"apps\"]\n"
"  resources: [\"deployments\"]\n"
"  verbs: [\"*\"]\n"
"- apiGroups: [\"networking.k8s.io\"]\n"
"  resources: [\"ingresses\"]\n"
"  verbs: [\"*\"]\n"
"---\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:14
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"apiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\n"
"kind: RoleBinding\n"
"metadata:\n"
"  name: example-resource-manager-binding\n"
"  namespace: $NAMESPACE\n"
"subjects:\n"
"- kind: User\n"
"  name: $USERNAME\n"
"  apiGroup: rbac.authorization.k8s.io\n"
"roleRef:\n"
"  kind: Role\n"
"  name: example-resource-manager\n"
"  apiGroup: rbac.authorization.k8s.io\n"
msgstr ""
"apiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\n"
"kind: RoleBinding\n"
"metadata:\n"
"  name: example-resource-manager-binding\n"
"  namespace: $NAMESPACE\n"
"subjects:\n"
"- kind: User\n"
"  name: $USERNAME\n"
"  apiGroup: rbac.authorization.k8s.io\n"
"roleRef:\n"
"  kind: Role\n"
"  name: example-resource-manager\n"
"  apiGroup: rbac.authorization.k8s.io\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:15
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:15
msgid ""
"This guide assumes the reader knows how to work with {kube}: the concepts "
"will not be explained here as they are extensively documented in the "
"official {kube} documentation."
msgstr "Panduan ini mengasumsikan pembaca tahu cara bekerja dengan {kube}: konsep tidak akan dijelaskan di sini karena didokumentasikan secara luas dalam dokumentasi resmi {kube}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The {productname} administrator needs to deploy the [literal]``proxy-helm`` "
"{helm} chart.  However, this chart requires to prepare:"
msgstr "Administrator {productname} perlu menerapkan bagan {helm} [literal]``proxy-helm``. Namun, bagan ini memerlukan persiapan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:17
msgid "TLS certificates chain for the proxy,"
msgstr "Rantai sertifikat TLS untuk proxy,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:18
msgid "a [literal]``ConfigMap`` for the proxy root CA certificate,"
msgstr "[literal]``ConfigMap`` untuk sertifikat CA root proxy,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:19
msgid ""
"a persistent volumes for the claim the chart will create or a storage class "
"automatically creating it,"
msgstr "Volume persisten untuk klaim yang akan dibuat bagan atau kelas penyimpanan yang membuatnya secara otomatis,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:20
msgid "Load balancers or other mechanisms to expose the Salt, SSH and TFTP ports."
msgstr "Load balancer atau mekanisme lain untuk mengekspos port Salt, SSH, dan TFTP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Run the following command to read the full details on how to use the proxy "
"{helm} chart:"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah berikut untuk membaca detail lengkap tentang cara menggunakan bagan {helm} proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"helm show readme --version {productchartversion} \\\n"
"    oci://registry.suse.com/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.2/proxy-helm\n"
msgstr ""
"helm show readme --version {productchartversion} \\\n"
"    oci://registry.suse.com/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.2/proxy-helm\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"helm show readme --version {productchartversion} \\\n"
"    oci://registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/proxy-helm\n"
msgstr ""
"helm show readme --version {productchartversion} \\\n"
"    oci://registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/proxy-helm\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:24
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Helm requires the version to be semver2 compatible when using OCI "
"repositories.  This is why the version ([literal]``{productchartversion}``) "
"is formatted differently from the release number "
"([literal]``{productnumber}``)."
msgstr "Helm memerlukan versi yang kompatibel dengan semver2 saat menggunakan repositori OCI. Inilah sebabnya mengapa versi ([literal]``{productchartversion}``) diformat berbeda dari nomor rilis ([literal]``{productnumber}``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For older versions, the Helm chart is located in a snapshot repository like: "
"[literal]``oci://registry.opensuse.org/systemsmanagement/uyuni/snapshots/<version>/opensuse_tumbleweed/uyuni/proxy-helm``."
msgstr "Untuk versi yang lebih lama, bagan Helm terletak di repositori snapshot seperti: [literal]``oci://registry.opensuse.org/systemsmanagement/uyuni/snapshots/<version>/opensuse_tumbleweed/uyuni/proxy-helm``."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:26
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Credentials"
msgstr "Kredensial"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:27
msgid ""
"A secret with the SCC credentials needs to be defined in order to pull the "
"images from `registry.suse.com`.  Refer to "
"https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/configure-pod-container/pull-image-private-registry/ "
"for the instructions to prepare the secret.  Set the `registrySecret` "
"[literal]``proxy-helm`` chart value to the name of the secret containing "
"those credentials to use it."
msgstr "Secret dengan kredensial SCC perlu didefinisikan untuk menarik citra dari `registry.suse.com`. Lihat https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/configure-pod-container/pull-image-private-registry/ untuk instruksi menyiapkan secret. Atur nilai bagan [literal]``proxy-helm`` `registrySecret` ke nama secret yang berisi kredensial tersebut untuk menggunakannya."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:28
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "TLS setup"
msgstr "Penyiapan TLS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The [literal]``proxy-cert`` TLS secret is expected.  It contains the TLS "
"certificate and key for the Ingress rule and needs to have the public FQDN "
"as Subject Alternate Name."
msgstr "Secret TLS [literal]``proxy-cert`` diharapkan. Ini berisi sertifikat dan kunci TLS untuk aturan Ingress dan perlu memiliki FQDN publik sebagai Subject Alternate Name."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:30
msgid ""
"These secrets can be created using the [command]``kubectl create secret tls "
"-n $NAMESPACE`` command.  The certificate file passed to this command needs "
"to start with the server certificate followed by the chain of intermediary "
"CA certificates if any.  The root CA is not needed in these secrets as it is "
"expected in a ConfigMap."
msgstr "Secret ini dapat dibuat menggunakan perintah [command]``kubectl create secret tls -n $NAMESPACE``. File sertifikat yang diteruskan ke perintah ini perlu dimulai dengan sertifikat server diikuti oleh rantai sertifikat CA perantara jika ada. CA root tidak diperlukan dalam secret ini karena diharapkan dalam ConfigMap."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The Root CA certificate of [literal]``proxy-cert`` is expected in a "
"ConfigMap named [literal]``uyuni-ca`` stored in the [literal]``ca.crt`` "
"key.  It can be created with a command like [command]``kubectl create cm -n "
"$NAMESPACE uyuni-ca --from-file=ca.crt=/path/to/uyuni-ca.crt``."
msgstr "Sertifikat Root CA dari [literal]``proxy-cert`` diharapkan dalam ConfigMap bernama [literal]``uyuni-ca`` yang disimpan dalam kunci [literal]``ca.crt``. Ini dapat dibuat dengan perintah seperti [command]``kubectl create cm -n $NAMESPACE uyuni-ca --from-file=ca.crt=/path/to/uyuni-ca.crt``."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:32
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "Penyimpanan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:33
msgid "The proxy chart defines a volume as a Persistent Volume Claim (PVC)."
msgstr "Bagan proxy mendefinisikan volume sebagai Persistent Volume Claim (PVC)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The creation of the underlying PV is the responsibility of the cluster "
"administrators."
msgstr "Pembuatan PV yang mendasarinya adalah tanggung jawab administrator kluster."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:35
msgid "The PVC use the [literal]``ReadWriteOnce`` access mode."
msgstr "PVC menggunakan mode akses [literal]``ReadWriteOnce``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:36
msgid ""
"The created PVC can be tuned {helm} chart values, it can have the following "
"values:"
msgstr "PVC yang dibuat dapat disetel dengan nilai bagan {helm}, dapat memiliki nilai berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:37
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:51
msgid "[literal]``size``: to set the requested size of the PVC."
msgstr "[literal]``size``: untuk mengatur ukuran yang diminta dari PVC."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:38
msgid ""
"[literal]``storageClass``: can be used to select the storage class to use "
"for the PVC."
msgstr "[literal]``storageClass``: dapat digunakan untuk memilih kelas penyimpanan yang akan digunakan untuk PVC."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:39
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:53
msgid "[literal]``extraLabels``: can be used to add custom labels to the PVC."
msgstr "[literal]``extraLabels``: dapat digunakan untuk menambahkan label khusus ke PVC."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:40
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:54
msgid "[literal]``annotations``: can be used to set custom annotations on the PVC."
msgstr "[literal]``annotations``: dapat digunakan untuk mengatur anotasi khusus pada PVC."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:41
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:55
msgid ""
"[literal]``volumeName``: can be used to hard code which volume the PVC "
"should be bound to."
msgstr "[literal]``volumeName``: dapat digunakan untuk hard code volume mana yang harus diikat ke PVC."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:42
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:56
msgid ""
"[literal]``selector``: is the YAML fragment of the PVC selector to use to "
"find the PV to bind to."
msgstr "[literal]``selector``: adalah fragmen YAML dari pemilih PVC yang akan digunakan untuk menemukan PV yang akan diikat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:43
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Refer to https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/storage/persistent-volumes/ for "
"more information on persistent volumes and their claims."
msgstr "Lihat https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/storage/persistent-volumes/ untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang volume persisten dan klaimnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Refer to the [literal]``proxy-helm`` README for the list of persistent "
"volume claims which will be created and will need to be bound to persistent "
"volumes."
msgstr "Lihat README [literal]``proxy-helm`` untuk daftar klaim volume persisten yang akan dibuat dan perlu diikat ke volume persisten."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:45
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:59
msgid ""
"While the default sizes are provided, it is highly recommended to change "
"them based on the distributions you plan to synchronize."
msgstr "Meskipun ukuran default disediakan, sangat disarankan untuk mengubahnya berdasarkan distribusi yang Anda rencanakan untuk disinkronkan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:46
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:60
msgid ""
"For more information on storage requirements see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang persyaratan penyimpanan, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:47
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exposing ports"
msgstr "Mengekspos port"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:48
msgid ""
"{productname} proxy requires some TCP and UDP ports to be routed to its "
"services.  Refer to the [literal]``proxy-helm`` README for the list of ports "
"to be exposed."
msgstr "Proxy {productname} memerlukan beberapa port TCP dan UDP untuk dirutekan ke layanannya. Lihat README [literal]``proxy-helm`` untuk daftar port yang akan diekspos."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:49
msgid ""
"RKE2 ships with nginx as the default ingress controller.  However, as this "
"is deprecated and soon to be unsupported, the [literal]``proxy-helm`` chart "
"defaults to use Traefik as ingress controller.  Using the nginx ingress "
"controller might work and will not be documented, use at your own risk."
msgstr "RKE2 menyertakan nginx sebagai pengendali ingress default. Namun, karena ini sudah ditinggalkan dan segera tidak akan didukung lagi, bagan [literal]``proxy-helm`` menggunakan Traefik sebagai pengendali ingress. Menggunakan pengendali ingress nginx mungkin berhasil dan tidak akan didokumentasikan, gunakan dengan risiko Anda sendiri."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:50
msgid ""
"The [literal]``proxy-helm`` chart supports Gateway API version 1.4.  Since "
"this requires experimental CRDs which are not shipped with RKE2 1.35, it is "
"not recommended to be used in production."
msgstr "Bagan [literal]``proxy-helm`` mendukung Gateway API versi 1.4. Karena ini memerlukan CRD eksperimental yang tidak disertakan dengan RKE2 1.35, tidak disarankan untuk digunakan dalam produksi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:51
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:65
msgid ""
"There are multiple ways to expose the ports, but this documentation will "
"only mention how to configure RKE2's Traefik for this.  This is not a task "
"for the {productname} administrator, but the {kube} cluster administrator as "
"it requires configuration to be set on the cluster nodes."
msgstr "Ada beberapa cara untuk mengekspos port, tetapi dokumentasi ini hanya akan menyebutkan cara mengonfigurasi Traefik RKE2 untuk ini. Ini bukan tugas untuk administrator {productname}, tetapi administrator kluster {kube} karena memerlukan konfigurasi yang diatur pada node kluster."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:52
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:66
msgid ""
"To set Traefik to expose and route the needed ports, create a "
"`/var/lib/rancher/rke2/server/manifests/uyuni-traefik.yaml` on each node "
"with the following content.  Note that Traefik takes a few seconds to be "
"reinstalled after saving the file."
msgstr "Untuk mengatur Traefik agar mengekspos dan merutekan port yang diperlukan, buat `/var/lib/rancher/rke2/server/manifests/uyuni-traefik.yaml` pada setiap node dengan konten berikut. Perhatikan bahwa Traefik memerlukan beberapa detik untuk diinstal ulang setelah menyimpan file."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"apiVersion: helm.cattle.io/v1\n"
"kind: HelmChartConfig\n"
"metadata:\n"
"  name: rke2-traefik\n"
"  namespace: kube-system\n"
"spec:\n"
"  valuesContent: |-\n"
"    ports:\n"
"      ssh:\n"
"        port: 8022\n"
"        expose:\n"
"          default: true\n"
"        exposedPort: 8022\n"
"        protocol: TCP\n"
"        hostPort: 8022\n"
"      salt-publish:\n"
"        port: 4505\n"
"        expose:\n"
"          default: true\n"
"        exposedPort: 4505\n"
"        protocol: TCP\n"
"        hostPort: 4505\n"
"        containerPort: 4505\n"
"      salt-request:\n"
"        port: 4506\n"
"        expose:\n"
"          default: true\n"
"        exposedPort: 4506\n"
"        protocol: TCP\n"
"        hostPort: 4506\n"
"        containerPort: 4506\n"
msgstr ""
"apiVersion: helm.cattle.io/v1\n"
"kind: HelmChartConfig\n"
"metadata:\n"
"  name: rke2-traefik\n"
"  namespace: kube-system\n"
"spec:\n"
"  valuesContent: |-\n"
"    ports:\n"
"      ssh:\n"
"        port: 8022\n"
"        expose:\n"
"          default: true\n"
"        exposedPort: 8022\n"
"        protocol: TCP\n"
"        hostPort: 8022\n"
"      salt-publish:\n"
"        port: 4505\n"
"        expose:\n"
"          default: true\n"
"        exposedPort: 4505\n"
"        protocol: TCP\n"
"        hostPort: 4505\n"
"        containerPort: 4505\n"
"      salt-request:\n"
"        port: 4506\n"
"        expose:\n"
"          default: true\n"
"        exposedPort: 4506\n"
"        protocol: TCP\n"
"        hostPort: 4506\n"
"        containerPort: 4506\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:54
msgid ""
"If Traefik is used as the Ingress controller, the user needs access to "
"additional resources.  Add the following to the rules of the previously "
"defined role:"
msgstr "Jika Traefik digunakan sebagai pengendali Ingress, pengguna memerlukan akses ke sumber daya tambahan. Tambahkan berikut ini ke aturan role yang sebelumnya didefinisikan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- apiGroups: [\"traefik.io\", \"traefik.containo.us\"]\n"
"  resources: [\"ingressroutetcps\"]\n"
"  verbs: [\"*\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"- apiGroups: [\"traefik.io\", \"traefik.containo.us\"]\n"
"  resources: [\"ingressroutetcps\"]\n"
"  verbs: [\"*\"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:56
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:73
msgid ""
"If Gateway API is used instead, add the following to the rules of the "
"previously defined role:"
msgstr "Jika Gateway API digunakan sebagai gantinya, tambahkan berikut ini ke aturan role yang sebelumnya didefinisikan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:57
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- apiGroups: [\"gateway.networking.k8s.io\"]\n"
"  resources: [\"gateways\", \"httproutes\", \"tcproutes\"]\n"
"  verbs: [\"*\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"- apiGroups: [\"gateway.networking.k8s.io\"]\n"
"  resources: [\"gateways\", \"httproutes\", \"tcproutes\"]\n"
"  verbs: [\"*\"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:58
msgid ""
"TFTP is complex to expose from a {kube} pod due to the nature of the "
"protocol: the TFTP server receives requests on port 69, but negotiates "
"another random port to continue.  This port also needs to stay the same "
"through the whole session for the server to recognize the client as being "
"the same.  This means that there are only two possible ways to use the TFTP "
"server:"
msgstr "TFTP kompleks untuk diekspos dari pod {kube} karena sifat protokol: server TFTP menerima permintaan pada port 69, tetapi menegosiasikan port acak lain untuk melanjutkan. Port ini juga perlu tetap sama sepanjang sesi agar server mengenali klien sebagai sama. Ini berarti bahwa hanya ada dua cara yang mungkin untuk menggunakan server TFTP:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:59
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:69
msgid "using a load balancer compatible with TFTP,"
msgstr "menggunakan load balancer yang kompatibel dengan TFTP,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:60
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:70
msgid ""
"using the host network for the TFTP pod. This can be achieved by setting the "
"[literal]``tftp.hostNetwork`` helm chart value to [literal]``true``."
msgstr "menggunakan jaringan host untuk pod TFTP. Ini dapat dicapai dengan mengatur nilai bagan helm [literal]``tftp.hostNetwork`` ke [literal]``true``."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration generation"
msgstr "Pembuatan konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Before deploying the {productname} proxy, a configuration archive needs to "
"be generated."
msgstr "Sebelum menerapkan proxy {productname}, arsip konfigurasi perlu dibuat."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:63
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploying the {productname} Proxy Helm Chart"
msgstr "Menerapkan Bagan Helm Proxy {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Copy and extract the generated configuration [literal]``tar.gz`` file and "
"then install using helm:"
msgstr "Salin dan ekstrak file konfigurasi [literal]``tar.gz`` yang dibuat lalu instal menggunakan helm:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"helm install smlm-proxy \\\n"
"    oci://registry.suse.com/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.2/proxy-helm \\\n"
"    -n $NAMESPACE \\\n"
"    --description \"Proxy installation\" \\\n"
"    --set \"registrySecret=the-scc-secret\" \\\n"
"    --set-file global.config=path/to/config.yaml \\\n"
"    --set-file global.ssh=path/to/ssh.yaml \\\n"
"    --set-file global.httpd=path/to/httpd.yaml \\\n"
msgstr ""
"helm install smlm-proxy \\\n"
"    oci://registry.suse.com/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.2/proxy-helm \\\n"
"    -n $NAMESPACE \\\n"
"    --description \"Proxy installation\" \\\n"
"    --set \"registrySecret=the-scc-secret\" \\\n"
"    --set-file global.config=path/to/config.yaml \\\n"
"    --set-file global.ssh=path/to/ssh.yaml \\\n"
"    --set-file global.httpd=path/to/httpd.yaml \\\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"helm install uyuni-proxy \\\n"
"    oci://registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/proxy-helm \\\n"
"    -n $NAMESPACE \\\n"
"    --description \"Proxy installation\" \\\n"
"    --set-file global.config=path/to/config.yaml \\\n"
"    --set-file global.ssh=path/to/ssh.yaml \\\n"
"    --set-file global.httpd=path/to/httpd.yaml \\\n"
msgstr ""
"helm install uyuni-proxy \\\n"
"    oci://registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/proxy-helm \\\n"
"    -n $NAMESPACE \\\n"
"    --description \"Proxy installation\" \\\n"
"    --set-file global.config=path/to/config.yaml \\\n"
"    --set-file global.ssh=path/to/ssh.yaml \\\n"
"    --set-file global.httpd=path/to/httpd.yaml \\\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:67
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:86
msgid ""
"When setting multiple values, using a YAML values file is recommended "
"instead of passing several [literal]``--set`` parameters.  Refer to the "
"[command]``helm`` command help for more details."
msgstr "Saat mengatur beberapa nilai, menggunakan file nilai YAML direkomendasikan daripada meneruskan beberapa parameter [literal]``--set``. Lihat bantuan perintah [command]``helm`` untuk detail lebih lanjut."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:68
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example helm charts"
msgstr "Contoh bagan helm"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Some helm charts using the [literal]``proxy-helm`` chart can be found in the "
"[literal]``{gitchartsbranch}`` branch of the "
"https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni-charts/tree/{gitchartsbranch}[uyuni-charts] "
"git repository.  They show case how the TLS certificate can be generated "
"using [literal]``cert-manager`` and [literal]``trust-manager``.  Those "
"examples may assume to have {kube} cluster administrator permissions."
msgstr "Beberapa bagan helm yang menggunakan bagan [literal]``proxy-helm`` dapat ditemukan di cabang [literal]``{gitchartsbranch}`` dari repositori git https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni-charts/tree/{gitchartsbranch}[uyuni-charts]. Mereka menunjukkan bagaimana sertifikat TLS dapat dibuat menggunakan [literal]``cert-manager`` dan [literal]``trust-manager``. Contoh-contoh tersebut mungkin mengasumsikan memiliki izin administrator kluster {kube}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-k3s-deployment-mlm.adoc:70
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:91
msgid "These examples are not supported, only provided for documentation purpose."
msgstr "Contoh ini tidak didukung, hanya disediakan untuk tujuan dokumentasi."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:1
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Server Air-gapped Deployment"
msgstr "Penerapan Server {productname} Terisolasi Jaringan (Air-gapped)"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is Air-gapped deployment?"
msgstr "Apa itu penerapan terisolasi jaringan (air-gapped)?"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployments"
msgstr "Penerapan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:5
msgid "{productname} supports two deployment variants."
msgstr "{productname} mendukung dua varian penerapan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For more information about installing {productname} Server Virtual Machine, "
"see xref:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc[Deploy "
"Server as a Virtual Machine]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang menginstal Mesin Virtual Server {productname}, lihat xref:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc[Terapkan Server sebagai Mesin Virtual]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:9
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:21
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:35
msgid ""
"To upgrade {productname} Server, users should upgrade all packages in the "
"system and follow the procedures defined in "
"xref:container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc[Server Upgrade]."
msgstr "Untuk memutakhirkan Server {productname}, pengguna harus memutakhirkan semua paket dalam sistem dan mengikuti prosedur yang didefinisikan di xref:container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc[Pemutakhiran Server]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:12
msgid ""
"User should make the needed RPM available on the internal network.  That can "
"be done by using a second {productname} Server or an RMT server."
msgstr "Pengguna harus membuat RPM yang diperlukan tersedia di jaringan internal. Itu dapat dilakukan dengan menggunakan Server {productname} kedua atau server RMT."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Install {productname} on {sl-micro} in air-gapped deployment"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal {productname} di {sl-micro} dalam penerapan terisolasi jaringan"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Install tools packages and image packages (replace $ARCH$ with the correct "
"architecture)."
msgstr "Instal paket alat dan paket citra (ganti $ARCH$ dengan arsitektur yang benar)."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transactional-update pkg install mgradm* mgrctl* "
"suse-multi-linux-manager-5.2-$ARCH$-server-*\n"
msgstr "transactional-update pkg install mgradm* mgrctl* suse-multi-linux-manager-5.2-$ARCH$-server-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:19
msgid "Deploy {productname} with [command]``mgradm``."
msgstr "Terapkan {productname} dengan [command]``mgradm``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For more detailed information about installing {productname} Server on "
"{sl-micro}, see "
"xref:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc[Deploy Server as a "
"Virtual Machine]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih rinci tentang menginstal Server {productname} di {sl-micro}, lihat xref:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc[Terapkan Server sebagai Mesin Virtual]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "PTFs"
msgstr "PTF"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The PTF images are not available as packages.  This means that they should "
"be pulled using [command]``podman`` on a machine with internet access, then "
"saved in an archive, transferred to the air-gapped machine and loaded there."
msgstr "Citra PTF tidak tersedia sebagai paket. Ini berarti bahwa mereka harus ditarik menggunakan [command]``podman`` pada mesin dengan akses internet, lalu disimpan dalam arsip, ditransfer ke mesin terisolasi jaringan, dan dimuat di sana."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Pulling the image on a machine with internet access"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menarik citra pada mesin dengan akses internet"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:25
msgid "Install [command]``podman``."
msgstr "Instal [command]``podman``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:26
msgid "Authenticate against the {suse} Registry using the SCC credentials:"
msgstr "Autentikasi terhadap Registri {suse} menggunakan kredensial SCC:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:27
msgid "Run the following commands in a shell."
msgstr "Jalankan perintah berikut di shell."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:28
msgid ""
"This example assumes that the PTF is for the [path]``server`` image, adjust "
"the example if the PTF concerns another image."
msgstr "Contoh ini mengasumsikan bahwa PTF adalah untuk citra [path]``server``, sesuaikan contoh jika PTF menyangkut citra lain."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SCC_USERID=aXXXX\n"
"PTFID=12345\n"
"echo "
"\"registry.suse.com/a/$SCC_USERID/$PTFID/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.2/x86_64/server:latest-ptf-$PTFID\" "
">>/tmp/ptf-images\n"
msgstr ""
"SCC_USERID=aXXXX\n"
"PTFID=12345\n"
"echo \"registry.suse.com/a/$SCC_USERID/$PTFID/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.2/x86_64/server:latest-ptf-$PTFID\" >>/tmp/ptf-images\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Verify that the file contains the full path to the PTF image.  If needed, "
"other images full paths can be added to the file, one per line."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa file berisi jalur lengkap ke citra PTF. Jika diperlukan, jalur lengkap citra lain dapat ditambahkan ke file, satu per baris."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Pull each of the container images of the PTF and save them in a tar archive "
"by running the following commands."
msgstr "Tarik setiap citra kontainer dari PTF dan simpan dalam arsip tar dengan menjalankan perintah berikut."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for image in `cat /tmp/ptf-images`; do\n"
"    podman pull $image\n"
"done\n"
"podman save -o /tmp/ptf-images.tar $(cat /tmp/ptf-images)\n"
msgstr ""
"for image in `cat /tmp/ptf-images`; do\n"
"    podman pull $image\n"
"done\n"
"podman save -o /tmp/ptf-images.tar $(cat /tmp/ptf-images)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Transfer the [path]``/tmp/ptf-images.tar`` images archive on the server to "
"patch."
msgstr "Transfer arsip citra [path]``/tmp/ptf-images.tar`` ke server untuk dipatch."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Loading the images on the server to patch"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memuat citra pada server untuk dipatch"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:35
msgid "Ensure the [path]``ptf-images.tar`` file is available on the server."
msgstr "Pastikan file [path]``ptf-images.tar`` tersedia di server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:36
msgid "Load the images from the archive:"
msgstr "Muat citra dari arsip:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "podman load -i ptf-images.tar\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:38
msgid "Install the PTF as it would be done on a connected machine, using command:"
msgstr "Instal PTF seperti yang akan dilakukan pada mesin yang terhubung, menggunakan perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm support ptf podman [--test|--ptf] NUMBER --user SCC_ACCOUNT\n"
msgstr "mgradm support ptf podman [--test|--ptf] NUMBER --user SCC_ACCOUNT\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:40
msgid "Because the images are already loaded they will not be pulled."
msgstr "Karena citra sudah dimuat, mereka tidak akan ditarik."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Server Deployment"
msgstr "Penerapan Server {productname} {productnumber}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide shows you how to install and configure a {productname} "
"{productnumber} container on {sl-micro} {microversion} or {sles} {bci-mlm}."
msgstr "Panduan ini menunjukkan cara menginstal dan mengonfigurasi kontainer {productname} {productnumber} di {sl-micro} {microversion} atau {sles} {bci-mlm}."

#.  Link to hardware requirements do not show them here. We list them on other pages.
#.  Done within next section.
#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware Requirements for {productname}"
msgstr "Persyaratan Perangkat Keras untuk {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This table shows the software and hardware requirements for deploying "
"{productname} Server on your bare metal machine.  For the purposes of this "
"guide your machine should have 16 GB of RAM, and at least 200 GB of disk "
"space.  For background information about disk space, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "Tabel ini menunjukkan persyaratan perangkat lunak dan perangkat keras untuk menerapkan Server {productname} pada mesin bare metal Anda. Untuk tujuan panduan ini, mesin Anda harus memiliki RAM 16 GB, dan setidaknya ruang disk 200 GB. Untuk informasi latar belakang tentang ruang disk, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Software and Hardware Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Perangkat Lunak dan Perangkat Keras"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Software and Hardware  | Recommended\n"
"| Operating System       | {sl-micro} {microversion} or\n"
"\n"
"                           {sles} {bci-mlm}\n"
"| Architecture           | {x86_64}, {arm}, {s390x}, {ppc64le}\n"
"| Processor (CPU)        | Minimum of four (4) 64-bit CPU cores\n"
"| RAM                    | 16 GB\n"
"| Disk Space             | 200 GB\n"
"| Channel Requirements   | 50 GB per SUSE or openSUSE product\n"
"                          \n"
"                           360 GB per Red Hat product\n"
"| Swap space:            | 8 to 12 GB\n"
msgstr ""
"| Perangkat Lunak dan Perangkat Keras  | Direkomendasikan\n"
"| Sistem Operasi       | {sl-micro} {microversion} atau\n"
"\n"
"                     {sles} {bci-mlm}\n"
"| Arsitektur           | {x86_64}, {arm}, {s390x}, {ppc64le}\n"
"| Prosesor (CPU)        | Minimum empat (4) inti CPU 64-bit\n"
"| RAM                    | 16 GB\n"
"| Ruang Disk             | 200 GB\n"
"| Persyaratan Saluran   | 50 GB per produk SUSE atau openSUSE\n"
"                          \n"
"                           360 GB per produk Red Hat\n"
"| Ruang Swap:            | 8 hingga 12 GB\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported operating system for the Server Container Host"
msgstr "Sistem operasi yang didukung untuk Host Kontainer Server"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The supported operating system for the container host is {sl-micro} "
"{microversion} or {sles} {bci-mlm}."
msgstr "Sistem operasi yang didukung untuk host kontainer adalah {sl-micro} {microversion} atau {sles} {bci-mlm}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:10
msgid ""
"A container host is a server equipped with a container engine like "
"[systemitem]``Podman``, which lets it manage and deploy containers.  These "
"containers hold applications and their essential parts, such as libraries, "
"but not a full operating system, making them lightweight.  This setup "
"ensures applications run the same way in different environments.  The "
"container host supplies the necessary resources such as CPU, memory, and "
"storage for these containers."
msgstr "Host kontainer adalah server yang dilengkapi dengan mesin kontainer seperti [systemitem]``Podman``, yang memungkinkannya mengelola dan menerapkan kontainer. Kontainer ini menampung aplikasi dan bagian penting mereka, seperti pustaka, tetapi bukan sistem operasi lengkap, membuatnya ringan. Penyiapan ini memastikan aplikasi berjalan dengan cara yang sama di lingkungan yang berbeda. Host kontainer menyediakan sumber daya yang diperlukan seperti CPU, memori, dan penyimpanan untuk kontainer ini."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Server deployment mandates the use of a fully qualified domain name (FQDN).  "
"In the absence of automatic DNS provision of an FQDN by your router or "
"network, the deployment process will not proceed successfully.  An FQDN "
"typically follows the format <host>.<domain>.com."
msgstr "Penerapan server mewajibkan penggunaan nama domain lengkap (FQDN). Tanpa penyediaan DNS otomatis untuk FQDN oleh router atau jaringan Anda, proses penerapan tidak akan berhasil. FQDN biasanya mengikuti format <host>.<domain>.com."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:12
msgid "For instance:"
msgstr "Misalnya:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:13
msgid "[literal]``mlm.example.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``mlm.example.com``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:14
msgid "[literal]``mlm.container.lab``"
msgstr "[literal]``mlm.container.lab``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information, see the section on network requirements in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat bagian tentang persyaratan jaringan di xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc[]."

#. In this section you learned how to deploy an {productname} Server container.
#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:16
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Persistent Volumes"
msgstr "Volume Persisten"

#.  This sections needs to be run by devs. How would a customer use custom storage? How do we set this up with mgradm?
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:17
msgid ""
"{productname} {productnumber} defines the required persistent storage "
"volumes by default.  These are created during installation by the "
"[command]``mgradm`` tool if they do not already exist."
msgstr "{productname} {productnumber} mendefinisikan volume penyimpanan persisten yang diperlukan secara default. Volume ini dibuat selama instalasi oleh alat [command]``mgradm`` jika belum ada."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:18
msgid ""
"These volumes are created in [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``, "
"where [systemitem]``Podman`` stores its volumes by default."
msgstr "Volume ini dibuat di [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``, tempat [systemitem]``Podman`` menyimpan volumenya secara default."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommendations"
msgstr "Rekomendasi"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:20
msgid ""
"You can leverage the simplicity of storage by mounting an external storage "
"device to this directory.  Because it will store the {postgresql} database, "
"binary packages for repositories, caches, operating system images, "
"autoinstallation distributions, and configuration files, we have three "
"recommendations:"
msgstr "Anda dapat memanfaatkan kesederhanaan penyimpanan dengan memasang perangkat penyimpanan eksternal ke direktori ini. Karena akan menyimpan basis data {postgresql}, paket biner untuk repositori, cache, citra sistem operasi, distribusi autoinstalasi, dan file konfigurasi, kami memiliki tiga rekomendasi:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fast Storage"
msgstr "Penyimpanan Cepat"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:22
msgid ""
"This mount point should ideally be NVMe or SSD-class devices.  Slower "
"storage will adversely affect {productname} performance."
msgstr "Titik mount ini idealnya adalah perangkat kelas NVMe atau SSD. Penyimpanan yang lebih lambat akan memengaruhi kinerja {productname} secara negatif."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Large Capacity"
msgstr "Kapasitas Besar"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Recommended minimum size for this is at least 300 GB, and larger if there "
"will be multiple Linux distributions or architectures to manage."
msgstr "Ukuran minimum yang direkomendasikan untuk ini adalah setidaknya 300 GB, dan lebih besar jika akan ada beberapa distribusi Linux atau arsitektur yang dikelola."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended Filesystem"
msgstr "Sistem File yang Direkomendasikan"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:26
msgid ""
"XFS (though any supported filesystem for {sl-micro} {microversion} could "
"work)."
msgstr "XFS (meskipun sistem file apa pun yang didukung untuk {sl-micro} {microversion} dapat berfungsi)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Opsional"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:28
msgid ""
"You can provide custom storage for the volumes by mounting disks on the "
"expected volume path inside it such as "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk``.  This adds to "
"the complexity of a {productname} deployment, and may affect the resilience "
"the default storage recommendation provides."
msgstr "Anda dapat menyediakan penyimpanan khusus untuk volume dengan memasang disk pada jalur volume yang diharapkan di dalamnya seperti [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk``. Ini menambah kompleksitas penerapan {productname}, dan dapat memengaruhi ketahanan yang diberikan oleh rekomendasi penyimpanan default."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For a list of all persistent volumes in the container, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk daftar semua volume persisten dalam kontainer, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare {productname} Server Host"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Host Server {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:31
msgid ""
"You can deploy {productname} on {sl-micro} {microversion} or {sles} "
"{bci-mlm}.  {sl-micro} is a transactional system, while {sles} is a full "
"server operating system."
msgstr "Anda dapat menerapkan {productname} di {sl-micro} {microversion} atau {sles} {bci-mlm}. {sl-micro} adalah sistem transaksional, sedangkan {sles} adalah sistem operasi server lengkap."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Depending on your decision, either continue with "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc#deploy-mlm-server-micro[] "
"or with "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc#deploy-mlm-server-sles[] "
"and skip the not selected section."
msgstr "Tergantung pada keputusan Anda, lanjutkan dengan xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc#deploy-mlm-server-micro[] atau dengan xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc#deploy-mlm-server-sles[] dan lewati bagian yang tidak dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:33
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:34
msgid ""
"To continue with deployment, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc#deploy-mlm-server-persistent-storage[]."
msgstr "Untuk melanjutkan dengan penerapan, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc#deploy-mlm-server-persistent-storage[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:35
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:42
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:24
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Custom Persistent Storage"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi Penyimpanan Persisten Khusus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:36
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Configuring persistent storage is optional, but it is the only way to avoid "
"serious trouble with container full disk conditions.  It is highly "
"recommended to configure custom persistent storage with the "
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` tool."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi penyimpanan persisten adalah opsional, tetapi ini adalah satu-satunya cara untuk menghindari masalah serius dengan kondisi disk penuh kontainer. Sangat disarankan untuk mengonfigurasi penyimpanan persisten khusus dengan alat [command]``mgr-storage-server``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:37
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:44
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For more information, see [command]``mgr-storage-server --help``.  This tool "
"simplifies creating the container storage and database volumes."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat [command]``mgr-storage-server --help``. Alat ini menyederhanakan pembuatan penyimpanan kontainer dan volume basis data."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:39
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:48
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:41
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:41
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:46
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:29
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-storage-server <storage-disk-device> [<database-disk-device>]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:41
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:50
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:43
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:49
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:31
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-storage-server /dev/nvme1n1 /dev/nvme2n1\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy {productname} with [literal]``mgradm``"
msgstr "Terapkan {productname} dengan [literal]``mgradm``"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying {productname} {productnumber} Using [literal]``mgradm``"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menerapkan {productname} {productnumber} Menggunakan [literal]``mgradm``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:48
msgid "Log in as root."
msgstr "Masuk sebagai root."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:49
msgid ""
"If the executed command fails ensure that you have registered {productname} "
"{productnumber}.  If you skipped registration during installation and now "
"need to register from the command line, follow the steps below to log in to "
"the registry:"
msgstr "Jika perintah yang dijalankan gagal, pastikan Anda telah mendaftarkan {productname} {productnumber}. Jika Anda melewatkan pendaftaran selama instalasi dan sekarang perlu mendaftar dari baris perintah, ikuti langkah-langkah di bawah ini untuk masuk ke registri:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:50
msgid "Use the {productname} {productnumber} registration key when prompted."
msgstr "Gunakan kunci pendaftaran {productname} {productnumber} ketika diminta."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Enter CA key (certificate authority) and administrator account password when "
"prompted."
msgstr "Masukkan kunci CA (otoritas sertifikat) dan kata sandi akun administrator ketika diminta."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:52
msgid ""
"The administrator account password must be at least 5 characters and less "
"than 48 characters in length."
msgstr "Kata sandi akun administrator harus setidaknya 5 karakter dan kurang dari 48 karakter panjangnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:53
msgid "Press btn:[Enter]."
msgstr "Tekan btn:[Enter]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:54
msgid "Enter the email address of the administration account.  Press btn:[Enter]."
msgstr "Masukkan alamat email akun administrasi. Tekan btn:[Enter]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:55
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:51
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:18
msgid "Wait for deployment to complete."
msgstr "Tunggu hingga penerapan selesai."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:56
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:62
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:52
msgid "Open a browser and proceed to your servers FQDN."
msgstr "Buka browser dan lanjutkan ke FQDN server Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:57
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Enter your username (default is [literal]``admin``) and the password you set "
"during the deployment process."
msgstr "Masukkan nama pengguna Anda (default adalah [literal]``admin``) dan kata sandi yang Anda atur selama proses penerapan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:58
msgid ""
"In this guide you deployed {productname} {productnumber} Server as a "
"container.  Proceed to the next section to add your organization credentials "
"for syncing with {scclongform}."
msgstr "Dalam panduan ini Anda menerapkan Server {productname} {productnumber} sebagai kontainer. Lanjutkan ke bagian berikutnya untuk menambahkan kredensial organisasi Anda untuk sinkronisasi dengan {scclongform}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connect {productname} {productnumber} to {scclongform}"
msgstr "Menghubungkan {productname} {productnumber} ke {scclongform}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:60
msgid ""
"This section covers synchronizing with {scc} from the {webui} and adding "
"your first client channel."
msgstr "Bagian ini mencakup sinkronisasi dengan {scc} dari {webui} dan menambahkan saluran klien pertama Anda."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Entering Organization Credentials"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memasukkan Kredensial Organisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:64
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, select menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, pilih menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:65
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` page select the btn:[Organization "
"Credentials] tab."
msgstr "Dari halaman [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` pilih tab btn:[Organization Credentials]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:66
msgid "Click btn:[Add a new credential]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Add a new credential]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:67
msgid "Point your browser to the {scclongform}."
msgstr "Arahkan browser Anda ke {scclongform}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:68
msgid "Select your organization from the left navigation."
msgstr "Pilih organisasi Anda dari navigasi kiri."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Select the users tab from the top of the page then btn:[Organization "
"Credentials]."
msgstr "Pilih tab users dari bagian atas halaman lalu btn:[Organization Credentials]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:70
msgid "Make a note of your **Mirroring credentials**."
msgstr "Catat **Mirroring credentials** Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:71
msgid ""
"Back in the {productname} {webui} enter your [guimenu]``Username`` and "
"[guimenu]``Password``, and confirm with btn:[Save]."
msgstr "Kembali di {webui} {productname} masukkan [guimenu]``Username`` dan [guimenu]``Password`` Anda, dan konfirmasi dengan btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:72
msgid ""
"When the credentials are confirmed with a green check-mark icon, proceed "
"with <<proc-quickstart-first-channel-sync>>."
msgstr "Ketika kredensial dikonfirmasi dengan ikon tanda centang hijau, lanjutkan dengan <<proc-quickstart-first-channel-sync>>."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing with {scclongform}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Sinkronisasi dengan {scclongform}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:74
msgid "In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."
msgstr "Di {webui}, navigasikan ke menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:75
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` page select the [guimenu]``SUSE "
"Products`` tab.  If you recently registered with {scclongform} a list of "
"products will begin populating the table.  This operation could take up to a "
"few minutes.  You can monitor the progress of the operation in section on "
"the right ``Refresh the product catalog from {scclongform}``.  The table of "
"products lists architecture, channels, and status information.  For more "
"information, see xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc[Wizard]."
msgstr "Dari halaman [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` pilih tab [guimenu]``SUSE Products``. Jika Anda baru saja mendaftar dengan {scclongform}, daftar produk akan mulai mengisi tabel. Operasi ini dapat memakan waktu hingga beberapa menit. Anda dapat memantau kemajuan operasi di bagian di sebelah kanan ``Refresh the product catalog from {scclongform}``. Tabel produk mencantumkan arsitektur, saluran, dan informasi status. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc[Wizard]."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "admin_suse_products.png"
msgstr "admin_suse_products.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:77
msgid ""
"Use the ``Filter by product description`` and ``Filter by architecture`` to "
"filter the list of displayed products.  The channels listed on the "
"btn:[Products] page provide repositories for clients."
msgstr "Gunakan ``Filter by product description`` dan ``Filter by architecture`` untuk memfilter daftar produk yang ditampilkan. Saluran yang terdaftar di halaman btn:[Products] menyediakan repositori untuk klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:78
msgid ""
"Add channels to {productname} by selecting the check box to the left of each "
"channel.  Click the arrow symbol to the left of the description to unfold a "
"product and list available modules."
msgstr "Tambahkan saluran ke {productname} dengan memilih kotak centang di sebelah kiri setiap saluran. Klik simbol panah di sebelah kiri deskripsi untuk membuka produk dan mencantumkan modul yang tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:79
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Add Products] at the top of the page to start product "
"synchronization."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Add Products] di bagian atas halaman untuk memulai sinkronisasi produk."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:80
msgid ""
"After adding the channel, {productname} will schedule the channel to be "
"synchronized.  This can take a long time as {productname} will copy channel "
"software sources from the {suse} repositories located at {scclongform} to "
"the local [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/`` "
"directory of your server."
msgstr "Setelah menambahkan saluran, {productname} akan menjadwalkan saluran untuk disinkronkan. Ini dapat memakan waktu lama karena {productname} akan menyalin sumber perangkat lunak saluran dari repositori {suse} yang terletak di {scclongform} ke direktori [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/`` lokal server Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:81
msgid ""
"When the channel is fully synchronized, a bootstrap repository for it will "
"be automatically generated.  This step is crucial for successfully "
"bootstrapping clients, ensuring that the channel synchronization and "
"distribution are operational on the client side. This completes the "
"installation and configuration of {productname}, along with preparing the "
"channels necessary for bootstrapping clients."
msgstr "Ketika saluran sepenuhnya disinkronkan, repositori bootstrap untuk itu akan otomatis dibuat. Langkah ini penting untuk berhasil melakukan bootstrap klien, memastikan bahwa sinkronisasi dan distribusi saluran beroperasi di sisi klien. Ini menyelesaikan instalasi dan konfigurasi {productname}, bersama dengan mempersiapkan saluran yang diperlukan untuk bootstrap klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:82
msgid ""
"When the channel synchronization process is complete, you can proceed with "
"registering the {productname} {productnumber} Proxy or additional clients."
msgstr "Ketika proses sinkronisasi saluran selesai, Anda dapat melanjutkan dengan mendaftarkan Proxy {productname} {productnumber} atau klien tambahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:83
msgid ""
"For more instructions, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk instruksi lebih lanjut, lihat xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid "Entering the Container for Management"
msgstr "Memasuki Kontainer untuk Manajemen"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:85
msgid "To get to a shell inside the container, run on the container host:"
msgstr "Untuk mendapatkan shell di dalam kontainer, jalankan pada host kontainer:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl term\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Server Deployment as a Virtual Machine - KVM"
msgstr "Penerapan Server {productname} {productnumber} sebagai Mesin Virtual - KVM"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter provides the required Virtual Machine settings for deployment "
"of {productname} {productnumber} as an image.  KVM will be combined with "
"Virtual Machine Manager (_virt-manager_) as a sandbox for this installation."
msgstr "Bab ini menyediakan pengaturan Mesin Virtual yang diperlukan untuk penerapan {productname} {productnumber} sebagai citra. KVM akan dikombinasikan dengan Virtual Machine Manager (_virt-manager_) sebagai sandbox untuk instalasi ini."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:4
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The preferred method for deploying {productname} {productnumber} Server is "
"to use one of the following available images.  All tools are included in "
"these images greatly simplifying deployment."
msgstr "Metode yang disukai untuk menerapkan Server {productname} {productnumber} adalah menggunakan salah satu citra yang tersedia berikut. Semua alat disertakan dalam citra ini yang sangat menyederhanakan penerapan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:5
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Images for {productname} {productnumber} are available at "
"link:https://www.suse.com/download/suse-manager/[{productname} "
"{productnumber} VM images]."
msgstr "Citra untuk {productname} {productnumber} tersedia di link:https://www.suse.com/download/suse-manager/[{productname} {productnumber} VM images]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:6
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:8
