"This table specifies the minimum requirements.  These are suitable for a "
"quick test installation, such as a server with one client.  If you want to "
"use a production environment and need background information about disk "
"space, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "Tabel ini menentukan persyaratan minimum. Ini cocok untuk instalasi uji cepat, seperti server dengan satu klien. Jika Anda ingin menggunakan lingkungan produksi dan memerlukan informasi latar belakang tentang ruang disk, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."

