#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:13
msgid "If updates were applied reboot."
msgstr "Jika pemutakhiran diterapkan, reboot."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:46
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:39
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:26
msgid ""
"This step is optional.  However, if custom persistent storage is required "
"for your infrastructure, use the [command]``mgr-storage-server`` tool."
msgstr "Langkah ini opsional. Namun, jika penyimpanan persisten khusus diperlukan untuk infrastruktur Anda, gunakan alat [command]``mgr-storage-server``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:47
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For more information, see [command]``mgr-storage-server --help``.  This tool "
"simplifies creating the container storage and database volumes.  Use the "
"command in the following manner:"
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat [command]``mgr-storage-server --help``. Alat ini menyederhanakan pembuatan penyimpanan kontainer dan volume basis data. Gunakan perintah dengan cara berikut:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:51
msgid ""
"This command will move the persistent storage volumes at "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` to specified storage devices."
msgstr "Perintah ini akan memindahkan volume penyimpanan persisten di [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` ke perangkat penyimpanan yang ditentukan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{productname} {productnumber} Server Deployment as a Virtual Machine - "
"VMware"
msgstr "Penerapan Server {productname} {productnumber} sebagai Mesin Virtual - VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter provides the required Virtual Machine settings for deployment "
"of {productname} {productnumber} as an Image.  VMware will be used as a "
"sandbox for this installation."
msgstr "Bab ini menyediakan pengaturan Mesin Virtual yang diperlukan untuk penerapan {productname} {productnumber} sebagai Citra. VMware akan digunakan sebagai sandbox untuk instalasi ini."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Virtual Machine Settings - VMware"
msgstr "Pengaturan Mesin Virtual {productname} - VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This sections describes VMware configurations, focusing on the creation of "
"an extra virtual disk essential for the {productname} storage partition "
"within VMware environments."
msgstr "Bagian ini menjelaskan konfigurasi VMware, berfokus pada pembuatan disk virtual tambahan yang penting untuk partisi penyimpanan {productname} dalam lingkungan VMware."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Download {productname} Server [filename]``.vmdk`` file then transfer a copy "
"to your VMware storage."
msgstr "Unduh file [filename]``.vmdk`` Server {productname} lalu transfer salinannya ke penyimpanan VMware Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:17
msgid "Add an additional [systemitem]``Hard Disk 2`` of 500 GB (or more)."
msgstr "Tambahkan [systemitem]``Hard Disk 2`` tambahan sebesar 500 GB (atau lebih)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Before starting obtain your {productname} Registration Code from "
"{scclongform} - https://scc.suse.com."
msgstr "Sebelum memulai, dapatkan Kode Pendaftaran {productname} Anda dari {scclongform} - https://scc.suse.com."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:30
msgid "Register {sl-micro} with {scc}."
msgstr "Daftarkan {sl-micro} dengan {scc}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:35
msgid "Reboot"
msgstr "Reboot"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrating the {productname} Proxy to {opensuse} Tumbleweed"
msgstr "Memigrasikan Proxy {productname} ke {opensuse} Tumbleweed"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This page describes how to migrate a {productname} Proxy host from openSUSE "
"Leap Micro 5.5 to a fresh openSUSE Tumbleweed installation using the proxy "
"administration tool [command]``mgrpxy``."
msgstr "Halaman ini menjelaskan cara memigrasikan host Proxy {productname} dari openSUSE Leap Micro 5.5 ke instalasi openSUSE Tumbleweed baru menggunakan alat administrasi proxy [command]``mgrpxy``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This guide was tested on Tumbleweed only. There is no known reason it "
"wouldn’t work on other supported bases, but always validate in a test "
"environment before production."
msgstr "Panduan ini diuji hanya di Tumbleweed. Tidak ada alasan yang diketahui mengapa ini tidak akan berfungsi pada basis yang didukung lainnya, tetapi selalu validasi di lingkungan uji sebelum produksi."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of the Proxy Migration Process"
msgstr "Ringkasan Proses Migrasi Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:5
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:4
msgid "You will:"
msgstr "Anda akan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Save proxy configuration from the old system (including Apache/Squid "
"tuning)."
msgstr "Simpan konfigurasi proxy dari sistem lama (termasuk penyetelan Apache/Squid)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:7
msgid "Reinstall the host with openSUSE Tumbleweed."
msgstr "Instal ulang host dengan openSUSE Tumbleweed."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:8
msgid "Re-register the host using the system reactivation key."
msgstr "Daftarkan ulang host menggunakan kunci reaktivasi sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:9
msgid "Install [command]``mgrpxy`` (and Podman if needed)."
msgstr "Instal [command]``mgrpxy`` (dan Podman jika diperlukan)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Restore configuration and run [command]``mgrpxy install podman`` with "
"optional tuning files."
msgstr "Pulihkan konfigurasi dan jalankan [command]``mgrpxy install podman`` dengan file penyetelan opsional."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:11
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:10
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements and Considerations"
msgstr "Persyaratan dan Pertimbangan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Keep the same hostname/FQDN and IP when possible so the server and clients "
"interact with the proxy as before."
msgstr "Pertahankan nama host/FQDN dan IP yang sama jika memungkinkan sehingga server dan klien berinteraksi dengan proxy seperti sebelumnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Ensure you have the “system reactivation key” for the existing proxy system "
"(UI: Systems > select the proxy > Details > Reactivation)."
msgstr "Pastikan Anda memiliki \"kunci reaktivasi sistem\" untuk sistem proxy yang ada (UI: Systems > pilih proxy > Details > Reactivation)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Ensure SSH/scp access to move configuration archives off and onto the "
"machine."
msgstr "Pastikan akses SSH/scp untuk memindahkan arsip konfigurasi keluar dan masuk ke mesin."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:15
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migration Procedure"
msgstr "Prosedur Migrasi"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Save Proxy Configuration and Tuning Files"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Simpan Konfigurasi Proxy dan File Penyetelan"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Save Proxy Configuration and Tuning Files"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyimpan Konfigurasi Proxy dan File Penyetelan"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:18
msgid "Copy the Uyuni proxy configuration directory to a safe location:"
msgstr "Salin direktori konfigurasi proxy Uyuni ke lokasi yang aman:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "scp -r /etc/uyuni <USER>@<HOST>:/some/where/safe/\n"
msgstr "scp -r /etc/uyuni <USER>@<HOST>:/some/where/safe/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Identify Apache and Squid tuning files currently in use by the legacy proxy "
"services:"
msgstr "Identifikasi file penyetelan Apache dan Squid yang saat ini digunakan oleh layanan proxy lama:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"systemctl cat uyuni-proxy-httpd.service | grep EXTRA_CONF= | sed "
"'s/.*=-v\\([^:]\\+\\):.*/\\1/'\n"
"systemctl cat uyuni-proxy-squid.service | grep EXTRA_CONF= | sed "
"'s/.*=-v\\([^:]\\+\\):.*/\\1/'\n"
msgstr ""
"systemctl cat uyuni-proxy-httpd.service | grep EXTRA_CONF= | sed 's/.*=-v\\([^:]\\+\\):.*/\\1/'\n"
"systemctl cat uyuni-proxy-squid.service | grep EXTRA_CONF= | sed 's/.*=-v\\([^:]\\+\\):.*/\\1/'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:22
msgid "Copy those tuning files to the same safe location as well."
msgstr "Salin file penyetelan tersebut ke lokasi aman yang sama juga."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:23
msgid "Typical default paths after you copy them back will be:"
msgstr "Jalur default tipikal setelah Anda menyalinnya kembali adalah:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:24
msgid "Apache tuning: [path]``/etc/uyuni/proxy/apache.conf``"
msgstr "Penyetelan Apache: [path]``/etc/uyuni/proxy/apache.conf``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:25
msgid "Squid tuning: [path]``/etc/uyuni/proxy/squid.conf``"
msgstr "Penyetelan Squid: [path]``/etc/uyuni/proxy/squid.conf``"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:26
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Reinstall the Host with openSUSE Tumbleweed"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Instal Ulang Host dengan openSUSE Tumbleweed"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Reinstalling the Host with openSUSE Tumbleweed"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal Ulang Host dengan openSUSE Tumbleweed"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:28
msgid "Reinstall the machine with openSUSE Tumbleweed (server profile recommended)."
msgstr "Instal ulang mesin dengan openSUSE Tumbleweed (profil server direkomendasikan)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:29
msgid "Set the same hostname/FQDN and IP as before when possible."
msgstr "Atur nama host/FQDN dan IP yang sama seperti sebelumnya jika memungkinkan."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Re-register the Host with the Reactivation Key"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Daftarkan Ulang Host dengan Kunci Reaktivasi"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Re-registering the Host with the Reactivation Key"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mendaftarkan Ulang Host dengan Kunci Reaktivasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:32
msgid ""
"From the {productname} Web UI, obtain the system reactivation key for the "
"existing proxy system record (Systems > Details > Reactivation)."
msgstr "Dari Web UI {productname}, dapatkan kunci reaktivasi sistem untuk catatan sistem proxy yang ada (Systems > Details > Reactivation)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Bootstrap/re-register the Tumbleweed host using that reactivation key so it "
"claims the existing system entry."
msgstr "Bootstrap/daftarkan ulang host Tumbleweed menggunakan kunci reaktivasi tersebut sehingga mengklaim entri sistem yang ada."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Use your standard bootstrapping process for Tumbleweed hosts in your "
"environment (for example, the bootstrap script or your configuration "
"management), ensuring the reactivation key is applied."
msgstr "Gunakan proses bootstrapping standar Anda untuk host Tumbleweed di lingkungan Anda (misalnya, skrip bootstrap atau manajemen konfigurasi Anda), pastikan kunci reaktivasi diterapkan."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Install {productname} Proxy Tools and Podman"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Instal Alat Proxy {productname} dan Podman"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Proxy Tools and Podman"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal Alat Proxy dan Podman"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:37
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:33
msgid "Add the Uyuni Stable repository and install tools:"
msgstr "Tambahkan repositori Uyuni Stable dan instal alat:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper ar "
"https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Proxy-POOL-x86_64-Media1 "
"uyuni-proxy-stable\n"
"zypper ref\n"
"zypper in mgrpxy mgrctl mgrpxy-bash-completion mgrctl-bash-completion\n"
msgstr ""
"zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Proxy-POOL-x86_64-Media1 uyuni-proxy-stable\n"
"zypper ref\n"
"zypper in mgrpxy mgrctl mgrpxy-bash-completion mgrctl-bash-completion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:39
msgid "Ensure Podman is installed (required to run containers):"
msgstr "Pastikan Podman terinstal (diperlukan untuk menjalankan kontainer):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:40
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:36
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in podman\n"
msgstr "zypper in podman\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5: Restore Configuration and Install the Proxy"
msgstr "Langkah 5: Pulihkan Konfigurasi dan Instal Proxy"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restoring Configuration and Install the Proxy"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memulihkan Konfigurasi dan Menginstal Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:43
msgid "Copy back the saved configuration directory to the new host:"
msgstr "Salin kembali direktori konfigurasi yang disimpan ke host baru:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "scp -r <USER>@<HOST>:/some/where/safe/uyuni /etc/\n"
msgstr "scp -r <USER>@<HOST>:/some/where/safe/uyuni /etc/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:45
msgid ""
"If you saved Apache/Squid tuning files, place them at the expected default "
"paths or note their locations for parameters in the next command:"
msgstr "Jika Anda menyimpan file penyetelan Apache/Squid, tempatkan di jalur default yang diharapkan atau catat lokasinya untuk parameter dalam perintah berikutnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Default paths expected by mgrpxy parameters (adjust/move your files "
"accordingly)\n"
"# Apache tuning: /etc/uyuni/proxy/apache.conf\n"
"# Squid tuning:  /etc/uyuni/proxy/squid.conf\n"
msgstr ""
"# Jalur default yang diharapkan oleh parameter mgrpxy (sesuaikan/pindahkan file Anda sesuai)\n"
"# Penyetelan Apache: /etc/uyuni/proxy/apache.conf\n"
"# Penyetelan Squid:  /etc/uyuni/proxy/squid.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Run the proxy installation with Podman. If you do not use tuning files, omit "
"the corresponding parameters:"
msgstr "Jalankan instalasi proxy dengan Podman. Jika Anda tidak menggunakan file penyetelan, hilangkan parameter yang sesuai:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# With tuning files\n"
"mgrpxy install podman \\\n"
"\t--tuning-httpd /etc/uyuni/proxy/apache.conf \\\n"
"\t--tuning-squid /etc/uyuni/proxy/squid.conf\n"
msgstr ""
"# With tuning files\n"
"mgrpxy install podman \\\n"
"\t--tuning-httpd /etc/uyuni/proxy/apache.conf \\\n"
"\t--tuning-squid /etc/uyuni/proxy/squid.conf\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# If you have no tuning files, remove the tuning parameters:\n"
"# mgrpxy install podman\n"
msgstr ""
"# Jika Anda tidak memiliki file penyetelan, hapus parameter penyetelan:\n"
"# mgrpxy install podman\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In an upcoming release, if tuning files are placed at the default paths "
"noted above, the explicit parameters will not be required."
msgstr "Dalam rilis mendatang, jika file penyetelan ditempatkan di jalur default yang disebutkan di atas, parameter eksplisit tidak akan diperlukan."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6: Verify the Proxy"
msgstr "Langkah 6: Verifikasi Proxy"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Verifying the Proxy"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memverifikasi Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:53
msgid "Check containers are running:"
msgstr "Periksa apakah kontainer berjalan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl ps\n"
"# or\n"
"podman ps\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl ps\n"
"# or\n"
"podman ps\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Confirm the proxy appears healthy in the {productname} Web UI and that "
"clients using this proxy operate normally."
msgstr "Konfirmasi proxy muncul sehat di Web UI {productname} dan bahwa klien yang menggunakan proxy ini beroperasi secara normal."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:57
msgid ""
"If Podman was missing, install it and rerun the [command]``mgrpxy install`` "
"step."
msgstr "Jika Podman tidak ada, instal dan jalankan ulang langkah [command]``mgrpxy install``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:58
msgid "Verify the host’s time, hostname, and IP match expectations."
msgstr "Verifikasi waktu, nama host, dan IP host sesuai dengan harapan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-proxy-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:59
msgid ""
"If the host did not reattach to the existing system record, confirm you used "
"the correct reactivation key and repeat the bootstrap."
msgstr "Jika host tidak menempel kembali ke catatan sistem yang ada, konfirmasi Anda menggunakan kunci reaktivasi yang benar dan ulangi bootstrap."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrating the {productname} Server to {opensuse} Tumbleweed"
msgstr "Memigrasikan Server {productname} ke {opensuse} Tumbleweed"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This page describes a simple, backup-and-restore migration of a "
"{productname} Server running on openSUSE Leap Micro 5.5 to a fresh host "
"running openSUSE Tumbleweed as the base OS."
msgstr "Halaman ini menjelaskan migrasi backup-dan-restore sederhana dari Server {productname} yang berjalan di openSUSE Leap Micro 5.5 ke host baru yang menjalankan openSUSE Tumbleweed sebagai OS dasar."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of the Migration Process"
msgstr "Ringkasan Proses Migrasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Create a full server backup with [command]``mgradm backup`` on the openSUSE "
"Leap Micro 5.5 host."
msgstr "Buat backup server lengkap dengan [command]``mgradm backup`` pada host openSUSE Leap Micro 5.5."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:6
msgid "Reinstall the host with openSUSE Tumbleweed (server profile)."
msgstr "Instal ulang host dengan openSUSE Tumbleweed (profil server)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:7
msgid "Install {productname} tools and prerequisites on Tumbleweed."
msgstr "Instal alat dan prasyarat {productname} di Tumbleweed."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:8
msgid "Restore the backup with [command]``mgradm backup restore``."
msgstr "Pulihkan backup dengan [command]``mgradm backup restore``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:9
msgid "Start services and verify the server."
msgstr "Mulai layanan dan verifikasi server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Source server: openSUSE Leap Micro 5.5 running {productname} (for example: "
"{productnumber})."
msgstr "Server sumber: openSUSE Leap Micro 5.5 yang menjalankan {productname} (misalnya: {productnumber})."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Target server: openSUSE Tumbleweed with the same hostname/FQDN and IP "
"(recommended) to avoid client-side changes."
msgstr "Server target: openSUSE Tumbleweed dengan nama host/FQDN dan IP yang sama (direkomendasikan) untuk menghindari perubahan di sisi klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:13
msgid "SSH/scp access between machines for transferring the backup tarball."
msgstr "Akses SSH/scp antar mesin untuk mentransfer tarball backup."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Sufficient free disk space on both source and target for the backup and "
"restore."
msgstr "Ruang disk bebas yang cukup pada sumber dan target untuk backup dan restore."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Restore to the same {productname} version you backed up, or a version "
"explicitly documented as compatible for restore. If you use development or "
"preview repositories (for example, Uyuni Master), expect changes and "
"re-validate."
msgstr "Pulihkan ke versi {productname} yang sama dengan yang Anda backup, atau versi yang secara eksplisit didokumentasikan sebagai kompatibel untuk restore. Jika Anda menggunakan repositori pengembangan atau pratinjau (misalnya, Uyuni Master), harapkan perubahan dan validasi ulang."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Create a Backup on the openSUSE Leap Micro 5.5 Server"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Buat Backup pada Server openSUSE Leap Micro 5.5"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure:  Create a Backup"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Backup"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:19
msgid "As root on the old server, create a backup directory and run the backup:"
msgstr "Sebagai root pada server lama, buat direktori backup dan jalankan backup:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup /tmp/uyuni-backup\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup /tmp/uyuni-backup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:21
msgid "Package the backup for transfer:"
msgstr "Kemas backup untuk transfer:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "tar -C /tmp -cvf /tmp/uyuni-backup.tar uyuni-backup\n"
msgstr "tar -C /tmp -cvf /tmp/uyuni-backup.tar uyuni-backup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:23
msgid "Copy the backup to a safe location you can reach from the new host:"
msgstr "Salin backup ke lokasi aman yang dapat Anda jangkau dari host baru:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "scp /tmp/uyuni-backup.tar <USER>@<HOST>:/path/to/store/\n"
msgstr "scp /tmp/uyuni-backup.tar <USER>@<HOST>:/path/to/store/\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You can store the backup to external storage or an object store as long as "
"you can fetch it on the new host."
msgstr "Anda dapat menyimpan backup ke penyimpanan eksternal atau object store selama Anda dapat mengambilnya di host baru."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Reinstalling the Host"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal Ulang Host"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:28
msgid "Reprovision the VM or bare-metal host with openSUSE Tumbleweed."
msgstr "Provision ulang VM atau host bare-metal dengan openSUSE Tumbleweed."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:29
msgid "Choose a basic “server profile” installation."
msgstr "Pilih instalasi \"profil server\" dasar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Set the same hostname/FQDN and IP address as the original server if you want "
"clients to reconnect seamlessly."
msgstr "Atur nama host/FQDN dan alamat IP yang sama dengan server asli jika Anda ingin klien terhubung kembali tanpa hambatan."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Install {productname} Tools and Prerequisites on Tumbleweed"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Instal Alat dan Prasyarat {productname} di Tumbleweed"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Tools and Prerequisites"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal Alat dan Prasyarat"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper ar "
"https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Server-POOL-x86_64-Media1 "
"uyuni-server-stable\n"
"zypper ref\n"
"zypper in mgradm mgrctl mgradm-bash-completion mgrctl-bash-completion "
"uyuni-storage-setup-server\n"
msgstr ""
"zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Server-POOL-x86_64-Media1 uyuni-server-stable\n"
"zypper ref\n"
"zypper in mgradm mgrctl mgradm-bash-completion mgrctl-bash-completion uyuni-storage-setup-server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:35
msgid "Install Podman if it was not automatically pulled in:"
msgstr "Instal Podman jika tidak otomatis ditarik:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:37
msgid ""
"The package [package]``uyuni-storage-setup-server`` provides the "
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` tool for preparing persistent "
"volumes. Installing [package]``podman`` explicitly may be necessary on some "
"installations."
msgstr "Paket [package]``uyuni-storage-setup-server`` menyediakan alat [command]``mgr-storage-server`` untuk menyiapkan volume persisten. Menginstal [package]``podman`` secara eksplisit mungkin diperlukan pada beberapa instalasi."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Optional - Prepare Persistent Storage"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Opsional - Menyiapkan Penyimpanan Persisten"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Prepareing Persistent Storage"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyiapkan Penyimpanan Persisten"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:40
msgid ""
"It is recommended to configure persistent storage with "
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` to avoid container full-disk issues."
msgstr "Disarankan untuk mengonfigurasi penyimpanan persisten dengan [command]``mgr-storage-server`` untuk menghindari masalah disk penuh kontainer."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Devices must be raw (no existing filesystem). The tool creates volumes at "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."
msgstr "Perangkat harus raw (tidak ada sistem file yang ada). Alat ini membuat volume di [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:43
msgid "For details, see:"
msgstr "Untuk detail, lihat:"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5 Fetch and Restore the Backup on Tumbleweed"
msgstr "Langkah 5 Ambil dan Pulihkan Backup di Tumbleweed"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Fetching and Restoring the Backup"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengambil dan Memulihkan Backup"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:48
msgid "Copy the backup to the new server and unpack it:"
msgstr "Salin backup ke server baru dan ekstrak:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"scp <USER>@<HOST>:/path/to/store/uyuni-backup.tar /tmp/\n"
"tar -C /tmp -xvf /tmp/uyuni-backup.tar\n"
msgstr ""
"scp <USER>@<HOST>:/path/to/store/uyuni-backup.tar /tmp/\n"
"tar -C /tmp -xvf /tmp/uyuni-backup.tar\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:50
msgid "Restore using [command]``mgradm`` (point to the extracted backup directory):"
msgstr "Pulihkan menggunakan [command]``mgradm`` (arahkan ke direktori backup yang diekstrak):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup restore /tmp/uyuni-backup\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup restore /tmp/uyuni-backup\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6: Start Services and Verify"
msgstr "Langkah 6: Mulai Layanan dan Verifikasi"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Starting Services and Verifying"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memulai Layanan dan Memverifikasi"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:54
msgid "Start the server services:"
msgstr "Mulai layanan server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm start\n"
msgstr "mgradm start\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:56
msgid "Verify:"
msgstr "Verifikasi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Check that all containers are up: [command]``mgrctl ps`` or "
"[command]``podman ps``."
msgstr "Periksa bahwa semua kontainer aktif: [command]``mgrctl ps`` atau [command]``podman ps``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:58
msgid "Access the Web UI (HTTPS) and log in."
msgstr "Akses Web UI (HTTPS) dan masuk."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Review logs for errors: [command]``mgrctl logs server`` and other components "
"as needed."
msgstr "Tinjau log untuk kesalahan: [command]``mgrctl logs server`` dan komponen lain sesuai kebutuhan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "___\n"
msgstr "___\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notes and Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Catatan dan Pemecahan Masalah"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:62
msgid ""
"If Podman wasn’t installed automatically, install it with [command]``zypper "
"in podman`` and rerun the restore/start steps."
msgstr "Jika Podman tidak terinstal secara otomatis, instal dengan [command]``zypper in podman`` dan jalankan ulang langkah restore/start."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Ensure the target host has the same time, hostname, and IP configuration "
"expected by your setup (especially if clients exist)."
msgstr "Pastikan host target memiliki waktu, nama host, dan konfigurasi IP yang sama seperti yang diharapkan oleh penyiapan Anda (terutama jika klien ada)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:64
msgid ""
"For large environments, ensure adequate disk throughput and space. The "
"backup and restore can take a long time."
msgstr "Untuk lingkungan besar, pastikan throughput dan ruang disk yang memadai. Backup dan restore dapat memakan waktu lama."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:65
msgid ""
"If the restore fails or the new system cannot start, you can still boot the "
"original openSUSE Leap Micro 5.5 system and continue service. Keep the "
"original VM/snapshots until you fully validate the new Tumbleweed-based "
"server."
msgstr "Jika restore gagal atau sistem baru tidak dapat dimulai, Anda masih dapat mem-boot sistem openSUSE Leap Micro 5.5 asli dan melanjutkan layanan. Simpan VM/snapshot asli hingga Anda sepenuhnya memvalidasi server berbasis Tumbleweed baru."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Legacy {productname} Server Migration to Container"
msgstr "Migrasi Server {productname} Lama ke Kontainer"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To migrate a legacy {productname} Server to a container, a new machine is "
"required."
msgstr "Untuk memigrasikan Server {productname} lama ke kontainer, diperlukan mesin baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In the context of this migration, the legacy {productname} Server (RPM "
"installation) is sometimes also called _old server_."
msgstr "Dalam konteks migrasi ini, Server {productname} lama (instalasi RPM) kadang-kadang juga disebut _server lama_."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hostnames"
msgstr "Nama Host"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Neither in-place migration is not possible nor allows the migration "
"procedure currently any hostname renaming functionality."
msgstr "Baik migrasi in-place tidak memungkinkan maupun prosedur migrasi saat ini tidak memungkinkan fungsi penggantian nama host."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Thus the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) on the new server will remain "
"identical to that on the legacy server."
msgstr "Dengan demikian nama domain lengkap (FQDN) pada server baru akan tetap identik dengan yang ada di server lama."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:8
msgid ""
"After migration, it is necessary to update the DHCP and DNS records to point "
"to the new server."
msgstr "Setelah migrasi, perlu memperbarui catatan DHCP dan DNS untuk menunjuk ke server baru."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:9
msgid "For more information, see <<migration-finalization>>."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat <<migration-finalization>>."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSL certificates"
msgstr "Sertifikat SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:11
msgid ""
"During a migration, the server SSL certificate and CA chain are copied from "
"the source server, meaning that only the database certificates are required"
msgstr "Selama migrasi, sertifikat SSL server dan rantai CA disalin dari server sumber, yang berarti bahwa hanya sertifikat database yang diperlukan"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG keys"
msgstr "Kunci GPG"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:13
msgid "Self trusted GPG keys are not migrated."
msgstr "Kunci GPG yang dipercaya sendiri tidak dimigrasikan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:14
msgid ""
"GPG keys that are trusted in the RPM database only are not migrated.  Thus "
"synchronizing channels with [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` can fail."
msgstr "Kunci GPG yang dipercaya di basis data RPM saja tidak dimigrasikan. Dengan demikian sinkronisasi saluran dengan [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` dapat gagal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The administrator must migrate these keys manually from the legacy "
"{productname} installation to the container host after the actual server "
"migration."
msgstr "Administrator harus memigrasikan kunci ini secara manual dari instalasi {productname} lama ke host kontainer setelah migrasi server yang sebenarnya."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Manual Migration of the GPG Keys to New Server"
msgstr "Prosedur: Migrasi Manual Kunci GPG ke Server Baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Copy the keys from the legacy Uyuni server to the container host of the new "
"server."
msgstr "Salin kunci dari server Uyuni lama ke host kontainer server baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Later, add each key to the migrated server with the command "
"[command]``mgradm gpg add <PATH_TO_KEY_FILE>``."
msgstr "Nanti, tambahkan setiap kunci ke server yang dimigrasikan dengan perintah [command]``mgradm gpg add <PATH_TO_KEY_FILE>``."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initial Preparation on the Legacy Server"
msgstr "Persiapan Awal pada Server Lama"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The migration can take a very long time depending on the amount of data that "
"needs to be replicated.  To reduce downtime it is possible to run the "
"migration multiple times in a process of _initial replication_, "
"_re-replication_, or _final replication and switch over_ while all the "
"services on the legacy server can stay up and running."
msgstr "Migrasi dapat memakan waktu sangat lama tergantung pada jumlah data yang perlu direplikasi. Untuk mengurangi waktu henti, dimungkinkan untuk menjalankan migrasi beberapa kali dalam proses _replikasi awal_, _re-replikasi_, atau _replikasi akhir dan peralihan_ sementara semua layanan pada server lama dapat tetap aktif dan berjalan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Only during the final migration the processes on the legacy server need to "
"be stopped."
msgstr "Hanya selama migrasi akhir proses pada server lama perlu dihentikan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For all non-final replications add the parameter [command]``--prepare`` to "
"prevent the automatic stopping the services on the legacy server.  For "
"example:"
msgstr "Untuk semua replikasi non-akhir tambahkan parameter [command]``--prepare`` untuk mencegah penghentian otomatis layanan pada server lama. Misalnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm migrate podman <oldserver.fqdn> --prepare\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Initial Preparation on the Legacy Server"
msgstr "Prosedur: Persiapan Awal pada Server Lama"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:25
msgid "Stop the {productname} services:"
msgstr "Hentikan layanan {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-service stop\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:27
msgid "Stop the PostgreSQL service:"
msgstr "Hentikan layanan PostgreSQL:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl stop postgresql\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSH Connection Preparation"
msgstr "Persiapan Koneksi SSH"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing the SSH connection"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyiapkan koneksi SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Ensure that for [systemitem]``root`` an SSH key exists on the new "
"{productnumber} server.  If a key does not exist, create it with the "
"command:"
msgstr "Pastikan untuk [systemitem]``root`` kunci SSH ada di server {productnumber} baru. Jika kunci tidak ada, buat dengan perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh-keygen -t rsa\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The SSH configuration and agent should be ready on the new server host for a "
"connection to the legacy server that does not prompt for a password."
msgstr "Konfigurasi dan agen SSH harus siap di host server baru untuk koneksi ke server lama yang tidak meminta kata sandi."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "eval $(ssh-agent); ssh-add\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:35
msgid ""
"To establish a connection without prompting for a password, the migration "
"script relies on an SSH agent running on the new server.  If the agent is "
"not active yet, initiate it by running [command]``eval $(ssh-agent)``.  Then "
"add the SSH key to the running agent with [command]``ssh-add`` followed by "
"the path to the private key.  You will be prompted to enter the password for "
"the private key during this process."
msgstr "Untuk membangun koneksi tanpa meminta kata sandi, skrip migrasi bergantung pada agen SSH yang berjalan di server baru. Jika agen belum aktif, mulai dengan menjalankan [command]``eval $(ssh-agent)``. Lalu tambahkan kunci SSH ke agen yang berjalan dengan [command]``ssh-add`` diikuti dengan jalur ke kunci privat. Anda akan diminta untuk memasukkan kata sandi untuk kunci privat selama proses ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Copy the public SSH key to the legacy {productname} Server "
"([literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>``) with [command]``ssh-copy-id``.  Replace "
"[literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>`` with the FQDN of the legacy server:"
msgstr "Salin kunci SSH publik ke Server {productname} lama ([literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>``) dengan [command]``ssh-copy-id``. Ganti [literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>`` dengan FQDN server lama:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh-copy-id <oldserver.fqdn>\n"
msgstr "ssh-copy-id <oldserver.fqdn>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:38
msgid ""
"The SSH key will be copied into the legacy server's "
"[path]``~/.ssh/authorized_keys`` file.  For more information, see the "
"[literal]``ssh-copy-id`` manpage."
msgstr "Kunci SSH akan disalin ke file [path]``~/.ssh/authorized_keys`` server lama. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat halaman manual [literal]``ssh-copy-id``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Establish an SSH connection from the new server to the legacy {productname} "
"Server to check that no password is needed.  Also there must not by any "
"problem with the host fingerprint.  In case of trouble, remove old "
"fingerprints from the [path]``~/.ssh/known_hosts`` file.  Then try again.  "
"The fingerprint will be stored in the local [path]``~/.ssh/known_hosts`` "
"file."
msgstr "Buat koneksi SSH dari server baru ke Server {productname} lama untuk memeriksa bahwa tidak ada kata sandi yang diperlukan. Juga tidak boleh ada masalah dengan sidik jari host. Jika ada masalah, hapus sidik jari lama dari file [path]``~/.ssh/known_hosts``. Lalu coba lagi. Sidik jari akan disimpan di file [path]``~/.ssh/known_hosts`` lokal."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:40
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform the Migration"
msgstr "Lakukan Migrasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:41
msgid ""
"When planning your migration from a legacy {productname} to a containerized "
"{productname}, ensure that your target instance meets or exceeds the "
"specifications of the legacy setup.  This includes, but is not limited to, "
"memory (RAM), CPU Cores, Storage, and Network Bandwidth."
msgstr "Saat merencanakan migrasi Anda dari {productname} lama ke {productname} terkontainerisasi, pastikan bahwa instance target Anda memenuhi atau melebihi spesifikasi penyiapan lama. Ini termasuk, tetapi tidak terbatas pada, memori (RAM), Inti CPU, Penyimpanan, dan Bandwidth Jaringan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Devices must not have any filesystem.  The command aborts if a filesystem "
"exists on the storage device."
msgstr "Perangkat tidak boleh memiliki sistem file apa pun. Perintah akan berhenti jika sistem file ada di perangkat penyimpanan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Execute the following command to install a new {productname} server.  "
"Replace [literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>`` with the FQDN of the legacy server:"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah berikut untuk menginstal server {productname} baru. Ganti [literal]``<oldserver.fqdn>`` dengan FQDN server lama:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:56
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm migrate podman <oldserver.fqdn>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:57
msgid "Migrate trusted SSL CA certificates."
msgstr "Migrasikan sertifikat CA SSL yang dipercaya."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migration of the Certificates"
msgstr "Migrasi Sertifikat"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Trusted SSL CA certificates that were installed as part of an RPM and stored "
"on a legacy {productname} in the [path]``/usr/share/pki/trust/anchors/`` "
"directory will not be migrated.  Because {suse} does not install RPM "
"packages in the container, the administrator must migrate these certificate "
"files manually from the legacy installation after migration:"
msgstr "Sertifikat CA SSL tepercaya yang diinstal sebagai bagian dari RPM dan disimpan pada {productname} lama di direktori [path]``/usr/share/pki/trust/anchors/`` tidak akan dimigrasikan. Karena {suse} tidak menginstal paket RPM di dalam kontainer, administrator harus memigrasikan file sertifikat ini secara manual dari instalasi lama setelah migrasi:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Migrating the Certificates"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memigrasikan Sertifikat"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:61
msgid "Copy the file from the legacy server to the new server."
msgstr "Salin file dari server lama ke server baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:62
msgid "For example, as [path]``/local/ca.file``."
msgstr "Misalnya, sebagai [path]``/local/ca.file``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:63
msgid "Copy the file into the container with the command:"
msgstr "Salin file ke dalam kontainer dengan perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl cp /local/ca.file server:/etc/pki/trust/anchors/\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finalize migration"
msgstr "Menyelesaikan migrasi"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:66
msgid ""
"After successfully running the [command]``mgradm migrate`` command, the "
"{salt} setup on all clients will still point to the legacy server."
msgstr "Setelah berhasil menjalankan perintah [command]``mgradm migrate``, penyiapan {salt} pada semua klien masih akan menunjuk ke server lama."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:67
msgid ""
"To redirect them to the new {productnumber} server, it is required to rename "
"the new server at the infrastructure level (DHCP and DNS) to use the same "
"FQDN and IP address as the legacy server."
msgstr "Untuk mengarahkan ulang mereka ke server {productnumber} baru, diperlukan untuk mengubah nama server baru di tingkat infrastruktur (DHCP dan DNS) untuk menggunakan FQDN dan alamat IP yang sama dengan server lama."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:68
msgid ""
"If something goes wrong with the migration it is possible to restart the old "
"system.  As root, restart {postgresql} and the spacewalk services with the "
"following commands:"
msgstr "Jika ada yang salah dengan migrasi, dimungkinkan untuk memulai ulang sistem lama. Sebagai root, mulai ulang {postgresql} dan layanan spacewalk dengan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"service postgresql start\n"
"spacewalk-service start\n"
msgstr ""
"service postgresql start\n"
"spacewalk-service start\n"

#.  FIXME: check the following!  Partially probably already covered above.!
#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Kubernetes Preparations"
msgstr "Persiapan Kubernetes"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:71
msgid ""
"Before executing the migration with [command]``mgradm migrate`` command, it "
"is essential to predefine **Persistent Volumes**, especially considering "
"that the migration job initiates the container from scratch."
msgstr "Sebelum menjalankan migrasi dengan perintah [command]``mgradm migrate``, penting untuk mendefinisikan sebelumnya **Volume Persisten**, terutama mengingat bahwa pekerjaan migrasi memulai kontainer dari awal."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:72
msgid ""
"For more information, see the installation section on preparing these "
"volumes in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat bagian instalasi tentang menyiapkan volume ini di xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrating"
msgstr "Migrasi"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:74
msgid ""
"Execute the following command to install a new {productname} server, "
"replacing **<oldserver.fqdn>** with the appropriate FQDN of the legacy "
"server:"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah berikut untuk menginstal server {productname} baru, mengganti **<oldserver.fqdn>** dengan FQDN yang sesuai dari server lama:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:76
msgid "or"
msgstr "atau"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm migrate kubernetes <oldserver.fqdn>\n"
msgstr "mgradm migrate kubernetes <oldserver.fqdn>\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-to-a-container.adoc:78
msgid ""
"After successfully running the [command]``mgradm migrate`` command, the "
"{salt} setup on all clients will still point to the legacy server.  To "
"redirect them to the new server, it is required to rename the new server at "
"the infrastructure level (DHCP and DNS) to use the same FQDN and IP address "
"as the legacy server."
msgstr "Setelah berhasil menjalankan perintah [command]``mgradm migrate``, penyiapan {salt} pada semua klien masih akan menunjuk ke server lama. Untuk mengarahkan ulang mereka ke server baru, diperlukan untuk mengubah nama server baru di tingkat infrastruktur (DHCP dan DNS) untuk menggunakan FQDN dan alamat IP yang sama dengan server lama."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Containerized {productname} Proxy Setup"
msgstr "Penyiapan Proxy {productname} Terkontainerisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Once container host for {productname} Proxy containers is prepared, setup of "
"containers require few additional steps to finish configuration."
msgstr "Setelah host kontainer untuk kontainer Proxy {productname} disiapkan, penyiapan kontainer memerlukan beberapa langkah tambahan untuk menyelesaikan konfigurasi."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:3
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "Prosedur"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid "Generate {productname} Proxy configuration archive file"
msgstr "Buat file arsip konfigurasi Proxy {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Transfer configuration archive to the container host prepared in "
"installation step and extract it"
msgstr "Transfer arsip konfigurasi ke host kontainer yang disiapkan dalam langkah instalasi dan ekstrak"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid "Start the proxy sevices with [literal]``mgrpxy``"
msgstr "Mulai layanan proxy dengan [literal]``mgrpxy``"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transfer {productname} Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "Transfer Konfigurasi Proxy {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Both [command]``spacecmd`` command and generating via {webui} ways create a "
"configuration archive.  This archive needs to be made available on container "
"host.  Transfer this generated archive to the container host."
msgstr "Baik perintah [command]``spacecmd`` maupun pembuatan melalui {webui} membuat arsip konfigurasi. Arsip ini perlu tersedia di host kontainer. Transfer arsip yang dibuat ini ke host kontainer."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Start {productname} Proxy Containers"
msgstr "Mulai Kontainer Proxy {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid "Container can be started with the [literal]``mgrpxy`` command."
msgstr "Kontainer dapat dimulai dengan perintah [literal]``mgrpxy``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Start {productname} Proxy Containers"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memulai Kontainer Proxy {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid "Run command:"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrpxy start uyuni-proxy-pod\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid "Check if all containers started up as expected by calling:"
msgstr "Periksa apakah semua kontainer dimulai seperti yang diharapkan dengan memanggil:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Five {productname} Proxy containers should be present and should be part of "
"[literal]``proxy-pod`` container pod."
msgstr "Lima kontainer Proxy {productname} harus ada dan harus menjadi bagian dari pod kontainer [literal]``proxy-pod``."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy conversion from client"
msgstr "Konversi proxy dari klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"It assumes that the proxy host system has already been bootstrapped and "
"subscribed to the base operating system channel."
msgstr "Ini mengasumsikan bahwa sistem host proxy telah di-bootstrap dan berlangganan saluran sistem operasi dasar."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:29
msgid "Transfer the certificates from {productname} server host"
msgstr "Transfer sertifikat dari host server {productname}"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"scp <UYUNI-FQDN>:/root/proxycert.pem ./\n"
"scp <UYUNI-FQDN>:/root/proxykey.pem ./\n"
"scp <UYUNI-FQDN>:/root/rootca.pem ./\n"
msgstr ""
"scp <UYUNI-FQDN>:/root/proxycert.pem ./\n"
"scp <UYUNI-FQDN>:/root/proxykey.pem ./\n"
"scp <UYUNI-FQDN>:/root/rootca.pem ./\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `mgrpxy`"
msgstr "Instal `mgrpxy`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The `mgrpxy` tool must be installed from a repository matching your "
"system. Choose the appropriate repository from:"
msgstr "Alat `mgrpxy` harus diinstal dari repositori yang cocok dengan sistem Anda. Pilih repositori yang sesuai dari:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:34
msgid "https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable:/ContainerUtils/"
msgstr "https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable:/ContainerUtils/"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example {opensuse} {tumbleweed} installation:"
msgstr "Contoh instalasi {opensuse} {tumbleweed}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper ar "
"https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable:/ContainerUtils/openSUSE_Tumbleweed/ "
"uyuni-containerutils\n"
"zypper ref\n"
"zypper in mgrpxy\n"
msgstr ""
"zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable:/ContainerUtils/openSUSE_Tumbleweed/ uyuni-containerutils\n"
"zypper ref\n"
"zypper in mgrpxy\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Container Images"
msgstr "Instal Citra Kontainer"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper ar "
"https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable/containerfile/ "
"uyuni-proxy-images\n"
"zypper ref\n"
"zypper in uyuni-proxy-httpd-image \\\n"
"           uyuni-proxy-salt-broker-image \\\n"
"           uyuni-proxy-squid-image \\\n"
"           uyuni-proxy-ssh-image \\\n"
"           uyuni-proxy-tftpd-image\n"
msgstr ""
"zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable/containerfile/ uyuni-proxy-images\n"
"zypper ref\n"
"zypper in uyuni-proxy-httpd-image \\\n"
"           uyuni-proxy-salt-broker-image \\\n"
"           uyuni-proxy-squid-image \\\n"
"           uyuni-proxy-ssh-image \\\n"
"           uyuni-proxy-tftpd-image\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [literal]``Registry`` option can be used if connectivity to the "
"container image registry is available.\n"
"If selected, you will be prompted to choose between two sub-options: "
"[literal]``Simple`` or [literal]``Advanced``."
msgstr ""
"Opsi [literal]``Registry`` dapat digunakan jika konektivitas ke registri citra kontainer tersedia.\n"
"Jika dipilih, Anda akan diminta untuk memilih antara dua sub-opsi: [literal]``Simple`` atau [literal]``Advanced``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:57
msgid "For [literal]``Registry URL`` use: [literal]``registry.opensuse.org/uyuni``."
msgstr "Untuk [literal]``Registry URL`` gunakan: [literal]``registry.opensuse.org/uyuni``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:60
msgid ""
"For each individual container URL field, use the registry: "
"[literal]``registry.opensuse.org/uyuni`` followed by the corresponding "
"suffix, for example, `_proxy-httpd_` or `_salt-broker_`."
msgstr "Untuk setiap bidang URL kontainer individual, gunakan registri: [literal]``registry.opensuse.org/uyuni`` diikuti dengan akhiran yang sesuai, misalnya, `_proxy-httpd_` atau `_salt-broker_`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Proxy Deployment on {opensuse} {tumbleweed}"
msgstr "Penerapan Proxy {productname} di {opensuse} {tumbleweed}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide outlines the deployment process for the {productname} "
"{productnumber} Proxy.  This guide presumes you have already successfully "
"deployed a {productname} {productnumber} Server.  To successfully deploy, "
"you will perform the following actions:"
msgstr "Panduan ini menguraikan proses penerapan untuk Proxy {productname} {productnumber}. Panduan ini mengasumsikan Anda telah berhasil menerapkan Server {productname} {productnumber}. Untuk berhasil menerapkan, Anda akan melakukan tindakan berikut:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checklist: Proxy Deployment"
msgstr "Daftar Periksa: Penerapan Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid "Install {opensuse} {tumbleweed} on a bare-metal machine."
msgstr "Instal {opensuse} {tumbleweed} pada mesin bare-metal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid "Bootstrap the Proxy as a {salt} minion."
msgstr "Bootstrap Proxy sebagai minion {salt}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid "Generate a Proxy configuration."
msgstr "Buat konfigurasi Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid "Transfer the Proxy configuration from Server to Proxy"
msgstr "Transfer konfigurasi Proxy dari Server ke Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Use the Proxy configuration to register the {salt} minion as a Proxy with "
"{productname}."
msgstr "Gunakan konfigurasi Proxy untuk mendaftarkan minion {salt} sebagai Proxy dengan {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The supported operating system for the container host is {opensuse} "
"{tumbleweed}."
msgstr "Sistem operasi yang didukung untuk host kontainer adalah {opensuse} {tumbleweed}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid ""
"A container host is a server equipped with a container engine like Podman, "
"which lets it manage and deploy containers. These containers hold "
"applications and their essential parts, such as libraries, but not a full "
"operating system, making them lightweight. This setup ensures applications "
"run the same way in different environments. The container host supplies the "
"necessary resources such as CPU, memory, and storage for these containers."
msgstr "Host kontainer adalah server yang dilengkapi dengan mesin kontainer seperti Podman, yang memungkinkannya mengelola dan menerapkan kontainer. Kontainer ini menampung aplikasi dan bagian penting mereka, seperti pustaka, tetapi bukan sistem operasi lengkap, membuatnya ringan. Penyiapan ini memastikan aplikasi berjalan dengan cara yang sama di lingkungan yang berbeda. Host kontainer menyediakan sumber daya yang diperlukan seperti CPU, memori, dan penyimpanan untuk kontainer ini."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware Requirements for the Proxy"
msgstr "Persyaratan Perangkat Keras untuk Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid ""
"This table shows the hardware requirements for deploying {productname} "
"Proxy."
msgstr "Tabel ini menunjukkan persyaratan perangkat keras untuk menerapkan Proxy {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:16
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy Hardware Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Perangkat Keras Proxy"

