"| [path]``/`` (root directory)\n"
"| Minimum 40 GB\n"
"\n"
"|\n"
"| [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``\n"
"| Minimum 100 GB, Storage requirements should be calculated for the number "
"of ISO distribution images, containers, and bootstrap repositories you will "
