#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:18
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container Host General Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Umum Host Kontainer"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:19
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For general requirements, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[General "
"requirements]."
msgstr "Untuk persyaratan umum, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[Persyaratan umum]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid ""
"An {opensuse} {tumbleweed} server should be installed from installation "
"media.  This procedure is described below."
msgstr "Server {opensuse} {tumbleweed} harus diinstal dari media instalasi. Prosedur ini dijelaskan di bawah."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:21
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container Host Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Host Kontainer"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:22
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For CPU, RAM, and storage requirements, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[Hardware "
"requirements]."
msgstr "Untuk persyaratan CPU, RAM, dan penyimpanan, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[Persyaratan perangkat keras]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:23
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To guarantee that clients can resolve the FQDN domain name, both the "
"containerized server and the host machines must be linked to a functional "
"DNS server. Additionally, it is essential to ensure correct configuration of "
"reverse lookups."
msgstr "Untuk menjamin bahwa klien dapat menyelesaikan nama domain FQDN, baik server terkontainerisasi maupun mesin host harus terhubung ke server DNS yang berfungsi. Selain itu, penting untuk memastikan konfigurasi lookup terbalik yang benar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:25
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This step is optional.  However, if custom persistent storage is required "
"for your infrastructure, use the [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` tool."
msgstr "Langkah ini opsional. Namun, jika penyimpanan persisten khusus diperlukan untuk infrastruktur Anda, gunakan alat [command]``mgr-storage-proxy``."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap the Proxy Host as a Minion"
msgstr "Bootstrap Host Proxy sebagai Minion"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task: Bootstrap the Proxy Host"
msgstr "Tugas: Bootstrap Host Proxy"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:37
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:3
msgid "Select menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."
msgstr "Pilih menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:38
msgid "Fill in the fields for your Proxy host."
msgstr "Isi bidang untuk host Proxy Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:39
msgid "Select the Activation key created in the previous step from the dropdown."
msgstr "Pilih kunci Aktivasi yang dibuat di langkah sebelumnya dari daftar turun bawah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:40
msgid "Click btn:[+ Bootstrap]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[+ Bootstrap]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Wait for the Bootstrap process to complete successfully.  Check the "
"menu:Salt[] menu and confirm the {salt} minion key is listed and accepted."
msgstr "Tunggu hingga proses Bootstrap selesai dengan sukses. Periksa menu menu:Salt[] dan konfirmasi bahwa kunci minion {salt} terdaftar dan diterima."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:42
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:46
msgid "Reboot the Proxy host."
msgstr "Reboot host Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Select the host from the menu:System[] list and trigger a second reboot "
"after all events are finished to conclude the onboarding."
msgstr "Pilih host dari daftar menu:System[] dan trigger reboot kedua setelah semua peristiwa selesai untuk menyelesaikan onboarding."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task: Update the Proxy Host"
msgstr "Tugas: Memperbarui Host Proxy"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:45
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Select the host from the menu:Systems[] list and apply all patches to update "
"it."
msgstr "Pilih host dari daftar menu:Systems[] dan terapkan semua patch untuk memperbaruinya."

#.  FIXME 2024-12-10, ke: use the snippet also here (see MLM equiv)
#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "Membuat Konfigurasi Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:48
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The configuration archive of the {productname} Proxy is generated by the "
"{productname} Server.  Each additional Proxy requires its own configuration "
"archive."
msgstr "Arsip konfigurasi Proxy {productname} dibuat oleh Server {productname}. Setiap Proxy tambahan memerlukan arsip konfigurasinya sendiri."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:49
msgid ""
"The container host for the {productname} Proxy must be registered as a salt "
"minion to the {productname} Server prior to generating this Proxy "
"configuration."
msgstr "Host kontainer untuk Proxy {productname} harus terdaftar sebagai minion salt ke Server {productname} sebelum membuat konfigurasi Proxy ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:50
msgid "You will perform the following tasks:"
msgstr "Anda akan melakukan tugas berikut:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure:"
msgstr "Prosedur:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:52
msgid "Generate a Proxy configuration file."
msgstr "Buat file konfigurasi Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:53
msgid "Transfer the configuration to the Proxy."
msgstr "Transfer konfigurasi ke Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:54
msgid "Start the Proxy with the [literal]``mgrpxy`` command."
msgstr "Mulai Proxy dengan perintah [literal]``mgrpxy``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task: Generating a Proxy Container Configuration using Web UI"
msgstr "Tugas: Membuat Konfigurasi Kontainer Proxy menggunakan Web UI"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:56
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] and fill the "
"required data:"
msgstr "Di {webui}, navigasikan ke menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] dan isi data yang diperlukan:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:57
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Proxy FQDN`` field type fully qualified domain name for "
"the proxy."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``Proxy FQDN`` ketik nama domain lengkap untuk proxy."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:58
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Parent FQDN`` field type fully qualified domain name for "
"the {productname} Server or another {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``Parent FQDN`` ketik nama domain lengkap untuk Server {productname} atau Proxy {productname} lain."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:59
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Proxy SSH port`` field type SSH port on which SSH service "
"is listening on {productname} Proxy. Recommended is to keep default 8022."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``Proxy SSH port`` ketik port SSH tempat layanan SSH mendengarkan pada Proxy {productname}. Disarankan untuk tetap menggunakan default 8022."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:60
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size [MB]`` field type maximal allowed "
"size for Squid cache. Typically this should be at most 60% of available "
"storage for the containers."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size [MB]`` ketik ukuran maksimum yang diizinkan untuk cache Squid. Biasanya ini harus paling banyak 60% dari penyimpanan yang tersedia untuk kontainer."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:61
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSL certificate`` selection list choose if new server "
"certificate should be generated for {productname} Proxy or an existing one "
"should be used.  You can consider generated certificates as {productname} "
"builtin (self signed) certificates."
msgstr "Di daftar pilihan [guimenu]``SSL certificate`` pilih apakah sertifikat server baru harus dibuat untuk Proxy {productname} atau yang sudah ada harus digunakan. Anda dapat menganggap sertifikat yang dibuat sebagai sertifikat builtin (ditandatangani sendiri) {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:62
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Depending on the choice then provide either path to signing CA certificate "
"to generate a new certificate or path to an existing certificate and its key "
"to be used as proxy certificate."
msgstr "Tergantung pada pilihan kemudian berikan jalur ke sertifikat CA penandatangan untuk membuat sertifikat baru atau jalur ke sertifikat yang ada dan kuncinya untuk digunakan sebagai sertifikat proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:63
msgid ""
"The CA certificates generated on the server are stored in the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/_data/ssl-build`` "
"directory."
msgstr "Sertifikat CA yang dibuat di server disimpan di direktori [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/_data/ssl-build``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:64
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For more information about existing or custom certificates and the concept "
"of corporate and intermediate certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang sertifikat yang ada atau khusus dan konsep sertifikat korporat dan perantara, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:65
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Generate] to register new proxy FQDN in {productname} Server and "
"generate configuration archive with details for container host."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Generate] untuk mendaftarkan FQDN proxy baru di Server {productname} dan membuat arsip konfigurasi dengan detail untuk host kontainer."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:66
msgid ""
"After a few moments you are presented with file to download. Save this file "
"locally."
msgstr "Setelah beberapa saat Anda disajikan dengan file untuk diunduh. Simpan file ini secara lokal."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:67
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-transfer_proxy_config.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transfer the Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "Transfer Konfigurasi Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:68
msgid ""
"The {webui} generates a configuration archive.  This archive needs to be "
"made available on the Proxy container host."
msgstr "{webui} membuat arsip konfigurasi. Arsip ini perlu tersedia di host kontainer Proxy."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task: Copy the Proxy configuration"
msgstr "Tugas: Menyalin konfigurasi Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:70
msgid "Copy the files to the Proxy host:"
msgstr "Salin file ke host Proxy:"

