msgstr "Penerapan Proxy {productname} di K3s"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing K3s"
msgstr "Menginstal K3s"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"On the container host machine, install [literal]``K3s`` (replace "
"[literal]``<K3S_HOST_FQDN>`` with the FQDN of your K3s host):"
msgstr "Pada mesin host kontainer, instal [literal]``K3s`` (ganti [literal]``<K3S_HOST_FQDN>`` dengan FQDN host K3s Anda):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -sfL https://get.k3s.io | "
"INSTALL_K3S_EXEC=\"--tls-san=<K3S_HOST_FQDN>\" sh -\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing Tools"
msgstr "Menginstal Alat"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The installation requires the [literal]``mgrpxy`` and [literal]``helm`` "
"packages."
msgstr "Instalasi memerlukan paket [literal]``mgrpxy`` dan [literal]``helm``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid "Install Helm by using the installer script:"
msgstr "Instal Helm dengan menggunakan skrip penginstal:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -fsSL -o get_helm.sh "
"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/helm/helm/main/scripts/get-helm-3\n"
"chmod 700 get_helm.sh\n"
"./get_helm.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"curl -fsSL -o get_helm.sh https://raw.githubusercontent.com/helm/helm/main/scripts/get-helm-3\n"
"chmod 700 get_helm.sh\n"
"./get_helm.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid "For more information, see https://helm.sh/docs/intro/install/#from-script."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat https://helm.sh/docs/intro/install/#from-script."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The [literal]``mgrpxy`` package is available in the container utils "
"repository.  Pick the one matching the distribution in: "
"https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable:/ContainerUtils/."
msgstr "Paket [literal]``mgrpxy`` tersedia di repositori utilitas kontainer. Pilih yang cocok dengan distribusi di: https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable:/ContainerUtils/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid "To install package on Leap Micro run:"
msgstr "Untuk menginstal paket di Leap Micro jalankan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update pkg install mgrpxy\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To configure the storage of the volumes to be used by the {productname} "
"Proxy pod, define persistent volumes for the following claims.  If you do "
"not customize the storage configuration, K3s will automatically create the "
"storage volumes for you."
msgstr "Untuk mengonfigurasi penyimpanan volume yang akan digunakan oleh pod Proxy {productname}, definisikan volume persisten untuk klaim berikut. Jika Anda tidak menyesuaikan konfigurasi penyimpanan, K3s akan secara otomatis membuat volume penyimpanan untuk Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:17
msgid "The persistent volume claims are named:"
msgstr "Klaim volume persisten dinamai:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid "[literal]``squid-cache-pv-claim``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:19
msgid "[literal]``/package-cache-pv-claim``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "[literal]``/tftp-boot-pv-claim``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Create the configuration for the {productname} Proxy as documented in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc[].  "
"Copy the configuration [literal]``tar.gz`` file and then install:"
msgstr "Buat konfigurasi untuk Proxy {productname} seperti yang didokumentasikan di xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-container-setup-uyuni.adoc[]. Salin file konfigurasi [literal]``tar.gz`` lalu instal:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrpxy install kubernetes /path/to/config.tar.gz\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:23
msgid "For more information see:"
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut lihat:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:24
msgid ""
"link:https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/storage/persistent-volumes/[] "
"(Kubernetes)"
msgstr "link:https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/storage/persistent-volumes/[] (Kubernetes)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-k3s-deployment-uyuni.adoc:25
msgid "link:https://rancher.com/docs/k3s/latest/en/storage/[] (K3s) documentation"
msgstr "link:https://rancher.com/docs/k3s/latest/en/storage/[] (K3s) dokumentasi"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Legacy Proxy Migration to Container"
msgstr "Migrasi Proxy Lama ke Kontainer"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The containerized proxy now is managed by a set of systemd services.  For "
"managing the containerized proxy, use the [command]``mgrpxy`` tool."
msgstr "Proxy terkontainerisasi sekarang dikelola oleh serangkaian layanan systemd. Untuk mengelola proxy terkontainerisasi, gunakan alat [command]``mgrpxy``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This section will help you migrate from the legacy [systemitem]``systemd`` "
"proxy using the [command]``mgrpxy`` tool."
msgstr "Bagian ini akan membantu Anda bermigrasi dari proxy [systemitem]``systemd`` lama menggunakan alat [command]``mgrpxy``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"An in-place migration from previous releases of {productname} to "
"{productnumber} will remain unsupported due to the HostOS change from {leap} "
"to {leapmicro}."
msgstr "Migrasi in-place dari rilis {productname} sebelumnya ke {productnumber} akan tetap tidak didukung karena perubahan HostOS dari {leap} ke {leapmicro}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The traditional contact protocol is no longer supported in {productname} "
"{productnumber} and later.  Before migrating from previous {productname} "
"releases to {productnumber}, any existing traditional clients including the "
"traditional proxies must be migrated to {salt}."
msgstr "Protokol kontak tradisional tidak lagi didukung di {productname} {productnumber} dan yang lebih baru. Sebelum bermigrasi dari rilis {productname} sebelumnya ke {productnumber}, semua klien tradisional yang ada termasuk proxy tradisional harus dimigrasikan ke {salt}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate From Legacy to Containerized Proxy With Systemd"
msgstr "Migrasi Dari Proxy Lama ke Proxy Terkontainerisasi Dengan Systemd"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:7
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "Membuat Konfigurasi Proxy"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generate the Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Konfigurasi Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid "Log in to the {productname} Server {webui}."
msgstr "Masuk ke {webui} Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid "Select menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] from the left navigation."
msgstr "Pilih menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] dari navigasi kiri."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid "Enter your Proxy FQDN. Use the same FQDN as the original proxy host."
msgstr "Masukkan FQDN Proxy Anda. Gunakan FQDN yang sama dengan host proxy asli."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid "Enter your Server FQDN."
msgstr "Masukkan FQDN Server Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Enter the Proxy port number. __We recommend using the default port of "
"8022.__"
msgstr "Masukkan nomor port Proxy. __Kami menyarankan menggunakan port default 8022.__"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Certificate and private key are located on the Server container host in "
"`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/_data/ssl-build/`."
msgstr "Sertifikat dan kunci privat terletak di host kontainer Server di `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/_data/ssl-build/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid "RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT"
msgstr "RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid "RHN-ORG-PRIVATE-SSL-KEY"
msgstr "RHN-ORG-PRIVATE-SSL-KEY"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:17
msgid "Copy the certificate and key to your machine with:"
msgstr "Salin sertifikat dan kunci ke mesin Anda dengan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"scp root@uyuni-server-example.com:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-PRIVATE-SSL-KEY "
".\n"
"scp root@uyuni-server-example.com:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT "
".\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:19
msgid "Select btn:[Choose File] and browse your local machine for the certificate."
msgstr "Pilih btn:[Choose File] dan telusuri mesin lokal Anda untuk sertifikat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "Select btn:[Choose File] and brose your local machine for the private key."
msgstr "Pilih btn:[Choose File] dan telusuri mesin lokal Anda untuk kunci privat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:21
msgid "Enter the CA password."
msgstr "Masukkan kata sandi CA."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid "Click btn:[Generate]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Generate]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transfer Proxy Configuration to New Host"
msgstr "Transfer Konfigurasi Proxy ke Host Baru"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Transfering the Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mentransfer Konfigurasi Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:25
msgid ""
"From the Server transfer the generated tar.gz file containing the proxy "
"configuration to the new Proxy host:"
msgstr "Dari Server transfer file tar.gz yang dibuat berisi konfigurasi proxy ke host Proxy baru:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "scp config.tar.gz <uyuni-proxy-FQDN>:/root/\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:27
msgid "Disable the legacy proxy prior to executing the next step:"
msgstr "Nonaktifkan proxy lama sebelum menjalankan langkah berikutnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-proxy stop\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:29
msgid "Deploy the new Proxy with:"
msgstr "Terapkan Proxy baru dengan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl start uyuni-proxy-pod\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:31
msgid "Enable the new Proxy with:"
msgstr "Aktifkan Proxy baru dengan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable --now uyuni-proxy-pod\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:33
msgid "Run `podman ps` to verify all the containers are present and running:"
msgstr "Jalankan `podman ps` untuk memverifikasi semua kontainer ada dan berjalan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"proxy-salt-broker\n"
"proxy-httpd\n"
"proxy-tftpd\n"
"proxy-squid\n"
"proxy-ssh\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Migrate {productname} Proxy to {productname} {productnumber} Containerized "
"Proxy"
msgstr "Migrasikan Proxy {productname} ke Proxy Terkontainerisasi {productname} {productnumber}"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Migrate {productname} Containerized Proxy to {productname} "
"{productnumber} New Containerized Proxy"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memigrasikan Proxy Terkontainerisasi {productname} ke Proxy Terkontainerisasi Baru {productname} {productnumber}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:37
msgid "Boot your new machine and begin installation of {leapmicro} {microversion}."
msgstr "Boot mesin baru Anda dan mulai instalasi {leapmicro} {microversion}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:38
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:23
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:17
msgid "Complete the installation."
msgstr "Selesaikan instalasi."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update --continue\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Install [command]``mgrpxy`` and optionally, "
"[command]``mgrpxy-bash-completion``:"
msgstr "Instal [command]``mgrpxy`` dan opsional, [command]``mgrpxy-bash-completion``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update pkg install mgrpxy mgrpxy-bash-completion \n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:44
msgid "Copy your [literal]``tar.gz`` proxy configuration to the host."
msgstr "Salin konfigurasi proxy [literal]``tar.gz`` Anda ke host."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Packages Using the {webui}"
msgstr "Menginstal Paket Menggunakan {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:46
msgid ""
"The [package]``mgrpxy`` and [package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion`` packages can "
"also be installed via the web UI after the minion has been bootstrapped and "
"registered with the Server."
msgstr "Paket [package]``mgrpxy`` dan [package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion`` juga dapat diinstal melalui UI web setelah minion di-bootstrap dan terdaftar dengan Server."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Packages Using the {webui}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal Paket Menggunakan {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:48
msgid ""
"After installation, ensure that the {sle-micro} {microversion} parent "
"channel and Proxy child channels are added and synchronized from the "
"menu:Admin[Setup Wizard -> Products] page."
msgstr "Setelah instalasi, pastikan bahwa saluran induk {sle-micro} {microversion} dan saluran anak Proxy ditambahkan dan disinkronkan dari halaman menu:Admin[Setup Wizard -> Products]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:49
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, go to menu:Systems[Activation Keys] and create an activation "
"key linked for the synchronized {sle-micro} {microversion} channel."
msgstr "Di {webui}, pergi ke menu:Systems[Activation Keys] dan buat kunci aktivasi yang ditautkan untuk saluran {sle-micro} {microversion} yang disinkronkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Bootstrap your system as a minion using the menu:Systems[Bootstrapping] "
"page."
msgstr "Bootstrap sistem Anda sebagai minion menggunakan halaman menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Once the new machine is onboarded and displayed in the systems list, select "
"the system and navigate to the menu:System Details[Install Package] page."
msgstr "Setelah mesin baru di-onboard dan ditampilkan di daftar sistem, pilih sistem dan navigasikan ke halaman menu:System Details[Install Package]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:52
msgid ""
"Install the packages [package]``mgrpxy`` and "
"[package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion``."
msgstr "Instal paket [package]``mgrpxy`` dan [package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:53
msgid "Reboot the system."
msgstr "Reboot sistem."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate Proxy Config With [literal]``spacecmd`` and Self-Signed Certificate"
msgstr "Membuat Konfigurasi Proxy Dengan [literal]``spacecmd`` dan Sertifikat Ditandatangani Sendiri"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:55
msgid "You can generate a Proxy configuration using spacecmd."
msgstr "Anda dapat membuat konfigurasi Proxy menggunakan spacecmd."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Generate Proxy Config With [literal]``spacecmd`` and Self-Signed "
"Certificate"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Konfigurasi Proxy Dengan [literal]``spacecmd`` dan Sertifikat Ditandatangani Sendiri"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:57
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:30
msgid "SSH into your container host."
msgstr "SSH ke host kontainer Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:58
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:69
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:31
msgid "Execute the following command replacing the Server and Proxy FQDN:"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah berikut mengganti FQDN Server dan Proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:59
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config_generate_cert -- "
"dev-pxy.example.com dev-srv.example.com 2048 email@example.com -o "
"/tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:60
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:71
msgid "Copy the generated config to the Proxy:"
msgstr "Salin konfigurasi yang dibuat ke Proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:61
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:72
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:34
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:44
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl cp server:/tmp/config.tar.gz .\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:62
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:73
msgid "Deploy the Proxy with:"
msgstr "Terapkan Proxy dengan:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate Proxy Config With [literal]``spacecmd`` and Custom Certificate"
msgstr "Membuat Konfigurasi Proxy Dengan [literal]``spacecmd`` dan Sertifikat Khusus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:65
msgid ""
"You can generate Proxy configuration using [literal]``spacecmd`` for a "
"custom certificates rather than default self-signed certificates."
msgstr "Anda dapat membuat konfigurasi Proxy menggunakan [literal]``spacecmd`` untuk sertifikat khusus daripada sertifikat ditandatangani sendiri default."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:66
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:20
msgid ""
"2 GB represents the default proxy squid cache size.  This will need to be "
"adjusted for your environment."
msgstr "2 GB mewakili ukuran cache squid proxy default. Ini perlu disesuaikan untuk lingkungan Anda."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Generate Proxy Config With [literal]``spacecmd`` and Custom "
"Certificate"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Konfigurasi Proxy Dengan [literal]``spacecmd`` dan Sertifikat Khusus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:68
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:38
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:48
msgid "SSH into your Server container host."
msgstr "SSH ke host kontainer Server Anda."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-migration-uyuni.adoc:70
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for f in ca.crt proxy.crt proxy.key; do\n"
"  mgrctl cp $f server:/tmp/$f\n"
"done\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config -- -p 8022 pxy.example.com "
"srv.example.com 2048 email@example.com /tmp/ca.crt /tmp/proxy.crt "
"/tmp/proxy.key -o /tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can easily pull container images using [systemitem]``Podman`` or "
"[systemitem]``Docker`` on a machine with internet access."
msgstr "Anda dapat dengan mudah menarik citra kontainer menggunakan [systemitem]``Podman`` atau [systemitem]``Docker`` pada mesin dengan akses internet."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Pulling the images"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menarik citra"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Pull the desired images, then save the images as a [literal]``tar`` "
"archive.  For example:"
msgstr "Tarik citra yang diinginkan, lalu simpan citra sebagai arsip [literal]``tar``. Misalnya:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Podman"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman pull registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server:latest "
"registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server-postgresql:latest\n"
"podman save -m --output images.tar registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server:latest "
"registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server-postgresql:latest\n"
msgstr ""
"podman pull registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server:latest registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server-postgresql:latest\n"
"podman save -m --output images.tar registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server:latest registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server-postgresql:latest\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Docker"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"docker pull registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server:latest "
"registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server-postgresql:latest\n"
"docker save --output images.tar registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server:latest "
"registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server-postgresql:latest\n"
msgstr ""
"docker pull registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server:latest registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server-postgresql:latest\n"
"docker save --output images.tar registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server:latest registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server-postgresql:latest\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Transfer the resulting [filename]``images.tar`` to the Server container host "
"and load it using the following command:"
msgstr "Transfer [filename]``images.tar`` yang dihasilkan ke host kontainer Server dan muat menggunakan perintah berikut:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Load the server image"
msgstr "Muat citra server"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "podman load -i images.tar\n"
msgstr "podman load -i images.tar\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtaining container images for {salt} formulas in air-gapped environments"
msgstr "Memperoleh citra kontainer untuk formula {salt} di lingkungan terisolasi jaringan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid "The images are available from `registry.opensuse.org`."
msgstr "Citra tersedia dari `registry.opensuse.org`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Obtaining formula images for air-gapped environments"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memperoleh citra formula untuk lingkungan terisolasi jaringan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid "On a system with Internet access, pull the required images. For example:"
msgstr "Pada sistem dengan akses Internet, tarik citra yang diperlukan. Misalnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman pull registry.opensuse.org/opensuse/bind:latest\n"
"podman pull registry.opensuse.org/opensuse/kea:latest\n"
msgstr ""
"podman pull registry.opensuse.org/opensuse/bind:latest\n"
"podman pull registry.opensuse.org/opensuse/kea:latest\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman save -o formula-images.tar registry.opensuse.org/opensuse/bind:latest "
"registry.opensuse.org/opensuse/kea:latest\n"
msgstr "podman save -o formula-images.tar registry.opensuse.org/opensuse/bind:latest registry.opensuse.org/opensuse/kea:latest\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy {productname} on {opensuse} {tumbleweed}"
msgstr "Terapkan {productname} di {opensuse} {tumbleweed}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:26
msgid ""
"{productname} also provides all the needed container images in RPM packages "
"that can be installed on the system."
msgstr "{productname} juga menyediakan semua citra kontainer yang diperlukan dalam paket RPM yang dapat diinstal pada sistem."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:27
msgid ""
"User should make the needed RPM available on the internal network. That can "
"be done by using a second {productname} Server or any kind of mirror."
msgstr "Pengguna harus membuat RPM yang diperlukan tersedia di jaringan internal. Itu dapat dilakukan dengan menggunakan Server {productname} kedua atau jenis mirror apa pun."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Install {productname} on {opensuse} {tumbleweed} in air-gapped "
"environment"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal {productname} di {opensuse} {tumbleweed} dalam lingkungan terisolasi jaringan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:29
msgid "Install {opensuse} {tumbleweed}."
msgstr "Instal {opensuse} {tumbleweed}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Install tools packages and image packages (replace $ARCH$ with the correct "
"architecture):"
msgstr "Instal paket alat dan paket citra (ganti $ARCH$ dengan arsitektur yang benar):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper install mgradm* mgrctl* uyuni-server*-image*\n"
msgstr "zypper install mgradm* mgrctl* uyuni-server*-image*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Deploy {productname} with [command]``mgradm``. In an Air-gapped environment "
"you may want to use the option [command]``--pullPolicy Never``."
msgstr "Terapkan {productname} dengan [command]``mgradm``. Di lingkungan Terisolasi Jaringan Anda mungkin ingin menggunakan opsi [command]``--pullPolicy Never``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:34
msgid ""
"For more detailed information about installing {productname} Server on "
"{opensuse} {tumbleweed}, see "
"xref:container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc[Server "
"Deployment]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih rinci tentang menginstal Server {productname} di {opensuse} {tumbleweed}, lihat xref:container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc[Penerapan Server]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Server Deployment on {opensuse} {tumbleweed}"
msgstr "Penerapan Server {productname} di {opensuse} {tumbleweed}"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment Preparations"
msgstr "Persiapan Penerapan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In this section, you will gain expertise in setting up and deploying a "
"{productname} Server.  The process encompasses the installation of "
"[command]``Podman``, [systemitem]``Uyuni container utilities``, deployment, "
"and then initiating interaction with the container through "
"[command]``mgrctl``."
msgstr "Di bagian ini, Anda akan mendapatkan keahlian dalam menyiapkan dan menerapkan Server {productname}. Proses ini mencakup instalasi [command]``Podman``, [systemitem]``Uyuni container utilities``, penerapan, dan kemudian memulai interaksi dengan kontainer melalui [command]``mgrctl``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This section assumes you have already configured an {opensuse} {tumbleweed} "
"host server, whether it is running on a physical machine or within a virtual "
"environment."
msgstr "Bagian ini mengasumsikan Anda telah mengonfigurasi server host {opensuse} {tumbleweed}, apakah berjalan pada mesin fisik atau dalam lingkungan virtual."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:5
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid "https://download.opensuse.org/tumbleweed/"
msgstr "https://download.opensuse.org/tumbleweed/"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid ""
"An {opensuse} {tumbleweed} server should be installed from installation "
"media."
msgstr "Server {opensuse} {tumbleweed} harus diinstal dari media instalasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid "This procedure is described below."
msgstr "Prosedur ini dijelaskan di bawah."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing Uyuni Tools For Use With Containers"
msgstr "Menginstal Alat Uyuni untuk Digunakan Dengan Kontainer"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid "On your local host, open a terminal window and log in."
msgstr "Pada host lokal Anda, buka jendela terminal dan masuk."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Add the following repository to your {opensuse} {tumbleweed} server. You "
"might need to use `sudo` for the following commands."
msgstr "Tambahkan repositori berikut ke server {opensuse} {tumbleweed} Anda. Anda mungkin perlu menggunakan `sudo` untuk perintah berikut."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper ar "
"https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Server-POOL-$(arch)-Media1/ "
"uyuni-server-stable\n"
msgstr "zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/systemsmanagement:/Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Server-POOL-$(arch)-Media1/ uyuni-server-stable\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:19
msgid "Refresh the repository list and import the key:"
msgstr "Segarkan daftar repositori dan impor kunci:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:20
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:5
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper ref\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:21
msgid "When prompted, trust and import the new repository GPG key."
msgstr "Ketika diminta, percayai dan impor kunci GPG repositori baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid "Install the container tools:"
msgstr "Instal alat kontainer:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper in mgradm mgrctl mgradm-bash-completion mgrctl-bash-completion "
"uyuni-storage-setup-server\n"
msgstr "zypper in mgradm mgrctl mgradm-bash-completion mgrctl-bash-completion uyuni-storage-setup-server\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:33
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:57
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install and Enable Podman"
msgstr "Menginstal dan Mengaktifkan Podman"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Before deploying {productname}, you must install and enable "
"[package]``podman``."
msgstr "Sebelum menerapkan {productname}, Anda harus menginstal dan mengaktifkan [package]``podman``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing and Enabling Podman"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal dan Mengaktifkan Podman"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:37
msgid "Log in as root and install podman:"
msgstr "Masuk sebagai root dan instal podman:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:39
msgid "Start and enable the Podman service:"
msgstr "Mulai dan aktifkan layanan Podman:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:40
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ensure-proxy-prerequisites.adoc:14
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable --now podman.service\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploying an Uyuni Container With Podman"
msgstr "Menerapkan Kontainer Uyuni Dengan Podman"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "[command]``mgradm`` Overview"
msgstr "Ringkasan [command]``mgradm``"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:43
msgid ""
"{productname} is deployed as a container using the [command]``mgradm`` "
"tool.  There are two methods of deploying a {productname} server as a "
"container.  In this section we will focus on basic container deployment."
msgstr "{productname} diterapkan sebagai kontainer menggunakan alat [command]``mgradm``. Ada dua metode untuk menerapkan server {productname} sebagai kontainer. Di bagian ini kami akan fokus pada penerapan kontainer dasar."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:44
msgid ""
"For information on using a custom configuration file to deploy, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang menggunakan file konfigurasi khusus untuk menerapkan, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:45
msgid ""
"For additional information, you can explore further by running "
"[command]``mgradm --help`` from the command line."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tambahan, Anda dapat menjelajahi lebih lanjut dengan menjalankan [command]``mgradm --help`` dari baris perintah."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying an Uyuni container with Podman"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menerapkan kontainer Uyuni dengan Podman"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:47
msgid "From the terminal run the following command as the sudo user or as root."
msgstr "Dari terminal jalankan perintah berikut sebagai pengguna sudo atau sebagai root."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo mgradm install podman\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:49
msgid ""
"You must deploy the container as sudo or root. The following error will be "
"displayed at the terminal if you miss this step."
msgstr "Anda harus menerapkan kontainer sebagai sudo atau root. Kesalahan berikut akan ditampilkan di terminal jika Anda melewatkan langkah ini."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:50
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"INF Setting up uyuni network\n"
"9:58AM INF Enabling system service\n"
"9:58AM FTL Failed to open /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service for "
"writing \n"
"error=\"open /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service: permission denied\"\n"
msgstr ""
"INF Setting up uyuni network\n"
"9:58AM INF Enabling system service\n"
"9:58AM FTL Failed to open /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service for writing \n"
"error=\"open /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service: permission denied\"\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:54
msgid "Many users will want to specify locations for their persistent volumes."
msgstr "Banyak pengguna akan ingin menentukan lokasi untuk volume persisten mereka."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:55
msgid ""
"If you are just testing out {productname} you do not need to specify these "
"volumes.  [command]``mgradm`` will setup the correct volumes by default."
msgstr "Jika Anda hanya menguji {productname} Anda tidak perlu menentukan volume ini. [command]``mgradm`` akan mengatur volume yang benar secara default."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:56
msgid ""
"Specifying volume locations will generally be used for larger production "
"deployments."
msgstr "Menentukan lokasi volume umumnya akan digunakan untuk penerapan produksi yang lebih besar."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:57
msgid ""
"By default [command]``podman`` stores its volumes in "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``."
msgstr "Secara default [command]``podman`` menyimpan volumenya di [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:58
msgid ""
"You can provide custom storage for the volumes by mounting disks on this "
"path or the expected volume path inside it such as: "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk``.  This is "
"especially important for the database and package mirrors."
msgstr "Anda dapat menyediakan penyimpanan khusus untuk volume dengan memasang disk pada jalur ini atau jalur volume yang diharapkan di dalamnya seperti: [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk``. Ini sangat penting untuk basis data dan mirror paket."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:59
msgid "For a list of all persistent volumes in the container, see:"
msgstr "Untuk daftar semua volume persisten dalam kontainer, lihat:"

