#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom YAML Configuration and Deployment with mgradm"
msgstr "Konfigurasi YAML Khusus dan Penerapan dengan mgradm"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You have the option to create a custom [filename]``mgradm.yaml`` file, which "
"the [command]``mgradm`` tool can utilize during deployment.  All "
"[command]``mgradm`` arguments have their YAML counterparts.  For example, "
"the [command]``mgradm`` argument ``--ssl-db-ca-intermediate`` can be "
"specified in the [filename]``mgradm.yaml`` file as follows:"
msgstr "Anda memiliki opsi untuk membuat file [filename]``mgradm.yaml`` khusus, yang dapat dimanfaatkan oleh alat [command]``mgradm`` selama penerapan. Semua argumen [command]``mgradm`` memiliki pasangan YAML mereka. Misalnya, argumen [command]``mgradm`` ``--ssl-db-ca-intermediate`` dapat ditentukan dalam file [filename]``mgradm.yaml`` sebagai berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ssl:\n"
"  db:\n"
"    ca:\n"
"      intermediate: /path/to/ca-intermediate.crt\n"
msgstr ""
"ssl:\n"
"  db:\n"
"    ca:\n"
"      intermediate: /path/to/ca-intermediate.crt\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:4
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm`` will prompt for basic variables if they are not provided "
"using command line parameters or the [filename]``mgradm.yaml`` configuration "
"file."
msgstr "[command]``mgradm`` akan meminta variabel dasar jika tidak disediakan menggunakan parameter baris perintah atau file konfigurasi [filename]``mgradm.yaml``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For security, **using command line parameters to specify passwords should be "
"avoided**.  Use a configuration file with proper permissions instead."
msgstr "Untuk keamanan, **menggunakan parameter baris perintah untuk menentukan kata sandi harus dihindari**. Gunakan file konfigurasi dengan izin yang tepat sebagai gantinya."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Deploying the {productname} Container with Podman Using a Custom "
"Configuration File"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menerapkan Kontainer {productname} dengan Podman Menggunakan File Konfigurasi Khusus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Prepare a configuration file named [filename]``mgradm.yaml`` similar to the "
"following example:"
msgstr "Siapkan file konfigurasi bernama [filename]``mgradm.yaml`` mirip dengan contoh berikut:"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Database password. Randomly generated by default\n"
"db:\n"
"  password: MySuperSecretDBPass\n"
msgstr ""
"# Kata sandi basis data. Dibuat secara acak secara default\n"
"db:\n"
"  password: MySuperSecretDBPass\n"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Password for the CA certificate\n"
"ssl:\n"
"  password: MySuperSecretSSLPassword\n"
msgstr ""
"# Kata sandi untuk sertifikat CA\n"
"ssl:\n"
"  password: MySuperSecretSSLPassword\n"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Your SUSE Customer Center credentials\n"
"scc: \n"
"  user: ccUsername\n"
"  password: ccPassword\n"
msgstr ""
"# Kredensial SUSE Customer Center Anda\n"
"scc: \n"
"  user: ccUsername\n"
"  password: ccPassword\n"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Organization name\n"
"organization: YourOrganization\n"
msgstr ""
"# Nama organisasi\n"
"organization: YourOrganization\n"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Email address sending the notifications\n"
"emailFrom: notifications@example.com\n"
msgstr ""
"# Alamat email yang mengirim notifikasi\n"
"emailFrom: notifications@example.com\n"

#. type: delimited block .
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Administrators account details\n"
"admin:\n"
"  password: MySuperSecretAdminPass\n"
"  login: LoginName\n"
"  firstName: Admin\n"
"  lastName: Admin\n"
"  email: email@example.com\n"
msgstr ""
"# Detail akun administrator\n"
"admin:\n"
"  password: MySuperSecretAdminPass\n"
"  login: LoginName\n"
"  firstName: Admin\n"
"  lastName: Admin\n"
"  email: email@example.com\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:14
msgid ""
"From the terminal, as root, run the following command.  Entering your "
"server's FQDN is optional."
msgstr "Dari terminal, sebagai root, jalankan perintah berikut. Memasukkan FQDN server Anda adalah opsional."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm -c mgradm.yaml install podman <FQDN>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:16
msgid ""
"You must deploy the container as sudo or root.  The following error will be "
"displayed on the terminal if you miss this step."
msgstr "Anda harus menerapkan kontainer sebagai sudo atau root. Kesalahan berikut akan ditampilkan di terminal jika Anda melewatkan langkah ini."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/mgradm-yaml-custom-configuration.adoc:19
msgid "Open a browser and proceed to your server's FQDN or IP address."
msgstr "Buka browser dan lanjutkan ke FQDN atau alamat IP server Anda."

#. In this section you learned how to deploy an {productname} {productnumber} Server container using a custom YAML configuration.
#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Persistent Container Volumes"
msgstr "Volume Kontainer Persisten"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Modifications performed within containers are not retained.  Any alterations "
"made outside of persistent volumes will be discarded.  Below is a list of "
"persistent volumes for {productname} {productnumber}."
msgstr "Modifikasi yang dilakukan dalam kontainer tidak dipertahankan. Setiap perubahan yang dilakukan di luar volume persisten akan dibuang. Di bawah ini adalah daftar volume persisten untuk {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To customize the default volume locations, ensure you create the necessary "
"volumes before launching the pod for the first time, utilizing the "
"[command]``podman volume create`` command."
