#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understanding [command]``mgr-storage-server`` and "
"[command]``mgr-storage-proxy``"
msgstr "Memahami [command]``mgr-storage-server`` dan [command]``mgr-storage-proxy``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:2
msgid ""
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` and [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` are "
"helper scripts provided with {productname} 5.0 and later."
msgstr "[command]``mgr-storage-server`` dan [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` adalah skrip helper yang disediakan dengan {productname} 5.0 dan yang lebih baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:3
msgid ""
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` and [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` are "
"helper scripts provided with {productname}."
msgstr "[command]``mgr-storage-server`` dan [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` adalah skrip helper yang disediakan dengan {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:4
msgid "They are designed to configure storage for {productname} Server and Proxy."
msgstr "Mereka dirancang untuk mengonfigurasi penyimpanan untuk Server dan Proxy {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The scripts take disk devices as arguments.  [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` "
"requires a single argument for the storage disk device.  "
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` requires a storage disk device and can "
"optionally accept a second argument for a dedicated database disk device.  "
"While both normal and database storage can reside on the same disk, it is "
"advisable to place the database on a dedicated, high-performance disk to "
"ensure better performance and easier management."
msgstr "Skrip ini mengambil perangkat disk sebagai argumen. [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` memerlukan satu argumen untuk perangkat disk penyimpanan. [command]``mgr-storage-server`` memerlukan perangkat disk penyimpanan dan secara opsional dapat menerima argumen kedua untuk perangkat disk basis data khusus. Meskipun penyimpanan normal dan basis data dapat berada di disk yang sama, disarankan untuk menempatkan basis data pada disk berperforma tinggi khusus untuk memastikan kinerja dan pengelolaan yang lebih baik."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "What these tools do"
msgstr "Apa yang dilakukan alat ini"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Both [command]``mgr-storage-server`` and [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` "
"perform standard storage setup operations:"
msgstr "Baik [command]``mgr-storage-server`` maupun [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` melakukan operasi penyiapan penyimpanan standar:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:8
msgid "Validate the provided storage devices."
msgstr "Memvalidasi perangkat penyimpanan yang disediakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:9
msgid "Ensure that devices are empty and suitable for use."
msgstr "Memastikan bahwa perangkat kosong dan cocok untuk digunakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:10
msgid "Create XFS filesystems on the specified devices."
msgstr "Membuat sistem file XFS pada perangkat yang ditentukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:11
msgid "Mount the devices temporarily for data migration."
msgstr "Memasang perangkat sementara untuk migrasi data."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:12
msgid "Move the relevant storage directories to the new devices."
msgstr "Memindahkan direktori penyimpanan yang relevan ke perangkat baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Create entries in [path]``/etc/fstab`` so that the storage mounts "
"automatically on boot."
msgstr "Membuat entri di [path]``/etc/fstab`` sehingga penyimpanan terpasang secara otomatis saat boot."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:14
msgid "Remount the devices at their final locations."
msgstr "Memasang ulang perangkat di lokasi akhirnya."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional tool-specific behavior"
msgstr "Perilaku tambahan khusus alat"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `mgr-storage-server`\n"
"|\n"
"Optionally supports a separate device for database storage.\n"
"\n"
"Stops {productname} services during migration, restarts them afterward.\n"
"\n"
"Moves Podman volumes directory [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` "
"to the prepared storage, and optionally "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql`` to the prepared "
"database storage.\n"
"\n"
"| `mgr-storage-proxy`\n"
"|\n"
"Focuses only on proxy storage (no database storage support).\n"
"\n"
"Stops and restarts the proxy service during migration.\n"
"\n"
"Moves podman volumes directory [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` "
"to the prepared storage.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| `mgr-storage-server`\n"
"|\n"
"Optionally supports a separate device for database storage.\n"
"\n"
"Stops {productname} services during migration, restarts them afterward.\n"
"\n"
"Moves Podman volumes directory [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` to the prepared storage, and optionally [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql`` to the prepared database storage.\n"
"\n"
"| `mgr-storage-proxy`\n"
"|\n"
"Focuses only on proxy storage (no database storage support).\n"
"\n"
"Stops and restarts the proxy service during migration.\n"
"\n"
"Moves podman volumes directory [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` to the prepared storage.\n"
"\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Both tools automate standard Linux storage operations.  There is no hidden "
"or custom logic beyond what a Linux administrator would do manually."
msgstr "Kedua alat ini mengotomatisasi operasi penyimpanan Linux standar. Tidak ada logika tersembunyi atau khusus di luar apa yang akan dilakukan administrator Linux secara manual."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "What these tools do *not* do"
msgstr "Apa yang *tidak* dilakukan alat ini"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:19
msgid "They do *not* create or manage LVM volumes."
msgstr "Mereka *tidak* membuat atau mengelola volume LVM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:20
msgid "They do *not* configure RAID or complex storage topologies."
msgstr "Mereka *tidak* mengonfigurasi RAID atau topologi penyimpanan kompleks."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:21
msgid ""
"They do *not* prevent you from managing storage using normal Linux tools "
"after setup."
msgstr "Mereka *tidak* mencegah Anda mengelola penyimpanan menggunakan alat Linux normal setelah penyiapan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:22
msgid ""
"They do *not* provide dynamic resizing or expansion capabilities — these "
"must be handled using standard Linux storage tools."
msgstr "Mereka *tidak* menyediakan kemampuan pengubahan ukuran atau ekspansi dinamis — ini harus ditangani menggunakan alat penyimpanan Linux standar."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-installation storage management"
msgstr "Pengelolaan penyimpanan pasca-instalasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Once storage has been configured, you can safely manage it using standard "
"Linux commands."
msgstr "Setelah penyimpanan dikonfigurasi, Anda dapat dengan aman mengelolanya menggunakan perintah Linux standar."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Contoh"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 1: Extending storage if using LVM"
msgstr "Contoh 1: Memperluas penyimpanan jika menggunakan LVM"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lvextend -L +10G /dev/your_vg/your_lv\n"
"xfs_growfs /var/lib/containers/storage/volumes\n"
msgstr ""
"lvextend -L +10G /dev/your_vg/your_lv\n"
"xfs_growfs /var/lib/containers/storage/volumes\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 2: Migrating to a larger disk "
msgstr "Contoh 2: Migrasi ke disk yang lebih besar "

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:29
msgid "Add and format the new disk."
msgstr "Tambahkan dan format disk baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:30
msgid "Mount it temporarily."
msgstr "Pasang sementara."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:31
msgid "Use `rsync` to copy data."
msgstr "Gunakan `rsync` untuk menyalin data."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:32
msgid "Update `/etc/fstab`."
msgstr "Perbarui `/etc/fstab`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:33
msgid "Remount at the correct location."
msgstr "Pasang ulang di lokasi yang benar."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "When to use, or not use"
msgstr "Kapan menggunakan, atau tidak menggunakan"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:35
msgid "Always take a backup before making changes to your storage setup."
msgstr "Selalu ambil backup sebelum membuat perubahan pada penyiapan penyimpanan Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Use these tools *only* during initial storage setup or when migrating to new "
"storage where the tool is expected to handle data migration and update "
"`/etc/fstab`."
msgstr "Gunakan alat ini *hanya* selama penyiapan penyimpanan awal atau ketika bermigrasi ke penyimpanan baru di mana alat diharapkan untuk menangani migrasi data dan memperbarui `/etc/fstab`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Do *not* rerun these scripts for resizing or expanding storage. Use standard "
"Linux tools (e.g., [literal]``lvextend``, [literal]``xfs_growfs``) for such "
"operations."
msgstr "*Jangan* jalankan ulang skrip ini untuk mengubah ukuran atau memperluas penyimpanan. Gunakan alat Linux standar (misalnya, [literal]``lvextend``, [literal]``xfs_growfs``) untuk operasi tersebut."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Ringkasan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:39
msgid ""
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` and [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` help "
"automate the initial persistent storage setup for {productname} components "
"using standard Linux storage practices.  They do not limit or interfere with "
"standard storage management afterward."
msgstr "[command]``mgr-storage-server`` dan [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` membantu mengotomatisasi penyiapan penyimpanan persisten awal untuk komponen {productname} menggunakan praktik penyimpanan Linux standar. Mereka tidak membatasi atau mengganggu pengelolaan penyimpanan standar setelahnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:40
msgid "After setup, continue managing your storage using familiar Linux tools."
msgstr "Setelah penyiapan, lanjutkan mengelola penyimpanan Anda menggunakan alat Linux yang familiar."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:41
msgid ""
"A full database volume can cause significant issues with system operation.  "
"As disk usage notifications have not yet been adapted for containerized "
"environments, users are encouraged to monitor the disk space used by Podman "
"volumes themselves, either through tools such as Grafana, Prometheus, or any "
"other preferred method.  Pay particular attention to the var-pgsql volume, "
"located under [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``."
msgstr "Volume basis data penuh dapat menyebabkan masalah signifikan dengan operasi sistem. Karena notifikasi penggunaan disk belum diadaptasi untuk lingkungan terkontainerisasi, pengguna didorong untuk memantau ruang disk yang digunakan oleh volume Podman sendiri, baik melalui alat seperti Grafana, Prometheus, atau metode lain yang disukai. Berikan perhatian khusus pada volume var-pgsql, yang terletak di bawah [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Proxy Upgrade"
msgstr "Pemutakhiran Proxy {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Before running the upgrade command, it is required to update the host "
"operating system.  Updating the host operating system will also result in "
"the update of the {productname} tooling such as the [literal]``mgrpxy`` "
"tool."
msgstr "Sebelum menjalankan perintah pemutakhiran, diperlukan untuk memperbarui sistem operasi host. Memperbarui sistem operasi host juga akan menghasilkan pemutakhiran alat {productname} seperti alat [literal]``mgrpxy``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Upgrading Proxy"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memutakhirkan Proxy"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:4
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:4
msgid "Refresh software repositories with [command]``zypper``:"
msgstr "Segarkan repositori perangkat lunak dengan [command]``zypper``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:6
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:6
msgid "Depending on the host operating system, proceed with these steps:"
msgstr "Tergantung pada sistem operasi host, lanjutkan dengan langkah-langkah ini:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:7
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a transactional system such as {sl-micro}: "
msgstr "Untuk sistem transaksional seperti {sl-micro}: "

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:8
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:8
msgid "Apply available updates with [command]``transactional-update``:"
msgstr "Terapkan pemutakhiran yang tersedia dengan [command]``transactional-update``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:10
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:13
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:10
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:13
msgid "If updates were applied, [literal]``reboot``."
msgstr "Jika pemutakhiran diterapkan, [literal]``reboot``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:11
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:11
msgid "Apply available updates:"
msgstr "Terapkan pemutakhiran yang tersedia:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:12
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper dup\n"
msgstr "zypper dup\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:14
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "For {sles}: "
msgstr "Untuk {sles}: "

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:15
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:15
msgid "Update installed software with [command]``zypper``:"
msgstr "Perbarui perangkat lunak yang terinstal dengan [command]``zypper``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:16
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:16
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:26
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper up\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The {productname} Proxy containers running on [literal]``podman`` can be "
"updated using the following command:"
msgstr "Kontainer Proxy {productname} yang berjalan di [literal]``podman`` dapat diperbarui menggunakan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrpxy upgrade podman\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:19
msgid "Or, those running on a Kubernetes cluster can update using:"
msgstr "Atau, yang berjalan di kluster Kubernetes dapat memperbarui menggunakan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrpxy upgrade kubernetes\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:21
msgid "On podman, clean up the unused container images to free disk space:"
msgstr "Pada podman, bersihkan citra kontainer yang tidak digunakan untuk membebaskan ruang disk:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:22
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "podman image prune -a\n"
msgstr "podman image prune -a\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:23
msgid ""
"On Kubernetes the image cleanup is handled automatically, or it depends on "
"the Kubernetes distribution."
msgstr "Pada Kubernetes pembersihan citra ditangani secara otomatis, atau tergantung pada distribusi Kubernetes."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:24
msgid ""
"If you do not specify the tag parameter when upgrading to specific version, "
"it will default to upgrading to the most recent version.  To upgrade to a "
"specific version, provide the tag parameter with the desired image tag."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak menentukan parameter tag saat memutakhirkan ke versi tertentu, ini akan default ke pemutakhiran ke versi terbaru. Untuk memutakhirkan ke versi tertentu, berikan parameter tag dengan tag citra yang diinginkan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:25
msgid ""
"While there is an option to upgrade a specific container using its specific "
"tag, this feature is intended for applying PTFs only."
msgstr "Meskipun ada opsi untuk memutakhirkan kontainer tertentu menggunakan tag spesifiknya, fitur ini ditujukan hanya untuk menerapkan PTF."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:26
msgid ""
"We highly recommend using the same tag for all proxy containers to ensure "
"consistency under normal circumstances."
msgstr "Kami sangat menyarankan menggunakan tag yang sama untuk semua kontainer proxy untuk memastikan konsistensi dalam keadaan normal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-proxy-containers.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For air-gapped installations, first upgrade the container RPM packages, then "
"run the [command]``mgrpxy upgrade podman`` command."
msgstr "Untuk instalasi terisolasi jaringan, pertama-tama tingkatkan paket RPM kontainer, lalu jalankan perintah [command]``mgrpxy upgrade podman``."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Server Upgrade"
msgstr "Pemutakhiran Server {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Before running the upgrade command, it is required to update the host "
"operating system.  Updating the host operating system will also result in "
"the update of the {productname} tooling such as the [literal]``mgradm`` "
"tool."
msgstr "Sebelum menjalankan perintah pemutakhiran, diperlukan untuk memperbarui sistem operasi host. Memperbarui sistem operasi host juga akan menghasilkan pemutakhiran alat {productname} seperti alat [literal]``mgradm``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Upgrading Server"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memutakhirkan Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The {productname} Server container can be updated using the following "
"command:"
msgstr "Kontainer Server {productname} dapat diperbarui menggunakan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm upgrade podman\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:19
msgid ""
"This command will bring the status of the container up-to-date and restart "
"the server."
msgstr "Perintah ini akan membawa status kontainer hingga terbaru dan memulai ulang server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:20
msgid "Clean up the unused container images to free disk space:"
msgstr "Bersihkan citra kontainer yang tidak digunakan untuk membebaskan ruang disk:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrading with third-party SSL certificate"
msgstr "Pemutakhiran dengan sertifikat SSL pihak ketiga"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:23
msgid ""
"If you are using third-party certificates, the database container needs to "
"have an SSL certificate with the following Subject Alternate Names (SANs):"
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan sertifikat pihak ketiga, kontainer basis data perlu memiliki sertifikat SSL dengan Subject Alternate Names (SAN) berikut:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:24
msgid "[literal]``db``"
msgstr "[literal]``db``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:25
msgid "[literal]``reportdb``"
msgstr "[literal]``reportdb``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:26
msgid "the externally facing fully qualified domain name"
msgstr "nama domain lengkap yang menghadap ke luar"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The same certificate can be used for both the main container and the "
"database one, but it needs to have those SANs too."
msgstr "Sertifikat yang sama dapat digunakan untuk kontainer utama dan kontainer basis data, tetapi perlu memiliki SAN tersebut juga."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In order to pass the new certificate to the upgrade command, use the "
"[command]``--ssl-db-ca-root``, [command]``--ssl-db-cert`` and "
"[command]``--ssl-db-key`` parameters."
msgstr "Untuk meneruskan sertifikat baru ke perintah pemutakhiran, gunakan parameter [command]``--ssl-db-ca-root``, [command]``--ssl-db-cert`` dan [command]``--ssl-db-key``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrading to specific version"
msgstr "Pemutakhiran ke versi tertentu"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:30
msgid ""
"If you do not specify the tag parameter, it will default to upgrading to the "
"most recent version.  To upgrade to a specific version, provide the tag "
"parameter with the desired image tag."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak menentukan parameter tag, ini akan default ke pemutakhiran ke versi terbaru. Untuk memutakhirkan ke versi tertentu, berikan parameter tag dengan tag citra yang diinginkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:31
msgid ""
"For more information on the upgrade command and its parameters, use the "
"following command:"
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang perintah pemutakhiran dan parameternya, gunakan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm upgrade podman -h\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/updating-server-containers.adoc:33
msgid ""
"For air-gapped installations, first upgrade the container RPM packages, then "
"run the [literal]``mgradm`` command."
msgstr "Untuk instalasi terisolasi jaringan, pertama-tama tingkatkan paket RPM kontainer, lalu jalankan perintah [literal]``mgradm``."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:1
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "General Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Umum"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:2
msgid "Before you begin installation, ensure that you have:"
msgstr "Sebelum Anda memulai instalasi, pastikan Anda memiliki:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:3
msgid ""
"A {scclongform} account.  This account gives you access to organization "
"credentials and registration keys for {productname} Server, Proxy and Retail "
"Branch Server."
msgstr "Akun {scclongform}. Akun ini memberi Anda akses ke kredensial organisasi dan kunci pendaftaran untuk Server, Proxy, dan Retail Branch Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:4
msgid "Supported Browsers for {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Browser yang Didukung untuk {webui} {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:5
msgid ""
"SSL certificates for your environment.  By default {productname} "
"{productnumber} uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Sertifikat SSL untuk lingkungan Anda. Secara default {productname} {productnumber} menggunakan sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The {sl-micro} {microversion} entitlement is included within the "
"{productname} entitlement, so it does not require a separate registration "
"key."
msgstr "Hak {sl-micro} {microversion} disertakan dalam hak {productname}, sehingga tidak memerlukan kunci pendaftaran terpisah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:7
msgid "The following section contains more information on these requirements."
msgstr "Bagian berikut berisi informasi lebih lanjut tentang persyaratan ini."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "{scclongform} Account and Credentials"
msgstr "Akun dan Kredensial {scclongform}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Create an account with {scclongform} prior to deployment of {productname} "
"{productnumber}."
msgstr "Buat akun dengan {scclongform} sebelum penerapan {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Obtain Your Organization Credentials"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memperoleh Kredensial Organisasi Anda"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:11
msgid "Navigate to https://scc.suse.com/login in your web browser."
msgstr "Navigasikan ke https://scc.suse.com/login di browser web Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:12
msgid "Log in to your {scc} account, or follow the prompts to create a new account."
msgstr "Masuk ke akun {scc} Anda, atau ikuti petunjuk untuk membuat akun baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:13
msgid ""
"If you have not yet done so, click btn:[Connect to an Organization] and type "
"or search for your organization."
msgstr "Jika Anda belum melakukannya, klik btn:[Connect to an Organization] dan ketik atau cari organisasi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Manage my Organizations] and select your organization from the "
"list by clicking the organization name."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Manage my Organizations] dan pilih organisasi Anda dari daftar dengan mengklik nama organisasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Click the btn:[Users] tab, and then select the btn:[Organization "
"Credentials] sub-tab."
msgstr "Klik tab btn:[Users], lalu pilih sub-tab btn:[Organization Credentials]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:16
msgid "Record your login information for use during {productname} setup."
msgstr "Catat informasi login Anda untuk digunakan selama penyiapan {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Depending on your organization's setup, you might also need to activate your "
"subscription, using the btn:[Activate Subscriptions] menu from the left "
"navigation bar."
msgstr "Tergantung pada penyiapan organisasi Anda, Anda mungkin juga perlu mengaktifkan langganan Anda, menggunakan menu btn:[Activate Subscriptions] dari bilah navigasi kiri."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:18
msgid "For more information about using {scc}, see https://scc.suse.com/docs/help."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang menggunakan {scc}, lihat https://scc.suse.com/docs/help."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported Browsers for {productname} {webui}"
msgstr "Browser yang Didukung untuk {webui} {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:20
msgid ""
"To use the {webui} to manage your {productname} environment, you must run an "
"up to date web browser."
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan {webui} mengelola lingkungan {productname} Anda, Anda harus menjalankan browser web yang terkini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:21
msgid "{productname} is supported on:"
msgstr "{productname} didukung pada:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:22
msgid "Latest Firefox browser shipped with {sles}"
msgstr "Browser Firefox terbaru yang dikirimkan dengan {sles}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:23
msgid "Latest Chrome browser on all operating systems"
msgstr "Browser Chrome terbaru di semua sistem operasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:24
msgid "Latest Edge browser shipped with Windows"
msgstr "Browser Edge terbaru yang dikirimkan dengan Windows"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Windows Internet Explorer is not supported.  The {productname} {webui} will "
"not render correctly under Windows Internet Explorer."
msgstr "Windows Internet Explorer tidak didukung. {webui} {productname} tidak akan dirender dengan benar di bawah Windows Internet Explorer."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSL Certificates"
msgstr "Sertifikat SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:27
msgid ""
"{productname} uses SSL certificates to ensure that clients are registered to "
"the correct server.  By default, {productname} uses a self-signed "
"certificate.  If you have certificates signed by a third-party CA, you can "
"import them to your {productname} installation."
msgstr "{productname} menggunakan sertifikat SSL untuk memastikan bahwa klien terdaftar ke server yang benar. Secara default, {productname} menggunakan sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri. Jika Anda memiliki sertifikat yang ditandatangani oleh CA pihak ketiga, Anda dapat mengimpornya ke instalasi {productname} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:28
msgid ""
"For more on self-signed certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For more on imported certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang sertifikat yang diimpor, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Perangkat Keras"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This table outlines hardware and software requirements for the {productname} "
"Server and Proxy, on {x86_64}, {arm}, {ppc64le} and {s390x} architecture."
msgstr "Tabel ini menguraikan persyaratan perangkat keras dan perangkat lunak untuk Server dan Proxy {productname}, pada arsitektur {x86_64}, {arm}, {ppc64le}, dan {s390x}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} installations based on {ppc64le} or {s390x} architecture "
"cannot use secure boot for network booting clients.  This limitation exists "
"because the shim bootloader is not available for both these architectures."
msgstr "Instalasi {productname} berdasarkan arsitektur {ppc64le} atau {s390x} tidak dapat menggunakan secure boot untuk klien boot jaringan. Keterbatasan ini ada karena bootloader shim tidak tersedia untuk kedua arsitektur ini."

#. For {ibmz} hardware requirements, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-ibmz.adoc[].
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For {productname} {smr} hardware requirements, see "
"xref:retail:retail-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk persyaratan perangkat keras {productname} {smr}, lihat xref:retail:retail-requirements.adoc[]."

#.  In this table, replace ``version`` with the version of the product you are using.
#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:5
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:6
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:21
msgid ""
"One of {sl-micro} {microversion} or {sles} {bci-mlm} is the operating system "
"of the container host."
msgstr "Salah satu {sl-micro} {microversion} atau {sles} {bci-mlm} adalah sistem operasi dari host kontainer."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the following, {sles} as the installed host operating system is "
"explicitly mentioned only if it matters.  Otherwise we either write "
"{sl-micro} or just host operating system."
msgstr "Dalam berikut ini, {sles} sebagai sistem operasi host yang diinstal secara eksplisit disebutkan hanya jika penting. Jika tidak, kami menulis {sl-micro} atau hanya sistem operasi host."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The container host with {sl-micro} as operating system requires as free disk "
"space:"
msgstr "Host kontainer dengan {sl-micro} sebagai sistem operasi memerlukan ruang disk bebas:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:9
msgid "Minimum for base installation 100 GB"
msgstr "Minimum untuk instalasi dasar 100 GB"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:10
msgid "Plus a minimum of 130 GB for repository data"
msgstr "Plus minimum 130 GB untuk data repositori"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Depending on the amount of selected software, {sles} as operating system can "
"require considerably more disk space."
msgstr "Tergantung pada jumlah perangkat lunak yang dipilih, {sles} sebagai sistem operasi dapat memerlukan ruang disk yang jauh lebih besar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:12
msgid ""
"By default the {productname} Server container stores mirrored repository "
"(packages or products), database, and other data in subdirectories of the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/`` directory.  Repository "
"synchronization fails if this directory runs out of disk space.  Estimate "
"how much space the [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/`` directory "
"requires based on the number and kind of clients and repositories you plan "
"to mirror."
msgstr "Secara default kontainer Server {productname} menyimpan repositori yang dicerminkan (paket atau produk), basis data, dan data lain di subdirektori direktori [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``. Sinkronisasi repositori gagal jika direktori ini kehabisan ruang disk. Perkirakan berapa banyak ruang yang diperlukan direktori [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/`` berdasarkan jumlah dan jenis klien dan repositori yang Anda rencanakan untuk dicerminkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For more information about filesystem and partitioning details, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#install-hardware-requirements-storage[] "
"and the detailed installation instructions in the Installation and "
"Deployment sections of this guide."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang detail sistem file dan partisi, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#install-hardware-requirements-storage[] dan instruksi instalasi terperinci di bagian Instalasi dan Penerapan panduan ini."

