"image of {sl-micro} {microversion} has just a 5 GB [literal]``/`` "
"partition.  Both work flawlessly with {productname}.  As long as external "
"storage is mounted to [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``, "
"{productname} does not need or use storage on the [literal]``/`` partition, "
"but leaves that to the management of the container host itself."
msgstr "Citra secara default memiliki partisi [literal]``/`` 40 GB. Citra cloud {sl-micro} {microversion} hanya memiliki partisi [literal]``/`` 5 GB. Keduanya berfungsi dengan sempurna dengan {productname}. Selama penyimpanan eksternal dipasang ke [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``, {productname} tidak memerlukan atau menggunakan penyimpanan pada partisi [literal]``/``, tetapi membiarkannya pada pengelolaan host kontainer itu sendiri."

