#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:25
msgid ""
"By default the {productname} Proxy container caches packages in the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` "
"directory.  If there is not enough space available, the proxy will remove "
"old, unused packages and replace them with newer packages."
msgstr "Secara default kontainer Proxy {productname} menyimpan paket dalam cache di direktori [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/``. Jika tidak ada ruang yang cukup tersedia, proxy akan menghapus paket lama yang tidak digunakan dan menggantinya dengan paket yang lebih baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:26
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:13
msgid "As a result of this behavior:"
msgstr "Sebagai hasil dari perilaku ini:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The larger "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` "
"directory is on the proxy, the less traffic will be between the proxy and "
"the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Semakin besar direktori [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` pada proxy, semakin sedikit lalu lintas antara proxy dan Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:28
msgid ""
"By making the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` "
"directory on the proxy the same size as "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/`` on the "
"{productname} Server, you avoid a large amount of traffic after the first "
"synchronization."
msgstr "Dengan membuat direktori [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` pada proxy berukuran sama dengan [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/`` pada Server {productname}, Anda menghindari sejumlah besar lalu lintas setelah sinkronisasi pertama."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` "
"directory can be small on the {productname} Server compared to the proxy.  "
"For a guide to size estimation, see the <<server-hardware-requirements>> "
"section."
msgstr "Direktori [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` dapat berukuran kecil pada Server {productname} dibandingkan dengan proxy. Untuk panduan estimasi ukuran, lihat bagian <<server-hardware-requirements>>."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:30
msgid ""
"In general, {suse} recommends to adjust the value for the cache directory to "
"about 80 % of available free space.  The [option]``cache_dir`` value is set "
"when generating proxy configuration on the server.  You cannot set the "
"option directly in [path]``squid.conf``."
msgstr "Secara umum, {suse} merekomendasikan untuk menyesuaikan nilai untuk direktori cache menjadi sekitar 80% dari ruang bebas yang tersedia. Nilai [option]``cache_dir`` diatur saat membuat konfigurasi proxy di server. Anda tidak dapat mengatur opsi secara langsung di [path]``squid.conf``."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Swap space"
msgstr "Ruang Swap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Workloads differ from system to system.  Systems with heavy or unpredictable "
"workloads can benefit from additional swap space, regardless of total RAM.  "
"It is recommended to place swap on the fastest available storage (for "
"example, SSD).  {suse} recommends using a swap file instead of a swap "
"partition."
msgstr "Beban kerja berbeda dari sistem ke sistem. Sistem dengan beban kerja berat atau tidak dapat diprediksi dapat memperoleh manfaat dari ruang swap tambahan, terlepas dari total RAM. Disarankan untuk menempatkan swap pada penyimpanan tercepat yang tersedia (misalnya, SSD). {suse} merekomendasikan menggunakan file swap daripada partisi swap."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:33
msgid "For size recommendations, see the tables above."
msgstr "Untuk rekomendasi ukuran, lihat tabel di atas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:34
msgid "The following shell command snippet creates a 8GiB swap file."
msgstr "Cuplikan perintah shell berikut membuat file swap 8GiB."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:35
msgid ""
"A swap file on BtrFS filesystem prevent creating of a snapshot of that "
"volume.  [path]``/var`` in the following example is already excluded from "
"the snapper snapshots, so it is safe to use [path]``/var/swap``."
msgstr "File swap pada sistem file BtrFS mencegah pembuatan snapshot volume tersebut. [path]``/var`` dalam contoh berikut sudah dikecualikan dari snapshot snapper, sehingga aman menggunakan [path]``/var/swap``."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"## setup swapfile at /var/swap\n"
"# run following as a root user\n"
msgstr ""
"## setup swapfile at /var/swap\n"
"# run following as a root user\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# allocate 8GiB for swap file\n"
"fallocate -l 8G /var/swap\n"
"# ensure CoW is disabled for the swap file\n"
"chattr +C /var/swap\n"
"# allow only root access\n"
"chmod 600 /var/swap\n"
"# make swap file based on allocated file\n"
"mkswap /var/swap\n"
"# activate swap use for the running system\n"
"swapon /var/swap\n"
"# activate swap during the next boots\n"
"echo \"/var/swap swap swap defaults 0 0\" >> /etc/fstab\n"
msgstr ""
"# allocate 8GiB for swap file\n"
"fallocate -l 8G /var/swap\n"
"# ensure CoW is disabled for the swap file\n"
"chattr +C /var/swap\n"
"# allow only root access\n"
"chmod 600 /var/swap\n"
"# make swap file based on allocated file\n"
"mkswap /var/swap\n"
"# activate swap use for the running system\n"
"swapon /var/swap\n"
"# activate swap during the next boots\n"
"echo \"/var/swap swap swap defaults 0 0\" >> /etc/fstab\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database Requirement"
msgstr "Persyaratan Basis Data"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:39
msgid ""
"{postgresql} is the only supported database.  Using a remote {postgresql} "
"database or remote file systems (such as NFS) with the {postgresql} database "
"is not supported.  In other words, {postgresql} should be on the fastest "
"available storage device for {productname}."
msgstr "{postgresql} adalah satu-satunya basis data yang didukung. Menggunakan basis data {postgresql} remote atau sistem file remote (seperti NFS) dengan basis data {postgresql} tidak didukung. Dengan kata lain, {postgresql} harus berada pada perangkat penyimpanan tercepat yang tersedia untuk {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Because of potential performance issues, running a {postgresql} database "
"remotely from {productname} is discouraged.  While such an environment is "
"possible and even stable in many cases, there is always a risk of data loss "
"if something goes wrong."
msgstr "Karena potensi masalah kinerja, menjalankan basis data {postgresql} secara remote dari {productname} tidak disarankan. Meskipun lingkungan seperti itu mungkin dan bahkan stabil dalam banyak kasus, selalu ada risiko kehilangan data jika terjadi kesalahan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:41
msgid "{suse} might not be able to provide assistance in such cases."
msgstr "{suse} mungkin tidak dapat memberikan bantuan dalam kasus seperti itu."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Persistent Storage and Permissions"
msgstr "Penyimpanan Persisten dan Izin"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:43
msgid "Persistent volumes are created by default when deploying the container."
msgstr "Volume persisten dibuat secara default saat menerapkan kontainer."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:44
msgid ""
"However, it is recommended that the volumes are stored on one or more "
"separate storage devices.  Such a setup helps avoid data loss in production "
"environments.  This can be done after container deployment."
msgstr "Namun, direkomendasikan bahwa volume disimpan pada satu atau lebih perangkat penyimpanan terpisah. Penyiapan seperti ini membantu menghindari kehilangan data di lingkungan produksi. Ini dapat dilakukan setelah penerapan kontainer."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Storage devices best should be set up after first deploying the container.  "
"For more details, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[Persistent "
"Container Volumes]."
msgstr "Perangkat penyimpanan sebaiknya diatur setelah pertama kali menerapkan kontainer. Untuk detail lebih lanjut, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[Volume Kontainer Persisten]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:46
msgid ""
"We recommend you use XFS as the filesystem type for all volumes.  The size "
"of the disk for repositories storage is dependent on the number of "
"distributions and channels you intend to manage with {productname}.  See the "
"tables in this section for guides to estimate the size required."
msgstr "Kami merekomendasikan Anda menggunakan XFS sebagai jenis sistem file untuk semua volume. Ukuran disk untuk penyimpanan repositori tergantung pada jumlah distribusi dan saluran yang Anda intend untuk kelola dengan {productname}. Lihat tabel di bagian ini untuk panduan memperkirakan ukuran yang diperlukan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Do not use NFS for {cobbler} or {postgresql} storage, neither NFS on SELinux "
"environments.  These scenarios are not supported."
msgstr "Jangan gunakan NFS untuk penyimpanan {cobbler} atau {postgresql}, juga tidak NFS pada lingkungan SELinux. Skenario ini tidak didukung."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:48
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, use this command to find all available storage "
"devices:"
msgstr "Pada Server {productname}, gunakan perintah ini untuk menemukan semua perangkat penyimpanan yang tersedia:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:49
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "hwinfo --disk | grep -E \"Device File:\"\n"
msgstr "hwinfo --disk | grep -E \"Device File:\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:50
msgid "Use the [command]``lsblk`` command to see the name and size of each device."
msgstr "Gunakan perintah [command]``lsblk`` untuk melihat nama dan ukuran setiap perangkat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Use the [command]``mgr-storage-server`` command with the device names to set "
"up the external disks as the locations for the storage and, optionally on a "
"disk of its own, for the database:"
msgstr "Gunakan perintah [command]``mgr-storage-server`` dengan nama perangkat untuk mengatur disk eksternal sebagai lokasi untuk penyimpanan dan, secara opsional pada disk tersendiri, untuk basis data:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:55
msgid ""
"The external storage volumes are set up as XFS partitions mounted at "
"[path]``/manager_storage`` and [path]``/pgsql_storage``."
msgstr "Volume penyimpanan eksternal diatur sebagai partisi XFS yang dipasang di [path]``/manager_storage`` dan [path]``/pgsql_storage``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:58
msgid ""
"It is possible to use the same storage device for both channel data and the "
"database.  This is not recommended, as growing channel repositories might "
"fill up the storage, which poses a risk to database integrity.  Using "
"separate storage devices may also increase performance.  If you want to use "
"a single storage device, run [command]``mgr-storage-server`` with a single "
"device name parameter."
msgstr "Dimungkinkan untuk menggunakan perangkat penyimpanan yang sama untuk data saluran dan basis data. Ini tidak direkomendasikan, karena repositori saluran yang berkembang dapat mengisi penyimpanan, yang menimbulkan risiko terhadap integritas basis data. Menggunakan perangkat penyimpanan terpisah juga dapat meningkatkan kinerja. Jika Anda ingin menggunakan satu perangkat penyimpanan, jalankan [command]``mgr-storage-server`` dengan satu parameter nama perangkat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:59
msgid ""
"If you are installing a proxy, the [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` command "
"takes only one device name parameter and will set up the external storage "
"location as the Squid cache."
msgstr "Jika Anda menginstal proxy, perintah [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` hanya mengambil satu parameter nama perangkat dan akan mengatur lokasi penyimpanan eksternal sebagai cache Squid."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logical Volume Management (LVM)"
msgstr "Logical Volume Management (LVM)"

#.  container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc etc.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:61
msgid ""
"For all kind of virtual machines (VM), LVM is generally not needed and not "
"recommended.  The disk setup is virtual and separate disks for volumes are "
"possible and recommended."
msgstr "Untuk semua jenis mesin virtual (VM), LVM umumnya tidak diperlukan dan tidak direkomendasikan. Penyiapan disk bersifat virtual dan disk terpisah untuk volume dimungkinkan dan direkomendasikan."

#.  container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:62
msgid "For other deployments, separate disks for volumes are also recommended."
msgstr "Untuk penerapan lain, disk terpisah untuk volume juga direkomendasikan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:63
msgid ""
"On the container host of the {productname} Server, the "
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` command moves the complete content of the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` directory to a separate disk "
"and remounts it to [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."
msgstr "Pada host kontainer Server {productname}, perintah [command]``mgr-storage-server`` memindahkan seluruh konten direktori [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` ke disk terpisah dan memasangnya kembali ke [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Optionally, if a second device name is specified, "
"[command]``mgr-storage-server`` moves the content of the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql`` database directory "
"to a second separate disk and remounts it to "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql``."
msgstr "Secara opsional, jika nama perangkat kedua ditentukan, [command]``mgr-storage-server`` memindahkan konten direktori basis data [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql`` ke disk terpisah kedua dan memasangnya kembali ke [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:65
msgid ""
"Similarly, on the container host of the {productname} Proxy, the "
"[command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` command moves the complete content of the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` directory to a separate disk "
"and remounts it to [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."
msgstr "Demikian pula, pada host kontainer Proxy {productname}, perintah [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` memindahkan seluruh konten direktori [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` ke disk terpisah dan memasangnya kembali ke [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."

#
#
#. // *** The following is commented, and can probably deleted ***
#. // When installation takes place on bare metal (on-premise), [command]``cockpit`` can be used to create an LVM setup.
#. // In such a case, the disk setup needs to be performed manually.
#. // With containers {productname} now has [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` as an extra disk.
#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "Instal Proxy {productname}"

#.  **This file is needed to link generically to proxy installation**
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy.adoc:2
msgid ""
"There are various scenarios to deploy a {productname} Proxy.  All these "
"scenarios presume you have already successfully deployed a {productname} "
"{productnumber} Server."
msgstr "Ada berbagai skenario untuk menerapkan Proxy {productname}. Semua skenario ini mengasumsikan Anda telah berhasil menerapkan Server {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-pubcloud.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Cloud Deployment"
msgstr "Penerapan Cloud Publik"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-pubcloud.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Public clouds provide {productname} under a {byoslongform} ({byos}) or "
"{payglongform} ({payg}) models."
msgstr "Cloud publik menyediakan {productname} di bawah model {byoslongform} ({byos}) atau {payglongform} ({payg})."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-pubcloud.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about using {productname} in the public cloud, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[Public Cloud "
"Guide]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang menggunakan {productname} di cloud publik, lihat xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[Panduan Cloud Publik]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {productname} Server"
msgstr "Instal Server {productname}"

#.  **This file is needed to link generically to server installation**
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server.adoc:2
msgid "There are various scenarios to deploy a {productname} Server."
msgstr "Ada berbagai skenario untuk menerapkan Server {productname}."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:1
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation, Deployment and Upgrade"
msgstr "Instalasi, Penerapan, dan Pemutakhiran"

