#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:1
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Jaringan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:2
msgid "This section details the networking and port requirements for {productname}."
msgstr "Bagian ini merinci persyaratan jaringan dan port untuk {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:3
msgid ""
"IP forwarding will be enabled by containerized installation.  This means "
"{productname} Server and Proxies will behave as a router.  This behavior is "
"done by podman directly.  Podman containers do not run if IP forwarding is "
"disabled."
msgstr "IP forwarding akan diaktifkan oleh instalasi terkontainerisasi. Ini berarti Server dan Proxy {productname} akan berperilaku sebagai router. Perilaku ini dilakukan oleh podman secara langsung. Kontainer Podman tidak berjalan jika IP forwarding dinonaktifkan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Consider achieving network isolation of the {productname} environment "
"according to your policies."
msgstr "Pertimbangkan untuk mencapai isolasi jaringan lingkungan {productname} sesuai dengan kebijakan Anda."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:5
msgid "For more information, see https://www.suse.com/support/kb/doc/?id=000020166."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat https://www.suse.com/support/kb/doc/?id=000020166."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN)"
msgstr "Nama Domain Lengkap (FQDN)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The {productname} server must resolve its FQDN correctly.  If the FQDN "
"cannot be resolved, it can cause serious problems in a number of different "
"components."
msgstr "Server {productname} harus menyelesaikan FQDN-nya dengan benar. Jika FQDN tidak dapat diselesaikan, hal ini dapat menyebabkan masalah serius di sejumlah komponen yang berbeda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring the hostname and DNS, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-network.html#sec-network-yast-change-host."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang mengonfigurasi nama host dan DNS, lihat {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-network.html#sec-network-yast-change-host."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hostname and IP Address"
msgstr "Nama Host dan Alamat IP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:10
msgid ""
"To ensure that the {productname} domain name can be resolved by its clients, "
"both server and client machines must be connected to a working DNS server.  "
"You also need to ensure that reverse lookups are correctly configured."
msgstr "Untuk memastikan bahwa nama domain {productname} dapat diselesaikan oleh kliennya, baik server maupun mesin klien harus terhubung ke server DNS yang berfungsi. Anda juga perlu memastikan bahwa lookup terbalik dikonfigurasi dengan benar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about setting up a DNS server, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-dns.html."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang menyiapkan server DNS, lihat {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-dns.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reenable router advertisements"
msgstr "Mengaktifkan kembali iklan router"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:13
msgid ""
"When the {productname} is installed using [command]``mgradm install podman`` "
"or [command]``mgrpxy install podman``, it sets up Podman which enables IPv4 "
"and IPv6 forwarding.  This is needed for communication from the outside of "
"the container."
msgstr "Ketika {productname} diinstal menggunakan [command]``mgradm install podman`` atau [command]``mgrpxy install podman``, ini mengatur Podman yang mengaktifkan forwarding IPv4 dan IPv6. Ini diperlukan untuk komunikasi dari luar kontainer."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:14
msgid ""
"However, if your system previously had "
"[literal]``/proc/sys/net/ipv6/conf/eth0/accept_ra`` set to [literal]``1``, "
"it will stop using router advertisements.  As a result, the routes are no "
"longer obtained via router advertisements and the default IPv6 route is "
"missing."
msgstr "Namun, jika sistem Anda sebelumnya memiliki [literal]``/proc/sys/net/ipv6/conf/eth0/accept_ra`` diatur ke [literal]``1``, sistem akan berhenti menggunakan iklan router. Akibatnya, rute tidak lagi diperoleh melalui iklan router dan rute IPv6 default hilang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To recover correct functioning of the IPv6 routing, follow the procedure "
"depending on whether:"
msgstr "Untuk memulihkan fungsi yang benar dari perutean IPv6, ikuti prosedur tergantung pada apakah:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:16
msgid "server and proxy are based on {bci-mlm} (without Network manager)"
msgstr "server dan proxy berbasis {bci-mlm} (tanpa Network manager)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:17
msgid ""
"server and proxy are based on {sl-micro} {microversion} (with Network "
"manager)"
msgstr "server dan proxy berbasis {sl-micro} {microversion} (dengan Network manager)"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Reenabling router advertisements without Network Manager"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengaktifkan kembali iklan router tanpa Network Manager"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Create a file in [path]``/etc/sysctl.d``, for example "
"[literal]``99-ipv6-ras.conf``."
msgstr "Buat file di [path]``/etc/sysctl.d``, misalnya [literal]``99-ipv6-ras.conf``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:20
msgid "Add the following parameter and value to the file:"
msgstr "Tambahkan parameter dan nilai berikut ke file:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "net.ipv6.conf.eth0.accept_ra = 2\n"
msgstr "net.ipv6.conf.eth0.accept_ra = 2\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:23
msgid "Network management is not working when you have no wicked."
msgstr "Manajemen jaringan tidak berfungsi ketika Anda tidak memiliki wicked."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Reenabling router advertisements with Network Manager"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengaktifkan kembali iklan router dengan Network Manager"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:25
msgid "List your connections with [command]``nmcli connection show``."
msgstr "Daftarkan koneksi Anda dengan [command]``nmcli connection show``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Create or modify the file "
"[path]``/etc/NetworkManager/system-connections/<name of "
"connection>.nmconnection`` to add this setting:"
msgstr "Buat atau modifikasi file [path]``/etc/NetworkManager/system-connections/<name of connection>.nmconnection`` untuk menambahkan pengaturan ini:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[ipv6]\n"
"addr-gen-mode=eui64\n"
msgstr ""
"[ipv6]\n"
"addr-gen-mode=eui64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:29
msgid "The file should look similar to this:"
msgstr "File harus terlihat mirip dengan ini:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[connection]\n"
"id=Wired connection 1\n"
"type=ethernet\n"
"interface-name=eth0\n"
msgstr ""
"[connection]\n"
"id=Wired connection 1\n"
"type=ethernet\n"
"interface-name=eth0\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "[ethernet]\n"
msgstr "[ethernet]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[ipv4]\n"
"dns-priority=20\n"
"method=auto\n"
msgstr ""
"[ipv4]\n"
"dns-priority=20\n"
"method=auto\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[ipv6]\n"
"addr-gen-mode=eui64\n"
"method=auto\n"
msgstr ""
"[ipv6]\n"
"addr-gen-mode=eui64\n"
"method=auto\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment behind HTTP or HTTPS OSI level 7 proxy"
msgstr "Penerapan di belakang proxy HTTP atau HTTPS OSI level 7"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Some environments enforce internet access through a HTTP or HTTPS proxy.  "
"This could be a Squid server or similar.  To allow the {productname} Server "
"internet access in such configuration, you need to configure the following."
msgstr "Beberapa lingkungan memberlakukan akses internet melalui proxy HTTP atau HTTPS. Ini bisa berupa server Squid atau yang serupa. Untuk memungkinkan akses internet Server {productname} dalam konfigurasi seperti itu, Anda perlu mengonfigurasi berikut."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring HTTP or HTTPS OSI level 7 proxy"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi proxy HTTP atau HTTPS OSI level 7"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:37
msgid ""
"For operating system internet access, modify [path]``/etc/sysconfig/proxy`` "
"according to your needs:"
msgstr "Untuk akses internet sistem operasi, modifikasi [path]``/etc/sysconfig/proxy`` sesuai kebutuhan Anda:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"PROXY_ENABLED=\"no\"\n"
"HTTP_PROXY=\"\"\n"
"HTTPS_PROXY=\"\"\n"
"NO_PROXY=\"localhost, 127.0.0.1\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:39
msgid ""
"For ``Podman`` container internet access, modify "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/custom.conf`` according "
"to your needs.  For example, set:"
msgstr "Untuk akses internet kontainer ``Podman``, modifikasi [path]``/etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/custom.conf`` sesuai kebutuhan Anda. Misalnya, atur:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TZ=Europe/Berlin\n"
"Environment=\"PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS=\"\n"
"Environment=\"https_proxy=user:password@http://192.168.10.1:3128\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:41
msgid ""
"For Java application internet access, modify [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"according to your needs.  On the container host, execute [literal]``mgrctl "
"term`` to open a command line inside the server container:"
msgstr "Untuk akses internet aplikasi Java, modifikasi [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` sesuai kebutuhan Anda. Pada host kontainer, jalankan [literal]``mgrctl term`` untuk membuka baris perintah di dalam kontainer server:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Modify [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` according to your needs.  For example, "
"set:"
msgstr "Modifikasi [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` sesuai kebutuhan Anda. Misalnya, atur:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Use proxy FQDN, or FQDN:port\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy =\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy_username =\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy_password =\n"
"# no_proxy is a comma separated list\n"
"server.satellite.no_proxy =\n"
msgstr ""
"# Use proxy FQDN, or FQDN:port\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy =\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy_username =\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy_password =\n"
"# no_proxy is a comma separated list\n"
"server.satellite.no_proxy =\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:44
msgid "On the container host, restart the server to enforce the new configuration:"
msgstr "Pada host kontainer, mulai ulang server untuk menerapkan konfigurasi baru:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart uyuni-server.service\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Air-gapped Deployment"
msgstr "Penerapan Terisolasi Jaringan (Air-gapped)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:47
msgid ""
"If you are on an internal network and do not have access to {scclongform}, "
"you can use an "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc[Air-gapped "
"Deployment]."
msgstr "Jika Anda berada di jaringan internal dan tidak memiliki akses ke {scclongform}, Anda dapat menggunakan xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc[Penerapan Terisolasi Jaringan (Air-gapped)]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:48
msgid ""
"In a production environment, the {productname} Server and clients should "
"always use a firewall.  For a comprehensive list of the required ports, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc#ports[]."
msgstr "Di lingkungan produksi, Server {productname} dan klien harus selalu menggunakan firewall. Untuk daftar lengkap port yang diperlukan, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc#ports[]."

#. For more information on disconnected setup and port configuration, see xref:administration:disconnected-setup.adoc[].
#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Required Network Ports"
msgstr "Port Jaringan yang Diperlukan"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:50
msgid ""
"This section contains a comprehensive list of ports that are used for "
"various communications within {productname}."
msgstr "Bagian ini berisi daftar lengkap port yang digunakan untuk berbagai komunikasi dalam {productname}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:51
msgid ""
"You will not need to open all of these ports.  Some ports only need to be "
"opened if you are using the service that requires them."
msgstr "Anda tidak perlu membuka semua port ini. Beberapa port hanya perlu dibuka jika Anda menggunakan layanan yang memerlukannya."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "ports_diagram.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "ports_proxy_diagram.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Inbound Server Ports"
msgstr "Port Server Inbound Eksternal"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:58
msgid ""
"External inbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the "
"{productname} Server to protect the server from unauthorized access."
msgstr "Port inbound eksternal harus dibuka untuk mengonfigurasi firewall pada Server {productname} untuk melindungi server dari akses yang tidak sah."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Opening these ports allows external network traffic to access the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "Membuka port ini memungkinkan lalu lintas jaringan eksternal mengakses Server {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:60
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Port Requirements for {productname} Server"
msgstr "Persyaratan Port Eksternal untuk Server {productname}"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By    | Notes\n"
"| 67          | TCP/UDP  | DHCP       | Required only if clients are "
"requesting IP addresses from the server.\n"
"| 69          | TCP/UDP  | TFTP       | Required if server is used as a PXE "
"server for automated client installation.\n"
"| 80          | TCP      | HTTP       | Required temporarily for some "
"bootstrap repositories and automated installations.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS      | Serves the {webui}, client, and "
"server and proxy (``tftpsync``) requests.\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | salt       | Required to accept communication "
"requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to receive commands "
"from the Salt master.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | salt       | Required to accept communication "
"requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to report results "
"back to the Salt master.\n"
"| 5432        | TCP      | PostgreSQL | Required to access the reporting "
"database.\n"
"| 5556        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping Taskomatic JMX "
"metrics.\n"
"| 5557        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping Tomcat JMX "
"metrics.\n"
"| 9100        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping Node exporter "
"metrics.\n"
"| 9187        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping PostgreSQL "
"metrics.\n"
"| 9800        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping Taskomatic "
"metrics.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nomor Port | Protokol | Digunakan Oleh    | Catatan\n"
"| 67          | TCP/UDP  | DHCP       | Diperlukan hanya jika klien meminta alamat IP dari server.\n"
"| 69          | TCP/UDP  | TFTP       | Diperlukan jika server digunakan sebagai server PXE untuk instalasi klien otomatis.\n"
"| 80          | TCP      | HTTP       | Diperlukan sementara untuk beberapa repositori bootstrap dan instalasi otomatis.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS      | Melayani {webui}, klien, dan permintaan server dan proxy (``tftpsync``).\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | salt       | Diperlukan untuk menerima permintaan komunikasi dari klien.\n"
"Klien memulai koneksi, dan tetap terbuka untuk menerima perintah dari master Salt.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | salt       | Diperlukan untuk menerima permintaan komunikasi dari klien.\n"
"Klien memulai koneksi, dan tetap terbuka untuk melaporkan hasil kembali ke master Salt.\n"
"| 5432   | TCP      | PostgreSQL | Diperlukan untuk mengakses basis data pelaporan.\n"
"| 5556        | TCP      | Prometheus | Diperlukan untuk mengambil metrik JMX Taskomatic.\n"
"| 5557        | TCP      | Prometheus | Diperlukan untuk mengambil metrik JMX Tomcat.\n"
"| 9100     | TCP      | Prometheus | Diperlukan untuk mengambil metrik Node exporter.\n"
"| 9187        | TCP      | Prometheus | Diperlukan untuk mengambil metrik PostgreSQL.\n"
"| 9800        | TCP      | Prometheus | Diperlukan untuk mengambil metrik Taskomatic.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Outbound Server Ports"
msgstr "Port Server Outbound Eksternal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:63
msgid ""
"External outbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the "
"{productname} Server to restrict what the server can access."
msgstr "Port outbound eksternal harus dibuka untuk mengonfigurasi firewall pada Server {productname} untuk membatasi apa yang dapat diakses server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Opening these ports allows network traffic from the {productname} Server to "
"communicate with external services."
msgstr "Membuka port ini memungkinkan lalu lintas jaringan dari Server {productname} untuk berkomunikasi dengan layanan eksternal."

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By | Notes\n"
"| 80          | TCP | HTTP       | Required for {scclongform}.\n"
"Port 80 is not used to serve the {webui}.\n"
"| 443         | TCP | HTTPS      | Required for {scclongform}.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nomor Port | Protokol | Digunakan Oleh | Catatan\n"
"| 80          | TCP | HTTP       | Diperlukan untuk {scclongform}.\n"
"Port 80 tidak digunakan untuk melayani {webui}.\n"
"| 443         | TCP | HTTPS      | Diperlukan untuk {scclongform}.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Internal Server Ports"
msgstr "Port Server Internal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:68
msgid ""
"Internal ports are used internally by the {productname} Server.  Internal "
"ports are only accessible from [literal]``localhost``."
msgstr "Port internal digunakan secara internal oleh Server {productname}. Port internal hanya dapat diakses dari [literal]``localhost``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:69
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:87
msgid "In most cases, you will not need to adjust these ports."
msgstr "Dalam kebanyakan kasus, Anda tidak perlu menyesuaikan port ini."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Internal Port Requirements for {productname} Server"
msgstr "Persyaratan Port Internal untuk Server {productname}"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Notes\n"
"| 2828        | Satellite-search API, used by the RHN application in Tomcat "
"and Taskomatic.\n"
"| 2829        | Taskomatic API, used by the RHN application in Tomcat.\n"
"| 8005        | Tomcat shutdown port.\n"
"| 8009        | Tomcat to Apache HTTPD (AJP).\n"
"| 8080        | Tomcat to Apache HTTPD (HTTP).\n"
"| 9080        | Salt-API, used by the RHN application in Tomcat and "
"Taskomatic.\n"
"| 32000       | Port for a TCP connection to the Java Virtual Machine (JVM) "
"that runs Taskomatic and satellite-search.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nomor Port | Catatan\n"
"| 2828        | API Satellite-search, digunakan oleh aplikasi RHN di Tomcat dan Taskomatic.\n"
"| 2829        | API Taskomatic, digunakan oleh aplikasi RHN di Tomcat.\n"
"| 8005        | Port shutdown Tomcat.\n"
"| 8009        | Tomcat ke Apache HTTPD (AJP).\n"
"| 8080        | Tomcat ke Apache HTTPD (HTTP).\n"
"| 9080        | Salt-API, digunakan oleh aplikasi RHN di Tomcat dan Taskomatic.\n"
"| 32000       | Port untuk koneksi TCP ke Java Virtual Machine (JVM) yang menjalankan Taskomatic dan satellite-search.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:72
msgid ""
"Port 32768 and higher are used as ephemeral ports.  These are most often "
"used to receive TCP connections.  When a TCP connection request is received, "
"the sender will choose one of these ephemeral port numbers to match the "
"destination port."
msgstr "Port 32768 dan lebih tinggi digunakan sebagai port ephemeral. Ini paling sering digunakan untuk menerima koneksi TCP. Ketika permintaan koneksi TCP diterima, pengirim akan memilih salah satu nomor port ephemeral ini untuk mencocokkan port tujuan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:73
msgid "You can use this command to find out which ports are ephemeral ports:"
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan perintah ini untuk mengetahui port mana yang merupakan port ephemeral:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_local_port_range\n"
msgstr "cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_local_port_range\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Inbound Proxy Ports"
msgstr "Port Proxy Inbound Eksternal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:76
msgid ""
"External inbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the "
"{productname} Proxy to protect the proxy from unauthorized access."
msgstr "Port inbound eksternal harus dibuka untuk mengonfigurasi firewall pada Proxy {productname} untuk melindungi proxy dari akses yang tidak sah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:77
msgid ""
"Opening these ports allows external network traffic to access the "
"{productname} proxy."
msgstr "Membuka port ini memungkinkan lalu lintas jaringan eksternal mengakses proxy {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:78
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Port Requirements for {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "Persyaratan Port Eksternal untuk Proxy {productname}"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By | Notes\n"
"| 22          |          |         | Only required if the user wants to "
"manage the proxy host with {salt} SSH.\n"
"| 67          | TCP/UDP  | DHCP    | Required only if clients are requesting "
"IP addresses from the server.\n"
"| 69          | TCP/UDP  | TFTP    | Required if the server is used as a PXE "
"server for automated client installation.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS   | {webui}, client, and server and proxy "
"(``tftpsync``) requests.\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | salt    | Required to accept communication "
"requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to receive commands "
"from the Salt master.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | salt    | Required to accept communication "
"requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to report results "
"back to the Salt master.\n"
"| 8022        |          |         | Required for ssh-push and "
"ssh-push-tunnel contact methods. Clients connected to the proxy initiate "
"check in on the server and hop through to clients.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nomor Port | Protokol | Digunakan Oleh | Catatan\n"
"| 22          |    |         | Hanya diperlukan jika pengguna ingin mengelola host proxy dengan {salt} SSH.\n"
"| 67          | TCP/UDP  | DHCP    | Diperlukan hanya jika klien meminta alamat IP dari server.\n"
"| 69          | TCP/UDP  | TFTP    | Diperlukan jika server digunakan sebagai server PXE untuk instalasi klien otomatis.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS  | {webui}, klien, dan permintaan server dan proxy (``tftpsync``).\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | salt    | Diperlukan untuk menerima permintaan komunikasi dari klien.\n"
"Klien memulai koneksi, dan tetap terbuka untuk menerima perintah dari master Salt.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP | salt    | Diperlukan untuk menerima permintaan komunikasi dari klien.\n"
"Klien memulai koneksi, dan tetap terbuka untuk melaporkan hasil kembali ke master Salt.\n"
"| 8022        |          |         | Diperlukan untuk metode kontak ssh-push dan ssh-push-tunnel. Klien yang terhubung ke proxy memulai check in di server dan melompat ke klien.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Outbound Proxy Ports"
msgstr "Port Proxy Outbound Eksternal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:81
msgid ""
"External outbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the "
"{productname} Proxy to restrict what the proxy can access."
msgstr "Port outbound eksternal harus dibuka untuk mengonfigurasi firewall pada Proxy {productname} untuk membatasi apa yang dapat diakses proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:82
msgid ""
"Opening these ports allows network traffic from the {productname} Proxy to "
"communicate with external services."
msgstr "Membuka port ini memungkinkan lalu lintas jaringan dari Proxy {productname} untuk berkomunikasi dengan layanan eksternal."

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By | Notes\n"
"| 80          |          |         | Used to reach the server.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS   | Required for {scclongform}.\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | Salt    | Required to connect to Salt master "
"either directly or via proxy.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | Salt    | Required to connect to Salt master "
"either directly or via proxy.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nomor Port | Protokol | Digunakan Oleh | Catatan\n"
"| 80          |    |         | Digunakan untuk mencapai server.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS   | Diperlukan untuk {scclongform}.\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | Salt    | Diperlukan untuk terhubung ke master Salt baik secara langsung atau melalui proxy.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | Salt    | Diperlukan untuk terhubung ke master Salt baik secara langsung atau melalui proxy.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Client Ports"
msgstr "Port Klien Eksternal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:86
msgid ""
"External client ports must be opened to configure a firewall between the "
"{productname} Server and its clients."
msgstr "Port klien eksternal harus dibuka untuk mengonfigurasi firewall antara Server {productname} dan kliennya."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Port Requirements for {productname} Clients"
msgstr "Persyaratan Port Eksternal untuk Klien {productname}"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Direction | Protocol | Notes\n"
"| 22          | Inbound   | SSH      | Required for ssh-push and "
"ssh-push-tunnel contact methods.\n"
"| 80          | Outbound  |          | Used to reach the server or proxy.\n"
"| 443         | Outbound  |          | Used to reach the server or proxy.\n"
"| 4505        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required to connect to Salt master "
"either directly or via proxy.\n"
"| 4506        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required to connect to Salt master "
"either directly or via proxy.\n"
"| 9090        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus user "
"interface.\n"
"| 9093        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus alert "
"manager.\n"
"| 9100        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus node "
"exporter.\n"
"| 9117        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus Apache "
"exporter.\n"
"| 9187        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus PostgreSQL.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nomor Port | Arah | Protokol | Catatan\n"
"| 22          | Inbound   | SSH      | Diperlukan untuk metode kontak ssh-push dan ssh-push-tunnel.\n"
"| 80          | Outbound  |          | Digunakan untuk mencapai server atau proxy.\n"
"| 443         | Outbound  |         | Digunakan untuk mencapai server atau proxy.\n"
"| 4505        | Outbound  | TCP      | Diperlukan untuk terhubung ke master Salt baik secara langsung atau melalui proxy.\n"
"| 4506        | Outbound  | TCP   | Diperlukan untuk terhubung ke master Salt baik secara langsung atau melalui proxy.\n"
"| 9090        | Outbound  | TCP      | Diperlukan untuk antarmuka pengguna Prometheus.\n"
"| 9093        | Outbound  | TCP  | Diperlukan untuk alert manager Prometheus.\n"
"| 9100        | Outbound | TCP      | Diperlukan untuk node exporter Prometheus.\n"
"| 9117        | Outbound  | TCP      | Diperlukan untuk Apache exporter Prometheus.\n"
"| 9187        | Outbound  | TCP      | Diperlukan untuk PostgreSQL Prometheus.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "Required URLs"
msgstr "URL yang Diperlukan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:91
msgid ""
"There are some URLs that {productname} must be able to access to register "
"clients and perform updates.  In most cases, allowing access to these URLs "
"is sufficient:"
msgstr "Ada beberapa URL yang harus dapat diakses {productname} untuk mendaftarkan klien dan melakukan pemutakhiran. Dalam kebanyakan kasus, mengizinkan akses ke URL ini sudah cukup:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:92
msgid "[literal]``scc.suse.com``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:93
msgid "[literal]``updates.suse.com``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:94
msgid "[literal]``installer-updates.suse.com``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:95
msgid "[literal]``registry.suse.com``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:96
msgid "[literal]``registry-storage.suse.com``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:97
msgid "[literal]``opensuse.org``"
msgstr "[literal]``opensuse.org``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:98
msgid "Additionally, you may need access to these URLs for non-SUSE products:"
msgstr "Selain itu, Anda mungkin memerlukan akses ke URL ini untuk produk non-SUSE:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:99
msgid "[literal]``download.nvidia.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``download.nvidia.com``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:100
msgid "[literal]``public.dhe.ibm.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``public.dhe.ibm.com``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:101
msgid "[literal]``nu.novell.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``nu.novell.com``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:102
msgid ""
"You can find additional details on whitelisting the specified URLs and their "
"associated IP addresses in this article: "
"https://support.scc.suse.com/s/kb/SUSE-Customer-Center-and-SUSE-registry-URLs-for-access-behind-a-firewall-and-or-through-a-proxy[Accessing "
"{scclongform} and SUSE registry behind a firewall and/or through a proxy]."
msgstr "Anda dapat menemukan detail tambahan tentang membuat daftar putih URL yang ditentukan dan alamat IP terkait mereka di artikel ini: https://support.scc.suse.com/s/kb/SUSE-Customer-Center-and-SUSE-registry-URLs-for-access-behind-a-firewall-and-or-through-a-proxy[Mengakses {scclongform} dan registri SUSE di belakang firewall dan/atau melalui proxy]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:103
msgid ""
"If you are using non-{suse} clients you might also need to allow access to "
"other servers that provide specific packages for those operating systems.  "
"For example, if you have {ubuntu} clients, you will need to be able to "
"access the {ubuntu} server."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan klien non-{suse}, Anda mungkin juga perlu mengizinkan akses ke server lain yang menyediakan paket khusus untuk sistem operasi tersebut. Misalnya, jika Anda memiliki klien {ubuntu}, Anda harus dapat mengakses server {ubuntu}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:104
msgid ""
"For more information about troubleshooting firewall access for non-{suse} "
"clients, see xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang pemecahan masalah akses firewall untuk klien non-{suse}, lihat xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Cloud Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan Cloud Publik"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section provides the requirements for installing {productname} on "
"public cloud infrastructure.  We have tested these instructions on Amazon "
"EC2, Google Compute Engine, and Microsoft Azure, but they should work on "
"other providers as well, with some variation."
msgstr "Bagian ini menyediakan persyaratan untuk menginstal {productname} pada infrastruktur cloud publik. Kami telah menguji instruksi ini di Amazon EC2, Google Compute Engine, dan Microsoft Azure, tetapi seharusnya berfungsi pada penyedia lain juga, dengan beberapa variasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:3
msgid "Before you begin, here are some considerations:"
msgstr "Sebelum Anda memulai, berikut adalah beberapa pertimbangan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The {productname} setup procedure performs a forward-confirmed reverse DNS "
"lookup.  This must succeed in order for the setup procedure to complete and "
"for {productname} to operate as expected.  It is important to perform "
"hostname and IP configuration before you set up {productname}."
msgstr "Prosedur penyiapan {productname} melakukan lookup DNS terbalik yang dikonfirmasi ke depan. Ini harus berhasil agar prosedur penyiapan selesai dan {productname} beroperasi seperti yang diharapkan. Penting untuk melakukan konfigurasi nama host dan IP sebelum Anda menyiapkan {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{productname} Server and Proxy instances need to run in a network "
"configuration that provides you control over DNS entries, but cannot be "
"accessed from the internet at large."
msgstr "Instans Server dan Proxy {productname} perlu berjalan dalam konfigurasi jaringan yang memberi Anda kendali atas entri DNS, tetapi tidak dapat diakses dari internet secara luas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Within this network configuration DNS resolution must be provided: `hostname "
"-f` must return the fully qualified domain name (FQDN)."
msgstr "Dalam konfigurasi jaringan ini, resolusi DNS harus disediakan: `hostname -f` harus mengembalikan nama domain lengkap (FQDN)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:7
msgid "DNS resolution is also important for connecting clients."
msgstr "Resolusi DNS juga penting untuk menghubungkan klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:8
msgid ""
"DNS is dependent on the cloud framework you choose.  Refer to the cloud "
"provider documentation for detailed instructions."
msgstr "DNS tergantung pada kerangka cloud yang Anda pilih. Lihat dokumentasi penyedia cloud untuk instruksi terperinci."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:9
msgid ""
"We recommend that you locate software repositories, the server database, and "
"the proxy squid cache on an external virtual disk.  This prevents data loss "
"if the instance is unexpectedly terminated.  This section includes "
"instructions for setting up an external virtual disk."
msgstr "Kami merekomendasikan agar Anda menempatkan repositori perangkat lunak, basis data server, dan cache squid proxy pada disk virtual eksternal. Ini mencegah kehilangan data jika instans dihentikan secara tidak terduga. Bagian ini mencakup instruksi untuk menyiapkan disk virtual eksternal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:11
msgid ""
"When you use {productname} on a public cloud, you must use a restricted "
"network.  We recommend using a VPC private subnet with an appropriate "
"firewall setting.  Only machines in your specified IP ranges must be able to "
"access the instance."
msgstr "Ketika Anda menggunakan {productname} di cloud publik, Anda harus menggunakan jaringan terbatas. Kami merekomendasikan menggunakan subnet privat VPC dengan pengaturan firewall yang sesuai. Hanya mesin dalam rentang IP yang Anda tentukan yang harus dapat mengakses instans."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Running {productname} on the public cloud means implementing robust security "
"measures. It is essential to limit, filter, monitor, and audit access to the "
"instance.  {SUSE} strongly advises against a globally accessible "
"{productname} instance that lacks adequate perimeter security."
msgstr "Menjalankan {productname} di cloud publik berarti menerapkan langkah-langkah keamanan yang kuat. Penting untuk membatasi, memfilter, memantau, dan mengaudit akses ke instans. {SUSE} sangat menyarankan terhadap instans {productname} yang dapat diakses secara global yang tidak memiliki keamanan perimeter yang memadai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To access the {productname} {webui}, allow HTTPS when configuring the "
"network access controls.  This allows you to access the {productname} "
"{webui}."
msgstr "Untuk mengakses {webui} {productname}, izinkan HTTPS saat mengonfigurasi kontrol akses jaringan. Ini memungkinkan Anda mengakses {webui} {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In EC2 and Azure, create a new security group, and add inbound and outbound "
"rules for HTTPS.  In GCE, check the ``Allow HTTPS traffic`` box under the "
"``Firewall`` section."
msgstr "Di EC2 dan Azure, buat grup keamanan baru, dan tambahkan aturan inbound dan outbound untuk HTTPS. Di GCE, centang kotak ``Allow HTTPS traffic`` di bagian ``Firewall``."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare Storage Volumes"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Volume Penyimpanan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:16
msgid ""
"We recommend that the repositories and the database for {productname} are "
"stored on separate storage devices from the root volume.  This will help to "
"avoid data loss and possibly increase performance."
msgstr "Kami merekomendasikan agar repositori dan basis data untuk {productname} disimpan pada perangkat penyimpanan terpisah dari volume root. Ini akan membantu menghindari kehilangan data dan mungkin meningkatkan kinerja."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The {productname} container utilizes default storage locations. These "
"locations should be configured prior to deployment for custom storage.  For "
"more information see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[Persistent "
"container volumes]"
msgstr "Kontainer {productname} menggunakan lokasi penyimpanan default. Lokasi ini harus dikonfigurasi sebelum penerapan untuk penyimpanan khusus. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[Volume kontainer persisten]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:18
msgid "Do not use logical volume management (LVM) for public cloud installations."
msgstr "Jangan gunakan logical volume management (LVM) untuk instalasi cloud publik."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The size of the disk for repositories storage is dependent on the number of "
"distributions and channels you intend to manage with {productname}.  When "
"you attach the virtual disks, they will appear in your instance as Unix "
"device nodes.  The names of the device nodes will vary depending on your "
"provider, and the instance type selected."
msgstr "Ukuran disk untuk penyimpanan repositori tergantung pada jumlah distribusi dan saluran yang Anda intend untuk kelola dengan {productname}. Ketika Anda menempelkan disk virtual, mereka akan muncul di instans Anda sebagai node perangkat Unix. Nama node perangkat akan bervariasi tergantung pada penyedia Anda, dan jenis instans yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Ensure the root volume of the {productname} Server is 100{nbsp}GB or "
"larger.  Add an additional storage disk of 500{nbsp}GB or more, and choose "
"SSD storage if you can.  The cloud images for {productname} Server use a "
"script to assign this separate volume when your instance is launched."
msgstr "Pastikan volume root Server {productname} berukuran 100{nbsp}GB atau lebih besar. Tambahkan disk penyimpanan tambahan sebesar 500{nbsp}GB atau lebih, dan pilih penyimpanan SSD jika Anda bisa. Citra cloud untuk Server {productname} menggunakan skrip untuk menetapkan volume terpisah ini saat instans Anda diluncurkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:21
msgid ""
"When you launch your instance, you can log in to the {productname} Server "
"and use this command to find all available storage devices:"
msgstr "Ketika Anda meluncurkan instans Anda, Anda dapat masuk ke Server {productname} dan menggunakan perintah ini untuk menemukan semua perangkat penyimpanan yang tersedia:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:23
msgid ""
"If you are not sure which device to choose, use the [command]``lsblk`` "
"command to see the name and size of each device.  Choose the name that "
"matches with the size of the virtual disk you are looking for."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak yakin perangkat mana yang harus dipilih, gunakan perintah [command]``lsblk`` untuk melihat nama dan ukuran setiap perangkat. Pilih nama yang cocok dengan ukuran disk virtual yang Anda cari."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You can set up the external disk with the [command]``mgr-storage-server`` "
"command.  This creates an XFS partition mounted at ``/manager_storage`` and "
"uses it as the location for the database and repositories:"
msgstr "Anda dapat mengatur disk eksternal dengan perintah [command]``mgr-storage-server``. Ini membuat partisi XFS yang dipasang di ``/manager_storage`` dan menggunakannya sebagai lokasi untuk basis data dan repositori:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/bin/mgr-storage-server <devicename>\n"
msgstr "/usr/bin/mgr-storage-server <devicename>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information about setting up storage volumes and partitions, "
"including recommended minimum sizes, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang menyiapkan volume penyimpanan dan partisi, termasuk ukuran minimum yang direkomendasikan, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Deployment on {kube}"
msgstr "Penerapan Server di {kube}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} can also be deployed on {kube}.  This guide shows you how to "
"install and configure a {productname} {productnumber} on {kube} on RKE2."
msgstr "{productname} juga dapat diterapkan di {kube}. Panduan ini menunjukkan cara menginstal dan mengonfigurasi {productname} {productnumber} di {kube} pada RKE2."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Several personas are involved in the installation of {productname} on "
"{kube}:"
msgstr "Beberapa persona terlibat dalam instalasi {productname} di {kube}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:4
msgid "the {kube} administrator manages the cluster, its users and accesses,"
msgstr "administrator {kube} mengelola kluster, pengguna, dan aksesnya,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:5
msgid ""
"the infrastructure administrator takes care of wiring the network access to "
"the cluster,"
msgstr "administrator infrastruktur mengurus pengkabelan akses jaringan ke kluster,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:6
msgid ""
"the PKI administrator is responsible for the TLS certificates generation and "
"deployment infrastructure,"
msgstr "administrator PKI bertanggung jawab atas generasi sertifikat TLS dan infrastruktur penerapan,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:7
msgid ""
"the {productname} administrator controls the application itself and its "
"deployment."
msgstr "administrator {productname} mengendalikan aplikasi itu sendiri dan penerapannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In some cases, some of those personas can be merged into a single person or "
"team, but keeping then in mind will explain why the installation is not a "
"one-shot script doing everything.  {kube} clusters can also vary a lot "
"between organizations, so the {productname} core installation is designed to "
"be as agnostic as possible of those specific cases."
msgstr "Dalam beberapa kasus, beberapa persona tersebut dapat digabungkan menjadi satu orang atau tim, tetapi mengingat hal ini akan menjelaskan mengapa instalasi bukan skrip satu kali yang melakukan semuanya. Kluster {kube} juga dapat sangat bervariasi antar organisasi, sehingga instalasi inti {productname} dirancang untuk menjadi seagnostik mungkin dari kasus khusus tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If there isn't one defined yet, a [literal]``Role`` and "
"[literal]``RoleBinding`` with minimum rights required to deploy "
"[literal]``server-helm`` would look like the following:"
msgstr "Jika belum ada yang didefinisikan, [literal]``Role`` dan [literal]``RoleBinding`` dengan hak minimum yang diperlukan untuk menerapkan [literal]``server-helm`` akan terlihat seperti berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The {productname} administrator needs to deploy the [literal]``server-helm`` "
"{helm} chart.  However, this chart requires to prepare:"
msgstr "Administrator {productname} perlu menerapkan bagan {helm} [literal]``server-helm``. Namun, bagan ini memerlukan persiapan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:17
msgid "TLS certificates chain for the server and database,"
msgstr "Rantai sertifikat TLS untuk server dan basis data,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:18
msgid "[literal]``ConfigMaps`` for the server and database root CA certificates,"
msgstr "[literal]``ConfigMaps`` untuk sertifikat CA root server dan basis data,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:19
msgid ""
"persistent volumes for the claims the chart will create or a storage class "
"automatically creating them,"
msgstr "volume persisten untuk klaim yang akan dibuat bagan atau kelas penyimpanan yang membuatnya secara otomatis,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:20
msgid "credentials secrets for the database users and the administrator,"
msgstr "secret kredensial untuk pengguna basis data dan administrator,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Load balancers or other mechanisms to expose the Salt, report database and "
"optionally TFTP ports."
msgstr "Load balancer atau mekanisme lain untuk mengekspos port Salt, basis data laporan, dan opsional TFTP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Run the following command to read the full details on how to use the server "
"{helm} chart:"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah berikut untuk membaca detail lengkap tentang cara menggunakan bagan {helm} server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"helm show readme --version {productchartversion} \\\n"
"    oci://registry.suse.com/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.2/server-helm\n"
msgstr ""
"helm show readme --version {productchartversion} \\\n"
"    oci://registry.suse.com/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.2/server-helm\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"helm show readme --version {productchartversion} \\\n"
"    oci://registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server-helm\n"
msgstr ""
"helm show readme --version {productchartversion} \\\n"
"    oci://registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server-helm\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For older versions, the Helm chart is located in a snapshot repository like: "
"[literal]``oci://registry.opensuse.org/systemsmanagement/uyuni/snapshots/<version>/opensuse_tumbleweed/uyuni/server-helm``."
msgstr "Untuk versi yang lebih lama, bagan Helm terletak di repositori snapshot seperti: [literal]``oci://registry.opensuse.org/systemsmanagement/uyuni/snapshots/<version>/opensuse_tumbleweed/uyuni/server-helm``."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Global architecture"
msgstr "Arsitektur global"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:28
msgid ""
"This diagram shows the components deployed by the [literal]``server-helm`` "
"chart and the ones expected to be created before hand."
msgstr "Diagram ini menunjukkan komponen yang diterapkan oleh bagan [literal]``server-helm`` dan yang diharapkan dibuat sebelumnya."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "server-kubernetes-design.png"
msgstr "server-kubernetes-design.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:30
msgid "Red items are required,"
msgstr "Item merah diperlukan,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:31
msgid "Green items are optional and can be enabled using the chart values,"
msgstr "Item hijau bersifat opsional dan dapat diaktifkan menggunakan nilai bagan,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:32
msgid "Black components are the core components."
msgstr "Komponen hitam adalah komponen inti."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Even if there are values to disable the internal database, using an external "
"one is not supported yet.  Those properties are only present for testing "
"purpose."
msgstr "Meskipun ada nilai untuk menonaktifkan basis data internal, menggunakan basis data eksternal belum didukung. Properti tersebut hanya ada untuk tujuan pengujian."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:34
msgid "The next sections will explain the resources that are expected."
msgstr "Bagian berikutnya akan menjelaskan sumber daya yang diharapkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:36
msgid ""
"The deployment requires four specific secrets of "
"[literal]``kubernetes.io/basic-auth`` type, each containing a "
"[literal]``username`` and a [literal]``password`` key.  Here are example "
"commands to create them, set the [literal]``NAMESPACE`` variable to the "
"namespace where {productname} will be installed.  Adjust these commands to "
"set actual passwords."
msgstr "Penerapan memerlukan empat secret spesifik jenis [literal]``kubernetes.io/basic-auth``, masing-masing berisi kunci [literal]``username`` dan [literal]``password``. Berikut adalah contoh perintah untuk membuatnya, atur variabel [literal]``NAMESPACE`` ke namespace tempat {productname} akan diinstal. Sesuaikan perintah ini untuk mengatur kata sandi yang sebenarnya."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Using [literal]``--from-literal`` for the passwords is not a secure "
"practice, read the command help to use [literal]``--from-file`` or "
"[literal]``--from-env-file``.  If using declarative YAML definitions instead "
"of these commands, make sure these files are encrypted before pushing them "
"to a remote version control."
msgstr "Menggunakan [literal]``--from-literal`` untuk kata sandi bukanlah praktik yang aman, baca bantuan perintah untuk menggunakan [literal]``--from-file`` atau [literal]``--from-env-file``. Jika menggunakan definisi YAML deklaratif alih-alih perintah ini, pastikan file ini dienkripsi sebelum mendorongnya ke kontrol versi remote."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"kubectl create secret generic -n $NAMESPACE --type "
"'kubernetes.io/basic-auth' \\\n"
"    --from-literal=username=dbadmin \\\n"
"    --from-literal=password=supersecret \\\n"
"    db-admin-credentials\n"
"kubectl create secret generic -n $NAMESPACE --type "
"'kubernetes.io/basic-auth' \\\n"
"    --from-literal=username=dbuser \\\n"
"    --from-literal=password=supersecret \\\n"
"    db-credentials\n"
"kubectl create secret generic -n $NAMESPACE --type "
"'kubernetes.io/basic-auth' \\\n"
"    --from-literal=username=reportdb \\\n"
"    --from-literal=password=supersecret \\\n"
"    reportdb-credentials\n"
"kubectl create secret generic -n $NAMESPACE --type "
"'kubernetes.io/basic-auth' \\\n"
"    --from-literal=username=admin \\\n"
"    --from-literal=password=supersecret \\\n"
"    admin-credentials\n"
msgstr ""
"kubectl create secret generic -n $NAMESPACE --type 'kubernetes.io/basic-auth' \\\n"
"    --from-literal=username=dbadmin \\\n"
"    --from-literal=password=supersecret \\\n"
"    db-admin-credentials\n"
"kubectl create secret generic -n $NAMESPACE --type 'kubernetes.io/basic-auth' \\\n"
"    --from-literal=username=dbuser \\\n"
"    --from-literal=password=supersecret \\\n"
"    db-credentials\n"
"kubectl create secret generic -n $NAMESPACE --type 'kubernetes.io/basic-auth' \\\n"
"    --from-literal=username=reportdb \\\n"
"    --from-literal=password=supersecret \\\n"
"    reportdb-credentials\n"
"kubectl create secret generic -n $NAMESPACE --type 'kubernetes.io/basic-auth' \\\n"
"    --from-literal=username=admin \\\n"
"    --from-literal=password=supersecret \\\n"
"    admin-credentials\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:39
msgid ""
"A secret with the SCC credentials needs to be defined in order to pull the "
"images from `registry.suse.com`.  Refer to "
"https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/configure-pod-container/pull-image-private-registry/ "
"for the instructions to prepare the secret.  Set the `registrySecret` "
"[literal]``server-helm`` chart value to the name of the secret containing "
"those credentials to use it."
msgstr "Secret dengan kredensial SCC perlu didefinisikan untuk menarik citra dari `registry.suse.com`. Lihat https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/configure-pod-container/pull-image-private-registry/ untuk instruksi menyiapkan secret. Atur nilai bagan [literal]``server-helm`` `registrySecret` ke nama secret yang berisi kredensial tersebut untuk menggunakannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:41
msgid "The following TLS secrets are expected:"
msgstr "Secret TLS berikut diharapkan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:42
msgid ""
"[literal]``db-cert``: TLS certificate for the report database and needs to "
"have the [literal]``db`` and [literal]``reportdb`` Subject Alternate Names, "
"and the FQDN exposed to the outside world."
msgstr "[literal]``db-cert``: Sertifikat TLS untuk basis data laporan dan perlu memiliki Subject Alternate Names [literal]``db`` dan [literal]``reportdb``, serta FQDN yang diekspos ke dunia luar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:43
msgid ""
"[literal]``uyuni-cert``: TLS certificate for the Ingress rule and needs to "
"have the public FQDN as Subject Alternate Name."
msgstr "[literal]``uyuni-cert``: Sertifikat TLS untuk aturan Ingress dan perlu memiliki FQDN publik sebagai Subject Alternate Name."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:44
msgid ""
"These secrets can be created using the [command]``kubectl create secret tls "
"-n $NAMESPACE`` command.  The certificate file passed to this command needs "
"to start with the server certificate followed by the chain of intermediary "
"CA certificates if any.  The root CAs are not needed in these secrets as "
"they are expected in ConfigMaps."
msgstr "Secret ini dapat dibuat menggunakan perintah [command]``kubectl create secret tls -n $NAMESPACE``. File sertifikat yang diteruskan ke perintah ini perlu dimulai dengan sertifikat server diikuti oleh rantai sertifikat CA perantara jika ada. CA root tidak diperlukan dalam secret ini karena diharapkan dalam ConfigMaps."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:45
msgid ""
"The Root CA certificate of [literal]``db-cert`` and [literal]``uyuni-cert`` "
"are expected in ConfigMaps named [literal]``db-ca`` and "
"[literal]``uyuni-ca`` stored in the [literal]``ca.crt`` key.  Those can be "
"created with a command like [command]``kubectl create cm -n $NAMESPACE db-ca "
"--from-file=ca.crt=/path/to/db-ca.crt``."
msgstr "Sertifikat Root CA dari [literal]``db-cert`` dan [literal]``uyuni-cert`` diharapkan dalam ConfigMaps bernama [literal]``db-ca`` dan [literal]``uyuni-ca`` yang disimpan dalam kunci [literal]``ca.crt``. Ini dapat dibuat dengan perintah seperti [command]``kubectl create cm -n $NAMESPACE db-ca --from-file=ca.crt=/path/to/db-ca.crt``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:47
msgid "The server chart defines volumes as Persistent Volume Claims (PVCs)."
msgstr "Bagan server mendefinisikan volume sebagai Persistent Volume Claims (PVC)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:48
msgid ""
"The creation of the underlying PVs is the responsibility of the cluster "
"administrators."
msgstr "Pembuatan PV yang mendasarinya adalah tanggung jawab administrator kluster."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:49
msgid "The PVCs use the [literal]``ReadWriteOnce`` access mode."
msgstr "PVC menggunakan mode akses [literal]``ReadWriteOnce``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:50
msgid ""
"The created PVCs can be tuned using {helm} chart values.  Each of the PVCs "
"can have the following values:"
msgstr "PVC yang dibuat dapat disetel menggunakan nilai bagan {helm}. Setiap PVC dapat memiliki nilai berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:52
msgid ""
"[literal]``storageClass``: can be used to select the storage class to use "
"for the PVC.  This can be useful to select faster storage for the database "
"or the packages storage."
msgstr "[literal]``storageClass``: dapat digunakan untuk memilih kelas penyimpanan yang akan digunakan untuk PVC. Ini dapat berguna untuk memilih penyimpanan yang lebih cepat untuk basis data atau penyimpanan paket."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:58
msgid ""
"Refer to the [literal]``server-helm`` README for the list of persistent "
"volume claims which will be created and will need to be bound to persistent "
"volumes."
msgstr "Lihat README [literal]``server-helm`` untuk daftar klaim volume persisten yang akan dibuat dan perlu diikat ke volume persisten."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:62
msgid ""
"{productname} requires some TCP and UDP ports to be routed to its services.  "
"Refer to the [literal]``server-helm`` README for the list of ports to be "
"exposed."
msgstr "{productname} memerlukan beberapa port TCP dan UDP untuk dirutekan ke layanannya. Lihat README [literal]``server-helm`` untuk daftar port yang akan diekspos."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:63
msgid ""
"RKE2 ships with nginx as the default ingress controller.  However, as this "
"is deprecated and soon to be unsupported, the [literal]``server-helm`` chart "
"defaults to use Traefik as ingress controller.  Using the nginx ingress "
"controller might work and will not be documented, use at your own risk."
msgstr "RKE2 menyertakan nginx sebagai pengendali ingress default. Namun, karena ini sudah ditinggalkan dan segera tidak akan didukung lagi, bagan [literal]``server-helm`` menggunakan Traefik sebagai pengendali ingress. Menggunakan pengendali ingress nginx mungkin berhasil dan tidak akan didokumentasikan, gunakan dengan risiko Anda sendiri."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:64
msgid ""
"The [literal]``server-helm`` chart supports Gateway API version 1.4.  Since "
"this requires experimental CRDs which are not shipped with RKE2 1.35, it is "
"not recommended to be used in production."
msgstr "Bagan [literal]``server-helm`` mendukung Gateway API versi 1.4. Karena ini memerlukan CRD eksperimental yang tidak disertakan dengan RKE2 1.35, tidak disarankan untuk digunakan dalam produksi."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"apiVersion: helm.cattle.io/v1\n"
"kind: HelmChartConfig\n"
"metadata:\n"
"  name: rke2-traefik\n"
"  namespace: kube-system\n"
"spec:\n"
"  valuesContent: |-\n"
"    ports:\n"
"      reportdb-pgsql:\n"
"        port: 5432\n"
"        expose:\n"
"          default: true\n"
"        exposedPort: 5432\n"
"        protocol: TCP\n"
"        hostPort: 5432\n"
"        containerPort: 5432\n"
"      salt-publish:\n"
"        port: 4505\n"
"        expose:\n"
"          default: true\n"
"        exposedPort: 4505\n"
"        protocol: TCP\n"
"        hostPort: 4505\n"
"        containerPort: 4505\n"
"      salt-request:\n"
"        port: 4506\n"
"        expose:\n"
"          default: true\n"
"        exposedPort: 4506\n"
"        protocol: TCP\n"
"        hostPort: 4506\n"
"        containerPort: 4506\n"
msgstr ""
"apiVersion: helm.cattle.io/v1\n"
"kind: HelmChartConfig\n"
"metadata:\n"
"  name: rke2-traefik\n"
"  namespace: kube-system\n"
"spec:\n"
"  valuesContent: |-\n"
"    ports:\n"
"      reportdb-pgsql:\n"
"        port: 5432\n"
"        expose:\n"
"          default: true\n"
"        exposedPort: 5432\n"
"        protocol: TCP\n"
"        hostPort: 5432\n"
"        containerPort: 5432\n"
"      salt-publish:\n"
"        port: 4505\n"
"        expose:\n"
"          default: true\n"
"        exposedPort: 4505\n"
"        protocol: TCP\n"
"        hostPort: 4505\n"
"        containerPort: 4505\n"
"      salt-request:\n"
"        port: 4506\n"
"        expose:\n"
"          default: true\n"
"        exposedPort: 4506\n"
"        protocol: TCP\n"
"        hostPort: 4506\n"
"        containerPort: 4506\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:68
msgid ""
"When using the server as a TFTP server there are a few issues to consider.  "
"TFTP is complex to expose from a {kube} pod due to the nature of the "
"protocol: the TFTP server receives requests on port 69, but negotiates "
"another random port to continue.  This port also needs to stay the same "
"through the whole session for the server to recognize the client as being "
"the same.  This means that there are only two possible ways to use the TFTP "
"server:"
msgstr "Ketika menggunakan server sebagai server TFTP ada beberapa masalah yang perlu dipertimbangkan. TFTP kompleks untuk diekspos dari pod {kube} karena sifat protokol: server TFTP menerima permintaan pada port 69, tetapi menegosiasikan port acak lain untuk melanjutkan. Port ini juga perlu tetap sama sepanjang sesi agar server mengenali klien sebagai sama. Ini berarti bahwa hanya ada dua cara yang mungkin untuk menggunakan server TFTP:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:71
msgid ""
"If Traefik is used as the ingress controller, the user needs access to "
"additional resources.  Add the following to the rules of the previously "
"defined role:"
msgstr "Jika Traefik digunakan sebagai pengendali ingress, pengguna memerlukan akses ke sumber daya tambahan. Tambahkan berikut ini ke aturan role yang sebelumnya didefinisikan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- apiGroups: [\"traefik.io\", \"traefik.containo.us\"]\n"
"  resources: [\"ingressroutetcps\", \"middlewares\"]\n"
"  verbs: [\"*\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"- apiGroups: [\"traefik.io\", \"traefik.containo.us\"]\n"
"  resources: [\"ingressroutetcps\", \"middlewares\"]\n"
"  verbs: [\"*\"]\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Security framework setup"
msgstr "Penyiapan kerangka keamanan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:76
msgid ""
"The main container of the server runs [command]``systemd`` even though this "
"is not a cloud native practice.  This means that the default Kubernetes "
"security profiles for this container are not sufficient.  There are two "
"possibilities to solve this issue:"
msgstr "Kontainer utama server menjalankan [command]``systemd`` meskipun ini bukan praktik cloud native. Ini berarti bahwa profil keamanan Kubernetes default untuk kontainer ini tidak cukup. Ada dua kemungkinan untuk menyelesaikan masalah ini:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:77
msgid ""
"run the main container as super privileged by setting the "
"[literal]``server.superPrivileged`` helm value to [literal]``true``,"
msgstr "jalankan kontainer utama sebagai super privileged dengan mengatur nilai helm [literal]``server.superPrivileged`` ke [literal]``true``,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:78
msgid "add custom policies or profile and use it for the container."
msgstr "tambahkan kebijakan atau profil khusus dan gunakan untuk kontainer."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:79
msgid ""
"Configuring SELinux or AppArmor is documented in the "
"[literal]``server-helm`` chart README, report to it for more details."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi SELinux atau AppArmor didokumentasikan di README bagan [literal]``server-helm``, laporkan ke sana untuk detail lebih lanjut."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:80
msgid ""
"Keep in mind, that running the container as super privileged is not the "
"safest thing to do."
msgstr "Perlu diingat, bahwa menjalankan kontainer sebagai super privileged bukanlah hal paling aman yang harus dilakukan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:82
msgid ""
"The [literal]``server-helm`` chart requires one value to be set: "
"[literal]``global.fqdn``.  The other values have sensible defaults, report "
"to the [literal]``server-helm`` chart README for more details on those."
msgstr "Bagan [literal]``server-helm`` memerlukan satu nilai untuk diatur: [literal]``global.fqdn``. Nilai lain memiliki default yang wajar, laporkan ke README bagan [literal]``server-helm`` untuk detail lebih lanjut tentang itu."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:83
msgid "The server can be installed with a command like the following:"
msgstr "Server dapat diinstal dengan perintah seperti berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"helm install smlm-server \\\n"
"     oci://registry.suse.com/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.2/server-helm \\\n"
"     -n $NAMESPACE \\\n"
"     --description \"Server installation\" \\\n"
"     --set \"global.fqdn=the.server.fqdn\" \\\n"
"     --set \"registrySecret=the-scc-secret\" \\\n"
"     --version {productchartversion}\n"
msgstr ""
"helm install smlm-server \\\n"
"     oci://registry.suse.com/suse/multi-linux-manager/5.2/server-helm \\\n"
"     -n $NAMESPACE \\\n"
"     --description \"Server installation\" \\\n"
"     --set \"global.fqdn=the.server.fqdn\" \\\n"
"     --set \"registrySecret=the-scc-secret\" \\\n"
"     --version {productchartversion}\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"helm install uyuni-server \\\n"
"     oci://registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server-helm \\\n"
"     -n $NAMESPACE \\\n"
"     --description \"Server installation\" \\\n"
"     --set \"global.fqdn=the.server.fqdn\" \\\n"
"     --version {productchartversion}\n"
msgstr ""
"helm install uyuni-server \\\n"
"     oci://registry.opensuse.org/uyuni/server-helm \\\n"
"     -n $NAMESPACE \\\n"
"     --description \"Server installation\" \\\n"
"     --set \"global.fqdn=the.server.fqdn\" \\\n"
"     --version {productchartversion}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:87
msgid ""
"As the main container is not fully cloud-native yet, it is sometimes useful "
"to get a terminal inside it.  This can be achieved using the following "
"commands.  Variables have been used here for the sake of readability, but it "
"could fit in a single line for convenience.  This could be used in place of "
"`mgrctl term` through the other pages of the documentation."
msgstr "Karena kontainer utama belum sepenuhnya cloud-native, terkadang berguna untuk mendapatkan terminal di dalamnya. Ini dapat dicapai menggunakan perintah berikut. Variabel telah digunakan di sini untuk kemudahan pembacaan, tetapi dapat masuk dalam satu baris untuk kenyamanan. Ini dapat digunakan sebagai pengganti `mgrctl term` melalui halaman lain dokumentasi."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"NAMESPACE=`kubectl get pod -A "
"-lapp.kubernetes.io/part-of=uyuni,app.kubernetes.io/component=server -o "
"\"jsonpath={.items[0].metadata.namespace}\"`\n"
"POD=`kubectl get pod -A "
"-lapp.kubernetes.io/part-of=uyuni,app.kubernetes.io/component=server -o "
"\"jsonpath={.items[0].metadata.name}\"`\n"
"kubectl exec -ti -n $NAMESPACE $POD -- bash\n"
msgstr ""
"NAMESPACE=`kubectl get pod -A -lapp.kubernetes.io/part-of=uyuni,app.kubernetes.io/component=server -o \"jsonpath={.items[0].metadata.namespace}\"`\n"
"POD=`kubectl get pod -A -lapp.kubernetes.io/part-of=uyuni,app.kubernetes.io/component=server -o \"jsonpath={.items[0].metadata.name}\"`\n"
"kubectl exec -ti -n $NAMESPACE $POD -- bash\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:90
msgid ""
"Some helm charts using the [literal]``server-helm`` chart can be found in "
"the [literal]``{gitchartsbranch}`` branch of the "
"https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni-charts/tree/{gitchartsbranch}[uyuni-charts] "
"git repository.  They show case how the TLS certificates can be generated "
"using [literal]``cert-manager`` and [literal]``trust-manager``.  Those "
"examples may assume to have {kube} cluster administrator permissions."
msgstr "Beberapa bagan helm yang menggunakan bagan [literal]``server-helm`` dapat ditemukan di cabang [literal]``{gitchartsbranch}`` dari repositori git https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni-charts/tree/{gitchartsbranch}[uyuni-charts]. Mereka menunjukkan bagaimana sertifikat TLS dapat dibuat menggunakan [literal]``cert-manager`` dan [literal]``trust-manager``. Contoh-contoh tersebut mungkin mengasumsikan memiliki izin administrator kluster {kube}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "Diagnostics / Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Diagnostik / Pemecahan Masalah"

#.  CB: TBD complete the troubleshooting section
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:93
msgid "Troubleshooting:"
msgstr "Pemecahan masalah:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:94
msgid ""
"Check the pods status and errors using [command]``kubectl get pod -n "
"$NAMESPACE`` and [command]``kubectl describe pod -n $NAMESPACE <POD NAME>``."
msgstr "Periksa status dan kesalahan pod menggunakan [command]``kubectl get pod -n $NAMESPACE`` dan [command]``kubectl describe pod -n $NAMESPACE <POD NAME>``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-kubernetes-deployment.adoc:95
msgid ""
"If the pods are ready, but Salt minions cannot access the master, check the "
"network configuration and how the ports are exposed."
msgstr "Jika pod siap, tetapi minion Salt tidak dapat mengakses master, periksa konfigurasi jaringan dan bagaimana port diekspos."

