#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:12
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy caches packages in the [path]``/var/cache/`` directory.  "
"If there is not enough space available in [path]``/var/cache/``, the proxy "
"will remove old, unused packages and replace them with newer packages."
msgstr "Proxy {productname} menyimpan paket dalam cache di direktori [path]``/var/cache/``. Jika tidak ada ruang yang cukup tersedia di [path]``/var/cache/``, proxy akan menghapus paket lama yang tidak digunakan dan menggantinya dengan paket yang lebih baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The larger [path]``/var/cache/`` directory is on the proxy, the less traffic "
"there will be between it and the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Semakin besar direktori [path]``/var/cache/`` pada proxy, semakin sedikit lalu lintas antara proxy dan Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:15
msgid ""
"By making the [path]``/var/cache/`` directory on the proxy the same size as "
"[path]``/var/spacewalk/`` on the {productname} Server, you avoid a large "
"amount of traffic after the first synchronization."
msgstr "Dengan membuat direktori [path]``/var/cache/`` pada proxy berukuran sama dengan [path]``/var/spacewalk/`` pada Server {productname}, Anda menghindari sejumlah besar lalu lintas setelah sinkronisasi pertama."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The [path]``/var/cache/`` directory can be small on the {productname} Server "
"compared to the proxy."
msgstr "Direktori [path]``/var/cache/`` dapat berukuran kecil pada Server {productname} dibandingkan dengan proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For a guide to size estimation, see the <<server-hardware-requirements>> "
"section."
msgstr "Untuk panduan estimasi ukuran, lihat bagian <<server-hardware-requirements>>."

