#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an Activation Key for the Proxy"
msgstr "Membuat Kunci Aktivasi untuk Proxy"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-actkey-bootstrap-proxy-mlm.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Activation Key"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Kunci Aktivasi"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-actkey-bootstrap-proxy-mlm.adoc:3
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[Activation Keys] , and click btn:[Create key]."
msgstr "Navigasikan ke menu:Systems[Activation Keys], dan klik btn:[Create key]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-actkey-bootstrap-proxy-mlm.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Create an activation key for the proxy host with {sl-micro} {microversion} "
"or {sles} {bci-mlm} as the parent channel.  This key should include all "
"recommended channels and the proxy as an extension child channel."
msgstr "Buat kunci aktivasi untuk host proxy dengan {sl-micro} {microversion} atau {sles} {bci-mlm} sebagai saluran induk. Kunci ini harus mencakup semua saluran yang direkomendasikan dan proxy sebagai saluran anak ekstensi."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-actkey-bootstrap-proxy-mlm.adoc:5
msgid "Proceed to boostrapping the proxy host as a [systemitem]``default`` client."
msgstr "Lanjutkan ke bootstrap host proxy sebagai klien [systemitem]``default``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-actkey-bootstrap-proxy-mlm.adoc:6
msgid "Ensure the Proxy is assigned only to original vendor channels."
msgstr "Pastikan Proxy hanya dialokasikan ke saluran vendor asli."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-actkey-bootstrap-proxy-mlm.adoc:7
msgid "Assigning cloned channels is not supported at this moment."
msgstr "Mengalokasikan saluran yang dikloning tidak didukung saat ini."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap the Proxy Host as a Client"
msgstr "Bootstrap Host Proxy sebagai Klien"

#.  On sl-micro, root login with password req
#.  FIXME: Adding link to end of prepare-micro-host.adoc?
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Bootstrapping the Proxy Host"
msgstr "Prosedur: Bootstrap Host Proxy"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:4
msgid "Fill in the fields for your proxy host."
msgstr "Isi bidang untuk host proxy Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:5
msgid "Select the activation key created in the previous step from the drop-down."
msgstr "Pilih kunci aktivasi yang dibuat di langkah sebelumnya dari daftar turun bawah."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:6
msgid "Click btn:[Bootstrap]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Bootstrap]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Wait for the bootstrap process to complete successfully.  Check the "
"menu:Salt[] menu and confirm the {salt} key is listed and accepted."
msgstr "Tunggu hingga proses bootstrap selesai dengan sukses. Periksa menu menu:Salt[] dan konfirmasi bahwa kunci {salt} terdaftar dan diterima."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:8
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:12
msgid "Reboot the proxy host if the operating system is {sl-micro}."
msgstr "Reboot host proxy jika sistem operasi adalah {sl-micro}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Select the host from the menu:System[] list and trigger a second reboot in "
"case of {sl-micro} after all events are finished to conclude the onboarding."
msgstr "Pilih host dari daftar menu:System[] dan trigger reboot kedua dalam kasus {sl-micro} setelah semua peristiwa selesai untuk menyelesaikan onboarding."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-bootstrap-proxy-client.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
