msgstr "Prosedur: Memperbarui Host Proxy"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-database-backup-volume.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database Backup Volume"
msgstr "Volume Backup Basis Data"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-database-backup-volume.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Server migration or upgrade with [command]``mgradm migration`` or "
"[command]``mgradm upgrade`` can create a volume with the database backup."
msgstr "Migrasi atau pemutakhiran server dengan [command]``mgradm migration`` atau [command]``mgradm upgrade`` dapat membuat volume dengan backup basis data."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-database-backup-volume.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When the {postgresql} database version is increased, the old database must "
"be stored in a separate location before running the upgrade.  For this "
"purpose [command]``mgradm`` dynamically creates the volume "
"[path]``var-pgsql-backup``.  When the migration or upgrade is done and the "
"user has validated that the new system is working as expected, this volume "
"can be removed safely."
msgstr "Ketika versi basis data {postgresql} ditingkatkan, basis data lama harus disimpan di lokasi terpisah sebelum menjalankan pemutakhiran. Untuk tujuan ini [command]``mgradm`` secara dinamis membuat volume [path]``var-pgsql-backup``. Ketika migrasi atau pemutakhiran selesai dan pengguna telah memvalidasi bahwa sistem baru berfungsi seperti yang diharapkan, volume ini dapat dihapus dengan aman."

