#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For the containerized {productname} Proxy, you must build a new proxy "
"configuration file and then redeploy the container for the changes to take "
"effect.  This is the process for updating settings, including the SSL "
"certificate."
msgstr "Untuk Proxy {productname} terkontainerisasi, Anda harus membuat file konfigurasi proxy baru dan kemudian menerapkan ulang kontainer agar perubahan berlaku. Ini adalah proses untuk memperbarui pengaturan, termasuk sertifikat SSL."

#. [NOTE]
#. ====
#. 2 GB represents the default proxy squid cache size.
#. This will need to be adjusted for your environment.
#. ====
#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For Podman deployment, the container host for the {productname} Proxy must "
"be registered as a client to the {productname} Server prior to generating "
"this proxy configuration."
msgstr "Untuk penerapan Podman, host kontainer untuk Proxy {productname} harus terdaftar sebagai klien ke Server {productname} sebelum membuat konfigurasi proxy ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:5
msgid ""
"If a proxy FQDN is used to generate a proxy container configuration that is "
"not a registered client (as in the Kubernetes use case), a new system entry "
"will appear in system list.  This new entry will be shown under previously "
"entered Proxy FQDN value and will be of [literal]``Foreign`` system type."
msgstr "Jika FQDN proxy digunakan untuk membuat konfigurasi kontainer proxy yang bukan klien terdaftar (seperti dalam kasus penggunaan Kubernetes), entri sistem baru akan muncul di daftar sistem. Entri baru ini akan ditampilkan di bawah nilai FQDN Proxy yang dimasukkan sebelumnya dan akan menjadi jenis sistem [literal]``Foreign``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Peripheral servers are always using third-party SSL certificates.  If the "
"hub server has generated the certificates for the peripheral server, it "
"needs to generate the certificate of each proxy too."
msgstr "Server periferal selalu menggunakan sertifikat SSL pihak ketiga. Jika server hub telah membuat sertifikat untuk server periferal, server tersebut perlu membuat sertifikat setiap proxy juga."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:7
msgid "On the hub server, run the following command."
msgstr "Pada server hub, jalankan perintah berikut."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"  --set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"  --set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=PROXY --set-cname=\"proxy.example.com\"\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"  --set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"  --set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=PROXY --set-cname=\"proxy.example.com\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:9
msgid "The files to use will be"
msgstr "File yang akan digunakan adalah"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:11
msgid ""
"[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/<hostname>/server.crt`` as the proxy certificate "
"and"
msgstr "[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/<hostname>/server.crt`` sebagai sertifikat proxy dan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:12
msgid ""
"[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/<hostname>/server.key`` as the proxy "
"certificate's key."
msgstr "[litteral]``/root/ssl-build/<hostname>/server.key`` sebagai kunci sertifikat proxy."

#.  tag::generate-proxy-config-section[]
#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the Proxy Configuration with {webui}"
msgstr "Membuat Konfigurasi Proxy dengan {webui}"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating a Proxy Container Configuration Using {webui}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Konfigurasi Kontainer Proxy Menggunakan {webui}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size [MB]`` field type maximal allowed "
"size for Squid cache. Recommended is to use at most 80% of available storage "
"for the containers."
msgstr "Di bidang [guimenu]``Max Squid cache size [MB]`` ketik ukuran maksimum yang diizinkan untuk cache Squid. Disarankan untuk menggunakan paling banyak 80% dari penyimpanan yang tersedia untuk kontainer."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSL certificate`` selection list choose if new server "
"certificate should be generated for {productname} Proxy or an existing one "
"should be used.  You can consider generated certificates as {productname} "
"builtin (self signed) certificates.  If {productname} server runs on {kube}, "
"the generated certificate option is not possible and replaced with no SSL "
"certificate as they are managed outside the containers."
msgstr "Di daftar pilihan [guimenu]``SSL certificate`` pilih apakah sertifikat server baru harus dibuat untuk Proxy {productname} atau yang sudah ada harus digunakan. Anda dapat menganggap sertifikat yang dibuat sebagai sertifikat builtin (ditandatangani sendiri) {productname}. Jika server {productname} berjalan di {kube}, opsi sertifikat yang dibuat tidak mungkin dan diganti dengan tanpa sertifikat SSL karena dikelola di luar kontainer."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The CA certificates generated by the server are stored in the "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/_data/ssl-build`` "
"directory."
msgstr "Sertifikat CA yang dibuat oleh server disimpan di direktori [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/root/_data/ssl-build``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Generate] to register a new proxy FQDN in the {productname} "
"Server and generate a configuration archive ([filename]``config.tar.gz``) "
"containing details for the container host."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Generate] untuk mendaftarkan FQDN proxy baru di Server {productname} dan membuat arsip konfigurasi ([filename]``config.tar.gz``) yang berisi detail untuk host kontainer."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:26
msgid ""
"After a few moments you are presented with file to download.  Save this file "
"locally."
msgstr "Setelah beberapa saat Anda disajikan dengan file untuk diunduh. Simpan file ini secara lokal."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate Proxy Configuration With [literal]``spacecmd`` and Self-Signed "
"Certificate"
msgstr "Membuat Konfigurasi Proxy Dengan [literal]``spacecmd`` dan Sertifikat Ditandatangani Sendiri"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:28
msgid ""
"You can generate a Proxy configuration using [literal]``spacecmd``.  This is "
"only possible if {productname} server runs on podman and has a self-signed "
"root CA certificate."
msgstr "Anda dapat membuat konfigurasi Proxy menggunakan [literal]``spacecmd``. Ini hanya mungkin jika server {productname} berjalan di podman dan memiliki sertifikat CA root yang ditandatangani sendiri."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Generating Proxy Configuration with spacecmd and Self-Signed "
"Certificate"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Konfigurasi Proxy dengan spacecmd dan Sertifikat Ditandatangani Sendiri"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:33
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:43
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:51
msgid "Copy the generated configuration from the server container:"
msgstr "Salin konfigurasi yang dibuat dari kontainer server:"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate Proxy Configuration With [literal]``spacecmd`` and Custom "
"Certificate"
msgstr "Membuat Konfigurasi Proxy Dengan [literal]``spacecmd`` dan Sertifikat Khusus"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:36
msgid ""
"You can generate a Proxy configuration using [literal]``spacecmd`` for "
"custom certificates rather than the default self-signed certificates."
msgstr "Anda dapat membuat konfigurasi Proxy menggunakan [literal]``spacecmd`` untuk sertifikat khusus daripada sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri default."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Generating Proxy Configuration with spacecmd and Custom "
"Certificate"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Konfigurasi Proxy dengan spacecmd dan Sertifikat Khusus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:39
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:49
msgid "Execute the following commands, replacing the Server and Proxy FQDN:"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah berikut, mengganti FQDN Server dan Proxy:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:41
msgid ""
"If your setup uses an intermediate CA, copy it as well and include it in the "
"command with the `-i` option (can be provided multiple times if needed) :"
msgstr "Jika penyiapan Anda menggunakan CA perantara, salin juga dan sertakan dalam perintah dengan opsi `-i` (dapat diberikan beberapa kali jika diperlukan):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl cp intermediateCA.pem server:/tmp/intermediateCA.pem\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config -- -p 8022 -i "
"/tmp/intermediateCA.pem pxy.example.com srv.example.com 2048 "
"email@example.com /tmp/ca.crt /tmp/proxy.crt /tmp/proxy.key -o "
"/tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl cp intermediateCA.pem server:/tmp/intermediateCA.pem\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config -- -p 8022 -i /tmp/intermediateCA.pem pxy.example.com srv.example.com 2048 email@example.com /tmp/ca.crt /tmp/proxy.crt /tmp/proxy.key -o /tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate Proxy Configuration With [literal]``spacecmd`` and no Certificate"
msgstr "Membuat Konfigurasi Proxy Dengan [literal]``spacecmd`` dan tanpa Sertifikat"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:46
msgid ""
"You can generate a Proxy configuration using [literal]``spacecmd`` with no "
"TLS certificates.  This is needed for {productname} running on {kube} as the "
"certificates are handled outside of the containers."
msgstr "Anda dapat membuat konfigurasi Proxy menggunakan [literal]``spacecmd`` tanpa sertifikat TLS. Ini diperlukan untuk {productname} yang berjalan di {kube} karena sertifikat ditangani di luar kontainer."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating Proxy Configuration with spacecmd and no Certificate"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Konfigurasi Proxy dengan spacecmd dan tanpa Sertifikat"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for f in ca.crt proxy.crt proxy.key; do\n"
"  mgrctl cp $f server:/tmp/$f\n"
"done\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config_nossl -- -p 8022 "
"pxy.example.com srv.example.com 2048 email@example.com -o "
"/tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"
msgstr ""
"for f in ca.crt proxy.crt proxy.key; do\n"
"  mgrctl cp $f server:/tmp/$f\n"
"done\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config_nossl -- -p 8022 pxy.example.com srv.example.com 2048 email@example.com -o /tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"

#.  end::generate-proxy-config-section[]
#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-hardened-tmpdir.adoc:1
msgid ""
"{productname} server hosts that are hardened for security may restrict "
"execution of files from the [path]``/tmp`` folder.  In such cases, as a "
"workaround, export the [literal]``TMPDIR`` environment variable to another "
"existing path before running [command]``mgradm``."
msgstr "Host server {productname} yang diperketat untuk keamanan mungkin membatasi eksekusi file dari folder [path]``/tmp``. Dalam kasus seperti itu, sebagai solusi, ekspor variabel lingkungan [literal]``TMPDIR`` ke jalur lain yang ada sebelum menjalankan [command]``mgradm``."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-hardened-tmpdir.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "export TMPDIR=/path/to/other/tmp\n"
msgstr "export TMPDIR=/path/to/other/tmp\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-hardened-tmpdir.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In {productname} updates, tools will be changed to make this workaround "
"unnecessary."
msgstr "Dalam pemutakhiran {productname}, alat akan diubah untuk membuat solusi ini tidak diperlukan."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-login-into-suse-registry.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"set +o history\n"
"echo SCC_MIRRORING_PASSWORD | podman login -u \"SCC_MIRRORING_USER\" "
"--password-stdin registry.suse.com\n"
"set -o history\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-note-deploy-certs.adoc:1
msgid ""
"If you want to use third-party SSL certificates instead of the self-signed "
"certificates, import them in the run of the following deployment procedure."
msgstr "Jika Anda ingin menggunakan sertifikat SSL pihak ketiga daripada sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri, impor dalam menjalankan prosedur penerapan berikut."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-note-deploy-certs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For more information about the requirements of third-party SSL certificates, "
"see xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang persyaratan sertifikat SSL pihak ketiga, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:1
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare {sl-micro} {microversion} Host"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Host {sl-micro} {microversion}"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:2
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download the installation media"
msgstr "Unduh media instalasi"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:3
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Downloading the installation media"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengunduh media instalasi"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:4
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Locate the {sl-micro} {microversion} installation media at "
"https://www.suse.com/download/sle-micro/, and download the appropriate media "
"file."
msgstr "Temukan media instalasi {sl-micro} {microversion} di https://www.suse.com/download/sle-micro/, dan unduh file media yang sesuai."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:5
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Prepare a DVD or USB flash drive with the downloaded [filename]``.iso`` "
"image for installation."
msgstr "Siapkan DVD atau USB flash drive dengan citra [filename]``.iso`` yang diunduh untuk instalasi."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:6
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {sl-micro} {microversion}"
msgstr "Instal {sl-micro} {microversion}"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:7
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing {sl-micro} {microversion}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal {sl-micro} {microversion}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:8
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Insert the DVD or USB flash drive (USB disk or key) containing the "
"installation image for {sle-micro} {microversion}."
msgstr "Masukkan DVD atau USB flash drive (disk USB atau kunci) yang berisi citra instalasi untuk {sle-micro} {microversion}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:9
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:9
msgid "Boot or reboot your system."
msgstr "Boot atau reboot sistem Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:10
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:10
msgid "Use the arrow keys to select [systemitem]``Installation``."
msgstr "Gunakan tombol panah untuk memilih [systemitem]``Installation``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:11
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:11
msgid "Adjust Keyboard and language."
msgstr "Sesuaikan Keyboard dan bahasa."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:12
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:12
msgid "Click the [systemitem]``checkbox`` to accept the license agreement."
msgstr "Klik [systemitem]``checkbox`` untuk menerima perjanjian lisensi."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:13
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:22
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:24
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:13
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:14
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:20
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:11
msgid "Click [systemitem]``Next`` to continue."
msgstr "Klik [systemitem]``Next`` untuk melanjutkan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Select the registration method.  For this example, we will register the "
"server with {scclongform}."
msgstr "Pilih metode pendaftaran. Untuk contoh ini, kami akan mendaftarkan server dengan {scclongform}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The {productname} {productnumber} containers are installed as extensions.  "
"Depending on the specific extension needed from the list below, additional "
"{scclongform} registration codes will be required for each."
msgstr "Kontainer {productname} {productnumber} diinstal sebagai ekstensi. Tergantung pada ekstensi spesifik yang diperlukan dari daftar di bawah ini, kode pendaftaran {scclongform} tambahan akan diperlukan untuk masing-masing."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:16
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Server"
msgstr "Server {productname} {productnumber}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:17
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Proxy"
msgstr "Proxy {productname} {productnumber}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:18
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Retail Branch Server"
msgstr "Server Retail Branch {productname} {productnumber}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:20
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:12
msgid "Enter your {scclongform} email address."
msgstr "Masukkan alamat email {scclongform} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:21
msgid "Enter your registration code for {sl-micro} {microversion}."
msgstr "Masukkan kode pendaftaran Anda untuk {sl-micro} {microversion}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:23
msgid ""
"To install a proxy, select the {productname} {productnumber} Proxy "
"extension; to install a server, select the {productname} {productnumber} "
"Server extension ``Checkbox``."
msgstr "Untuk menginstal proxy, pilih ekstensi Proxy {productname} {productnumber}; untuk menginstal server, pilih ekstensi Server {productname} {productnumber} ``Checkbox``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:25
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:21
msgid "Enter your {productname} {productnumber} extension registration code."
msgstr "Masukkan kode pendaftaran ekstensi {productname} {productnumber} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:26
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:15
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:22
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:16
msgid "Click btn:[Next] to continue."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Next] untuk melanjutkan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:27
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:16
msgid "On the [systemitem]``NTP Configuration`` page click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "Pada halaman [systemitem]``NTP Configuration`` klik btn:[Next]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:28
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On the [systemitem]``Authentication for the System`` page enter a password "
"for the root user.  Click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "Pada halaman [systemitem]``Authentication for the System`` masukkan kata sandi untuk pengguna root. Klik btn:[Next]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:29
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:18
msgid "On the [systemitem]``Installation Settings`` page click btn:[Install]."
msgstr "Pada halaman [systemitem]``Installation Settings`` klik btn:[Install]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:30
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:19
msgid ""
"This concludes installation of {sl-micro} {microversion} and {productname} "
"{productnumber} as an extension.  For more information about preparing your "
"machines (virtual or physical), see the "
"link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.1[{sl-micro} Deployment "
"Guide]."
msgstr "Ini menyimpulkan instalasi {sl-micro} {microversion} dan {productname} {productnumber} sebagai ekstensi. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang menyiapkan mesin Anda (virtual atau fisik), lihat link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.1/[Panduan Penerapan {sl-micro}]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:31
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONAL: Registration from the command line"
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Pendaftaran dari baris perintah"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:32
msgid ""
"If you added {productname} {productnumber} as an extension during {sl-micro} "
"{microversion} installation then you can skip this procedure.  However, "
"optionally you may skip registration during {sl-micro} {microversion} "
"installation by selecting the btn:[Skip Registration] button.  This section "
"provides steps on registering your products after {sl-micro} {microversion} "
"installation."
msgstr "Jika Anda menambahkan {productname} {productnumber} sebagai ekstensi selama instalasi {sl-micro} {microversion}, Anda dapat melewatkan prosedur ini. Namun, secara opsional Anda dapat melewatkan pendaftaran selama instalasi {sl-micro} {microversion} dengan memilih tombol btn:[Skip Registration]. Bagian ini menyediakan langkah-langkah untuk mendaftarkan produk Anda setelah instalasi {sl-micro} {microversion}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The following steps register a {productname} {productnumber} extension with "
"the {x86_64} architecture and thus require a registration code for the "
"{x86_64} architecture.  To register {arm} or {s390x} architectures use the "
"correct registration code."
msgstr "Langkah-langkah berikut mendaftarkan ekstensi {productname} {productnumber} dengan arsitektur {x86_64} dan karenanya memerlukan kode pendaftaran untuk arsitektur {x86_64}. Untuk mendaftarkan arsitektur {arm} atau {s390x}, gunakan kode pendaftaran yang benar."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:34
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering from the command line"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mendaftar dari baris perintah"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:35
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:34
msgid "List available extensions with the following command:"
msgstr "Daftarkan ekstensi yang tersedia dengan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update --quiet register --list-extensions\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:37
msgid "From the list of available extensions, select the one you wish to install:"
msgstr "Dari daftar ekstensi yang tersedia, pilih yang ingin Anda instal:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:38
msgid ""
"If installing the Server, use your {productname} Server Extension "
"{productnumber} x86_64 registration code with following command:"
msgstr "Jika menginstal Server, gunakan kode pendaftaran {productname} Server Extension {productnumber} x86_64 Anda dengan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transactional-update register -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Server/5.2/x86_64 -r "
"<reg_code>\n"
msgstr "transactional-update register -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Server/5.2/x86_64 -r <reg_code>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:40
msgid ""
"If installing the Proxy, use your {productname} Proxy Extension "
"{productnumber} x86_64 registration code with following command:"
msgstr "Jika menginstal Proxy, gunakan kode pendaftaran {productname} Proxy Extension {productnumber} x86_64 Anda dengan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transactional-update register -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Proxy/5.2/x86_64 -r "
"<reg_code>\n"
msgstr "transactional-update register -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Proxy/5.2/x86_64 -r <reg_code>\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:43
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update the system"
msgstr "Perbarui sistem"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:44
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating the system"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memperbarui sistem"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:45
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:22
msgid "Log in as *root*."
msgstr "Masuk sebagai *root*."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:46
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:23
msgid "Run **transactional-update**:"
msgstr "Jalankan **transactional-update**:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:49
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:26
msgid ""
"{sl-micro} is designed to update itself automatically by default and will "
"reboot after applying updates.  However, this behavior is not desirable for "
"the {productname} environment.  To prevent automatic updates on your server, "
"{productname} disables the transactional-update timer during the bootstrap "
"process."
msgstr "{sl-micro} dirancang untuk memperbarui dirinya sendiri secara otomatis secara default dan akan reboot setelah menerapkan pemutakhiran. Namun, perilaku ini tidak diinginkan untuk lingkungan {productname}. Untuk mencegah pemutakhiran otomatis pada server Anda, {productname} menonaktifkan timer transactional-update selama proses bootstrap."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:50
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:27
msgid ""
"If you prefer the {sl-micro} default behavior, enable the timer by running "
"the following command:"
msgstr "Jika Anda lebih menyukai perilaku default {sl-micro}, aktifkan timer dengan menjalankan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:51
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable --now transactional-update.timer\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Skip the registration. The {sl-micro} {microversion} entitlement is included "
"within the {productname} entitlement."
msgstr "Lewati pendaftaran. Hak {sl-micro} {microversion} disertakan dalam hak {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:1
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare {sles} {bci-mlm} host"
msgstr "Menyiapkan host {sles} {bci-mlm}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:2
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:2
msgid "Alternatively, you can deploy {productname} on {sles} {bci-mlm}."
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, Anda dapat menerapkan {productname} di {sles} {bci-mlm}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:3
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The following procedures describe the main steps of the installation "
"process."
msgstr "Prosedur berikut menjelaskan langkah-langkah utama proses instalasi."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:4
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {productname} extensions on {sles}"
msgstr "Instal ekstensi {productname} di {sles}"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:5
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing {productname} Extensions on {sles}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal Ekstensi {productname} di {sles}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:6
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Locate and download {sles} {bci-mlm} [literal]``.iso`` at "
"https://www.suse.com/download/sles/."
msgstr "Temukan dan unduh [literal]``.iso`` {sles} {bci-mlm} di https://www.suse.com/download/sles/."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Make sure that you have registration codes both for the host operating "
"system ({sles} {bci-mlm}) and extensions"
msgstr "Pastikan Anda memiliki kode pendaftaran baik untuk sistem operasi host ({sles} {bci-mlm}) maupun ekstensi"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:8
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:7
msgid "Start the installation of {sles} {bci-mlm}."
msgstr "Mulai instalasi {sles} {bci-mlm}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:9
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the [literal]``Language, keyboard and product selection`` select the "
"product to install."
msgstr "Pada [literal]``Language, keyboard and product selection`` pilih produk yang akan diinstal."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:10
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:9
msgid ""
"On the [literal]``License agreement`` read the agreement and check "
"[guimenu]``I Agree to the License Terms``."
msgstr "Pada [literal]``License agreement`` baca perjanjian dan centang [guimenu]``I Agree to the License Terms``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Select the registration method. For this example, we will register the "
"server with SUSE Customer Center."
msgstr "Pilih metode pendaftaran. Untuk contoh ini, kami akan mendaftarkan server dengan SUSE Customer Center."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:13
msgid "Enter your registration code for {sles} {bci-mlm}."
msgstr "Masukkan kode pendaftaran Anda untuk {sles} {bci-mlm}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Please note that for {sles} {bci-mlm}, you are required to have a valid "
"{sles} subscription and corresponding registration code, which you must "
"provide on this screen.  You will be required to enter the {productname} "
"Extension registration code below."
msgstr "Perlu dicatat bahwa untuk {sles} {bci-mlm}, Anda diharuskan memiliki langganan {sles} yang valid dan kode pendaftaran yang sesuai, yang harus Anda berikan di layar ini. Anda akan diminta untuk memasukkan kode pendaftaran Ekstensi {productname} di bawah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:16
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the screen [literal]``Extensions and Modules Selection`` check the "
"following:"
msgstr "Di layar [literal]``Extensions and Modules Selection`` centang berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Select the {productname} Server Extension to install the Server, or the "
"{productname} Proxy Extension to install the Proxy."
msgstr "Pilih {productname} Server Extension untuk menginstal Server, atau {productname} Proxy Extension untuk menginstal Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:18
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:14
msgid "Basesystem Module"
msgstr "Basesystem Module"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:19
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:15
msgid "Containers Module"
msgstr "Containers Module"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:24
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:18
msgid ""
"When the installation completes, log in to the newly installed server as "
"root."
msgstr "Ketika instalasi selesai, masuk ke server yang baru diinstal sebagai root."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:25
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Update the System (optional, if the system was not set to download updates "
"during install):"
msgstr "Perbarui Sistem (opsional, jika sistem tidak diatur untuk mengunduh pemutakhiran selama instalasi):"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:29
msgid ""
"If you added {productname} {productnumber} as an extension during {sles} "
"installation then you can skip this procedure."
msgstr "Jika Anda menambahkan {productname} {productnumber} sebagai ekstensi selama instalasi {sles}, Anda dapat melewatkan prosedur ini."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:30
msgid ""
"However, optionally you may skip registration during {sles} installation by "
"selecting the btn:[Skip Registration] button.  This section provides steps "
"on registering your products after {sles} installation."
msgstr "Namun, secara opsional Anda dapat melewatkan pendaftaran selama instalasi {sles} dengan memilih tombol btn:[Skip Registration]. Bagian ini menyediakan langkah-langkah untuk mendaftarkan produk Anda setelah instalasi {sles}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The following steps register a {productname} {productnumber} extension with "
"the {x86_64} architecture and thus require a registration code for the "
"{x86_64} architecture."
msgstr "Langkah-langkah berikut mendaftarkan ekstensi {productname} {productnumber} dengan arsitektur {x86_64} dan karenanya memerlukan kode pendaftaran untuk arsitektur {x86_64}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:32
msgid ""
"To register {arm} or {s390x} architectures use the correct registration "
"code."
msgstr "Untuk mendaftarkan arsitektur {arm} atau {s390x}, gunakan kode pendaftaran yang benar."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSEConnect --list-extensions\n"
msgstr "SUSEConnect --list-extensions\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:36
msgid "From the list of available extensions, select the one you wish to install."
msgstr "Dari daftar ekstensi yang tersedia, pilih yang ingin Anda instal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:37
msgid ""
"If installing the Server, use your {productname} Server Extension "
"{productnumber} x86_64 registration code."
msgstr "Jika menginstal Server, gunakan kode pendaftaran {productname} Server Extension {productnumber} x86_64 Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:38
msgid "For example for {sle} 15 SP7, use the following commands:"
msgstr "Misalnya untuk {sle} 15 SP7, gunakan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SUSEConnect -r <regcode>\n"
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-containers/15.7/x86_64\n"
"SUSEConnect -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Server-SLE/5.2/x86_64 -r <regcode>\n"
msgstr ""
"SUSEConnect -r <regcode>\n"
"SUSEConnect -p sle-module-containers/15.7/x86_64\n"
"SUSEConnect -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Server-SLE/5.2/x86_64 -r <regcode>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:40
msgid ""
"If installing the Proxy, use your {productname} Proxy Extension "
"{productnumber} x86_64 registration code with the following command:"
msgstr "Jika menginstal Proxy, gunakan kode pendaftaran {productname} Proxy Extension {productnumber} x86_64 Anda dengan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSEConnect -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Proxy-SLE/5.2/x86_64 -r <regcode>\n"
msgstr "SUSEConnect -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Proxy-SLE/5.2/x86_64 -r <regcode>\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install and enable [package]``podman``"
msgstr "Instal dan aktifkan [package]``podman``"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing [package]``podman``"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal [package]``podman``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:44
msgid "Log in as root and install the product package."
msgstr "Masuk sebagai root dan instal paket produk."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:45
msgid "On the server:"
msgstr "Pada server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper in podman\n"
"zypper in -t product Multi-Linux-Manager-Server-SLE\n"
msgstr ""
"zypper in podman\n"
"zypper in -t product Multi-Linux-Manager-Server-SLE\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:47
msgid "On the proxies:"
msgstr "Pada proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper in podman\n"
"zypper in -t product Multi-Linux-Manager-Proxy-SLE\n"
msgstr ""
"zypper in podman\n"
"zypper in -t product Multi-Linux-Manager-Proxy-SLE\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Before continuing, make sure that these packages are installed on the target "
"system:"
msgstr "Sebelum melanjutkan, pastikan bahwa paket-paket ini terinstal pada sistem target:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:51
msgid "server: [package]``mgradm``, [package]``mgradm-bash-completion``"
msgstr "server: [package]``mgradm``, [package]``mgradm-bash-completion``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:52
msgid "proxy: [package]``mgrpxy``, [package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion``"
msgstr "proxy: [package]``mgrpxy``, [package]``mgrpxy-bash-completion``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:53
msgid "Start the Podman service by rebooting the system, or running a command:"
msgstr "Mulai layanan Podman dengan me-reboot sistem, atau menjalankan perintah:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:10
msgid "Skip the registration."
msgstr "Lewati pendaftaran."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-proxy-host.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Please note that for {sles} {bci-mlm}, you are required to have a valid "
"{sles} subscription configured on the server."
msgstr "Perlu dicatat bahwa untuk {sles} {bci-mlm}, Anda diharuskan memiliki langganan {sles} yang valid dikonfigurasi di server."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ptf-loss-during-upgrade.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Risk of Automated Version Downgrade and PTF Loss*\n"
msgstr "*Risiko Penurunan Versi Otomatis dan Kehilangan PTF*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ptf-loss-during-upgrade.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Running the `mgradm upgrade podman` command when no newer upgrade is "
"available will cause the system to automatically revert to the base "
"version.  This process removes all currently applied Program Temporary Fixes "
"(PTFs) without a confirmation prompt."
msgstr "Menjalankan perintah `mgradm upgrade podman` ketika tidak ada pemutakhiran yang lebih baru tersedia akan menyebabkan sistem secara otomatis kembali ke versi dasar. Proses ini menghapus semua Program Temporary Fixes (PTF) yang saat ini diterapkan tanpa prompt konfirmasi."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ptf-loss-during-upgrade.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To avoid unintended data or fix loss, verify upgrade availability before "
"execution.  Future releases will include a confirmation prompt to prevent "
"this behavior."
msgstr "Untuk menghindari kehilangan data atau perbaikan yang tidak diinginkan, verifikasi ketersediaan pemutakhiran sebelum eksekusi. Rilis masa depan akan menyertakan prompt konfirmasi untuk mencegah perilaku ini."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register {sl-micro} and {productname} {productnumber} Proxy"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan {sl-micro} dan Proxy {productname} {productnumber}"

#.  Before starting obtain your SUSE Manager Registration Code from SUSE Customer Center - https://scc.suse.com.
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering {sl-micro} and {productname} {productnumber} Proxy"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mendaftarkan {sl-micro} dan Proxy {productname} {productnumber}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:8
msgid "Register {productname} {productnumber} Proxy with {scclongform}."
msgstr "Daftarkan Proxy {productname} {productnumber} dengan {scclongform}."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transactional-update register -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Proxy/5.2/x86_64 -r "
"<REGCODE>\n"
msgstr "transactional-update register -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Proxy/5.2/x86_64 -r <REGCODE>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information, see [command]``mgr-storage-proxy --help``.  This tool "
"simplifies creating the container volumes."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat [command]``mgr-storage-proxy --help``. Alat ini menyederhanakan pembuatan volume kontainer."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:20
msgid ""
"This command will move the persistent storage volumes at "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` to the specified storage "
"device."
msgstr "Perintah ini akan memindahkan volume penyimpanan persisten di [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` ke perangkat penyimpanan yang ditentukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:1
msgid ""
"SSL certificates are needed at a later stage.  If not using the self-signed "
"generated CA and certificates, ensure you have the following before "
"starting:"
msgstr "Sertifikat SSL diperlukan pada tahap selanjutnya. Jika tidak menggunakan CA dan sertifikat yang dibuat sendiri, pastikan Anda memiliki berikut ini sebelum memulai:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"A certificate authority (CA) SSL public certificate.  If you are using a CA "
"chain, all intermediate CAs must also be available."
msgstr "Sertifikat publik SSL otoritas sertifikat (CA). Jika Anda menggunakan rantai CA, semua CA perantara juga harus tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:3
msgid "An SSL database private key."
msgstr "Kunci privat basis data SSL."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:4
msgid "An SSL database certificate."
msgstr "Sertifikat basis data SSL."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:5
msgid "All files must be in PEM format."
msgstr "Semua file harus dalam format PEM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The hostname of the SSL server certificate must match the fully qualified "
"hostname of the machine you deploy them on.  You can set the hostnames in "
"the [literal]``X509v3 Subject Alternative Name`` section of the "
"certificate.  You can also list multiple hostnames if your environment "
"requires it.  Supported Key types are [literal]``RSA`` and [literal]``EC`` "
"(Elliptic Curve)."
msgstr "Nama host sertifikat SSL server harus cocok dengan nama host lengkap mesin yang Anda terapkan. Anda dapat mengatur nama host di bagian [literal]``X509v3 Subject Alternative Name`` dari sertifikat. Anda juga dapat mencantumkan beberapa nama host jika lingkungan Anda memerlukannya. Jenis Kunci yang didukung adalah [literal]``RSA`` dan [literal]``EC`` (Elliptic Curve)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Database SSL certificate requires [literal]``reportdb`` and [literal]``db`` "
"and the FQDN used to access the report database as [literal]``Subject "
"Alternative Name``."
msgstr "Sertifikat SSL basis data memerlukan [literal]``reportdb`` dan [literal]``db`` serta FQDN yang digunakan untuk mengakses basis data laporan sebagai [literal]``Subject Alternative Name``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-start-proxy.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Start and Check Proxy Status"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memulai dan Memeriksa Status Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:1
msgid "Deploy {productname}."
msgstr "Terapkan {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you use VM images as a migration target, here as the last step, execute "
"the command [command]``mgradm migrate`` instead of [command]``mgradm "
"install``."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan citra VM sebagai target migrasi, di sini sebagai langkah terakhir, jalankan perintah [command]``mgradm migrate`` alih-alih [command]``mgradm install``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Execute one of the following commands, depending on the SSL certificate "
"variant (self-signed or third-party).\n"
"  Replace `<FQDN>` with your fully qualified domain name of the "
"{productname} Server:\n"
msgstr ""
"Jalankan salah satu perintah berikut, tergantung pada varian sertifikat SSL (ditandatangani sendiri atau pihak ketiga).\n"
"  Ganti `<FQDN>` dengan nama domain lengkap Anda dari Server {productname}:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:4
msgid "Using self-signed certificates provided by {productname}:"
msgstr "Menggunakan sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri yang disediakan oleh {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm install podman <FQDN>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"With importing SSL certificates using third-party SSL certificate flags (the "
"example can adjusted if not all these certificates are needed):"
msgstr "Dengan mengimpor sertifikat SSL menggunakan flag sertifikat SSL pihak ketiga (contoh dapat disesuaikan jika tidak semua sertifikat ini diperlukan):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm install podman <FQDN> \\\n"
"  --ssl-ca-intermediate <strings> \\\n"
"  --ssl-ca-root <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-server-cert <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-server-key <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-db-ca-intermediate <strings> \\\n"
"  --ssl-db-ca-root <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-db-cert <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-db-key <string>\n"
msgstr ""
"mgradm install podman <FQDN> \\\n"
"  --ssl-ca-intermediate <strings> \\\n"
"  --ssl-ca-root <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-server-cert <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-server-key <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-db-ca-intermediate <strings> \\\n"
"  --ssl-db-ca-root <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-db-cert <string> \\\n"
"  --ssl-db-key <string>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-step-deploy-podman-certs.adoc:8
msgid "For more information, see [command]``mgradm install podman --help``."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat [command]``mgradm install podman --help``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-transfer_proxy_config.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The {webui} generates a configuration archive.  This archive needs to be "
"made available on the proxy container host."
msgstr "{webui} membuat arsip konfigurasi. Arsip ini perlu tersedia di host kontainer proxy."

#.  On sl-micro, root login with password req
#.  FIXME: Adding link to end of prepare-micro-host.adoc?
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-transfer_proxy_config.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Copying the Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyalin Konfigurasi Proxy"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-transfer_proxy_config.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If not already done, copy the configuration archive "
"([literal]``config.tar.gz``) generated in the previous step from the server "
"container to the server host:"
msgstr "Jika belum dilakukan, salin arsip konfigurasi ([literal]``config.tar.gz``) yang dibuat di langkah sebelumnya dari kontainer server ke host server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-transfer_proxy_config.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl cp server:/root/config.tar.gz .\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-transfer_proxy_config.adoc:6
msgid "If not already done, copy the files from the server host to the proxy host:"
msgstr "Jika belum dilakukan, salin file dari host server ke host proxy:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-warn-images-sl-micro.adoc:1
msgid ""
"Customized {productname} {productnumber} VM images are provided only for "
"{sl-micro} {microversion}.  To run the product on {sles} {bci-mlm}, use the "
"standard {sles} {bci-mlm} installation media available at "
"https://www.suse.com/download/sles/ and enable the {productname} "
"{productnumber} extensions on top of it."
msgstr "Citra VM {productname} {productnumber} yang disesuaikan hanya disediakan untuk {sl-micro} {microversion}. Untuk menjalankan produk di {sles} {bci-mlm}, gunakan media instalasi {sles} {bci-mlm} standar yang tersedia di https://www.suse.com/download/sles/ dan aktifkan ekstensi {productname} {productnumber} di atasnya."
